msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module enhances the <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar</a> "
"module by providing fast access to all the administrative links at the "
"top of your site. Admin Toolbar remains a very \"lightweight\" module "
"by closely integrating with all Toolbar functionality. It can be used "
"in conjunction with all the sub modules included on Admin Toolbar, for "
"quick access to system commands such as Flush all caches, <a "
"href=\":automated_cron\">Run cron</a>, Run Updates, etc."
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar modulua <a href=\":toolbar\">Toolbar</a> moduluari "
"hobekuntza ematen dio, zure gunean dagoen goiko aldean administrazio "
"esteka guztiak azkar eskuratzeko. Admin Toolbar modu \"arinki\" "
"mantentzen da, Toolbar funtzionalitate guztiekin modu estuan "
"integratuz. Admin Toolbar moduluan sartzen diren azpimodu guztiekin "
"batera erabili daiteke, sistemako aginduetara azkar sartzeko, hala "
"nola cache guztiak garbitzea, <a href=\":automated_cron\">Cron "
"exekutatzea</a>, eguneratzeak exekutatzea, eta abar."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar greatly improves the user experience for those who "
"regularly interact with the site Toolbar by providing fast, full "
"access to all links in the site Toolbar without having to click to get "
"there."
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar-ek nabarmen hobetzen du erabiltzailearen esperientzia "
"gunearen Toolbar-rarekin etengabe elkarreragiten dutenentzat, azkar "
"eta osorik sartzeko aukera emanez gunearen Toolbar-eko esteka "
"guztietara, klik egin beharrik gabe bertara iristeko."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter module provides a workaround for "
"the common problem that users with <em>Use the administration pages "
"and help</em> permission see menu links they done not have access "
"permission for."
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter modulua irtenbide bat eskaintzen du "
"arazo ohiko baterako: <em>Administrazio orriak eta laguntza "
"erabiltzeko</em> baimena duten erabiltzaileek baimenik ez duten menu "
"estekak ikusten dituztenean."

msgid ""
"To use Admin Toolbar Extra Tools just install it like any other "
"module. There is no other configuration required."
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar Extra Tools erabiltzeko, modu berean instalatu besterik "
"ez duzu egin behar, beste edozein modulu bezala. Bestelako "
"konfiguraziorik ez da behar."

msgid "Flush twig cache"
msgstr "Twig cache-a garbitu"

msgid "Twig cache cleared."
msgstr "Twig cache-a garbitu da."

msgid "Provides an improved drop-down menu interface to the site Toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Gunearen Toolbarrari hobetu drop-down menu interfaze bat eskaintzen "
"du."

msgid "Admin Toolbar Search"
msgstr "Admin Tresna-barra Bilaketa"

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar Extra Tools module comes packaged with the <a "
"href=\":admin-toolbar\">Admin Toolbar</a> module and adds "
"functionality to it. The additional functionality is accessed through "
"extra links on the main administration Toolbar. Some links to Admin "
"Toolbar Extra Tools administration pages are located at the bottom of "
"this page.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar Extra Tools moduluak <a href=\":admin-toolbar\">Admin "
"Toolbar</a> moduluekin batera dator eta funtzionaltasuna gehitzen dio. "
"Funtzionaltasun osagarri hori administrazio nagusiaren Toolbar-eko "
"lotura gehigarri batzuen bidez eskuratzen da. Admin Toolbar Extra "
"Tools-en administrazio orrietara doazen gaurkotze batzuk orri honen "
"behealdean daude kokatuta.</a>"

