msgid ""
"This page gives an overview of all available challenge types, "
"generated with their current settings."
msgstr ""
"Orrialde honek eskuragarri dauden erronka mota guztiak aurkezten ditu, "
"haien ezarpen eguneratuekin sortuak."

msgid "10 more examples of this challenge."
msgstr "Erronka honen beste 10 adibide gehiago."

msgid ""
"\"CAPTCHA\" is an acronym for \"Completely Automated Public Turing "
"test to tell Computers and Humans Apart\". It is typically a "
"challenge-response test to determine whether the user is human. The "
"CAPTCHA module is a tool to fight automated submission by malicious "
"users (spamming) of for example comments forms, user registration "
"forms, guestbook forms, etc. You can extend the desired forms with an "
"additional challenge, which should be easy for a human to solve "
"correctly, but hard enough to keep automated scripts and spam bots "
"out."
msgstr ""
"\"CAPTCHA\" \"Ordenagailuak eta Gizakiak Banatzeko Automatikoki "
"Osatutako Publiko Turing Probak\" (Completely Automated Public Turing "
"test to tell Computers and Humans Apart) izenaren laburdura da. Oro "
"har, erabiltzailea gizakia den jakiteko erronka-erantzun proba bat da. "
"CAPTCHA moduluak tresna bat da erabiltzaile maltzurren (spamaren) "
"bidalketa automatikoa saihesteko, adibidez, iruzkin formularioak, "
"erabiltzaile-erregistro formularioak, gonbidatu-liburu formularioak, "
"eta abar. Formulario nahi direnak erronka osagarri batez zabaldu "
"ditzakezu, gizaki batek erraz konpontzeko modukoa izan behar duena, "
"baina nahikoa zaila automatizatutako skriptek eta spam botek atzera "
"bota daitezen."

msgid "CAPTCHA is a trademark of Carnegie Mellon University."
msgstr "CAPTCHA Carnegie Mellon Unibertsitatearen marka komertziala da."

msgid "CAPTCHA"
msgstr "CAPTCHA"

msgid "Enabled challenge"
msgstr "Aktibatutako erronka"

