msgid "What code is in the image?"
msgstr "Irudiak zein kode daraman?"

msgid "Provides an image based CAPTCHA."
msgstr "Irudi batean oinarritutako CAPTCHA eskaintzen du."

msgid "Enable statistics"
msgstr "Aktibatu estatistikak"

msgid "File format"
msgstr "Fitxategi formatua"

msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Letra-tipoa"

msgid ""
"This option enables bilinear interpolation of the distortion which "
"makes the image look smoother, but it is more CPU intensive."
msgstr ""
"Aukera honek okerren interpolazio bilinearra gaitzen du, irudia "
"leunagoa bihurtuz, baina CPU baliabide gehiago kontsumitzen ditu."

msgid "Add salt and pepper noise"
msgstr "Gehitu gatza eta piper hauts-ihesa"

msgid ""
"The image CAPTCHA is a popular challenge where a random textual code "
"is obfuscated in an image. The image is generated on the fly for each "
"request, which is rather CPU intensive for the server. Be careful with "
"the size and computation related settings."
msgstr ""
"Irudi CAPTCHA-a erronka ezaguna da, non testu kode ausazko bat irudi "
"batean nahasten den. Irudia eskaria bakoitzeko unean bertan sortzen "
"da, eta hau zerbitzariarentzako CPU baliabide asko eskatzen du. Kontu "
