"Add the default views column classes like views-col, col-1 and "
"clearfix to the output. You can use this to quickly reduce the amount "
"of markup the view provides by default, at the cost of making it more "
"difficult to apply CSS."
msgstr ""
"Gehitu ikuskera lehenetsiaren zutabe-klaseak, hala nola views-col, "
"col-1 eta clearfix irteerara. Hau erabil dezakezu ikuskera lehenetsiak "
"ematen duen markatze-kantitatea azkar murrizteko, baina, horrek CSS "
"aplikatzea zailago bihurtzen du."

msgid "Custom column class"
msgstr "Zutabe klase pertsonalizatua"

msgid "Additional classes to provide on each column. Separated by a space."
msgstr "Kolon bakoitzean emateko klase osagarriak. Hutsune batez bereizita."

msgid "Default row classes"
msgstr "Ilara lehenetsiko klaseak"

msgid ""
"Adds the default views row classes like views-row, row-1 and clearfix "
"to the output. You can use this to quickly reduce the amount of markup "
"the view provides by default, at the cost of making it more difficult "
"to apply CSS."
msgstr ""
"Ikuspegiaren errendaketan, ikuspegiaren lehenetsi ikuskizun-lerro "
"klaseak gehitzen ditu, hala nola views-row, row-1 eta clearfix. Hau "
"erabil dezakezu ikuspegia lehenetsi moduan ematen duen markup kopurua "
"azkar murrizteko, CSS aplikatzea zailago bihurtzeko kostuarekin."

msgid "Custom row class"
msgstr "Errenkada klase pertsonalizatua"

msgid "Additional classes to provide on each row. Separated by a space."
msgstr "Errenkadaka emateko klase gehigarriak. Espazio batez banatuta."

