msgid "Managing and displaying link fields"
msgstr "Estekak kudeatzea eta erakustea"

msgid "Adding link text"
msgstr "Lotura testua gehitzea"

msgid ""
"In the field settings you can define additional link text to be "
"<em>optional</em> or <em>required</em> in any link field."
msgstr ""
"Eremuaren ezarpenetan, beste esteka testu bat defini dezakezu "
"<em>aukerako</em> edo <em>beharrezko</em> gisa edozein esteka "
"eremutan."

msgid "Displaying link text"
msgstr "Estekaren testua erakusten"

msgid ""
"If link text has been submitted for a URL, then by default this link "
"text is displayed as a link to the URL. If you want to display both "
"the link text <em>and</em> the URL, choose the appropriate link format "
"from the drop-down menu in the <em>Manage display</em> page. If you "
"only want to display the URL even if link text has been submitted, "
"choose <em>Link</em> as the format, and then change its <em>Format "
"settings</em> to display <em>URL only</em>."
msgstr ""
"URL baterako esteka testua bidalia badago, lehenetsita esteka testu "
"hori URL-ra esteka gisa erakusten da. Esteka testua <em>eta</em> URL-a "
"biek erakutsi nahi badituzu, aukeratu esteka formatu egokia "
"<em>Bistaratzeko kudeatu</em> orrialdeko goitibeherako menuan. Esteka "
"testua bidalia egon arren, URL-a bakarrik erakutsi nahi baduzu, "
"aukeratu <em>Esteka</em> formatu gisa, eta ondoren aldatu bere "
"<em>Formatu ezarpenak</em> <em>URL bakarrik</em> erakusteko."

msgid "Adding attributes to links"
msgstr "Estekei atributuak gehitzea"

msgid ""
"You can add attributes to links, by changing the <em>Format "
"settings</em> in the <em>Manage display</em> page. Adding "
"<em>rel=\"nofollow\"</em> notifies search engines that links should "
"not be followed."
msgstr ""
"Loturei atributuak gehitu diezazkiekezu, <em>Format settings</em> "
"aldatuz <em>Manage display</em> orrian. <em>rel=\"nofollow\"</em> "
"gehituz bilatzaileei jakinarazten zaie loturak jarraitu behar ez "
"dituztela."

