msgid ""
"Unless you're experiencing problems with pagers related to this field, "
"you should leave this at 0. If using multiple pagers on one page you "
"may need to set this number to a higher value so as not to conflict "
"within the ?page= array. Large values will add a lot of commas to your "
"URLs, so avoid if possible."
msgstr ""
"Baliteke eremu honekin lotutako orriztatzaileekin arazoak izaten ez "
"badituzu, hau 0-n utzi beharko zenuke. Orrialde batean orriztatzaile "
"anitz erabiltzen badituzu, baliteke zenbaki hau handitu behar izatea "
"?page= arrayan talka ez izan dezan. Balio handiek komaz betetako URL "
"asko gehituko dituzte, beraz, ahal bada, saihestu."

