msgid ""
"Drupal is unable to generate highly randomized numbers, which means "
"certain security features like password reset URLs are not as secure "
"as they should be. Instead, only a slow, less-secure fallback "
"generator is available. See the <a href=\":drupal-php\">system "
"requirements</a> page for more information. %exception_message"
msgstr ""
"Drupal-ek ezin ditu oso ausazko zenbakiak sortu, horrek esan nahi du "
"pasahitz berreskuratzeko URL bezalako segurtasun ezaugarriak ez direla "
"behar adina seguruak. Horren ordez, bakarrik eskuragarri dago motela "
"eta segurtasun gutxiago duen aukera bat. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, "
"ikusi <a href=\":drupal-php\">sistemaren eskakizunen</a> orrialdea. "
