msgid ""
"When a new media item is created, the Media module records basic "
"information about it, including the author, date of creation, and the "
"<a href=\":media-type\">media type</a>. It also manages the "
"<em>publishing options</em>, which define whether or not the item is "
"published. Default settings can be configured for each type of media "
"on your site."
msgstr ""
"Prentsa berri bat sortzen denean, Media moduluak oinarrizko "
"informazioa jasotzen du horri buruz, egilearen, sortze dataren eta <a "
"href=\":media-type\">prentsa motaren</a> barne. Era berean, "
"<em>argitalpen aukerak</em> kudeatzen ditu, zeinak zehazten duten "
"elementua argitaratzen den edo ez. Lehenetsitako ezarpenak zure guneko "
"prentsa mota bakoitzerako konfiguratu daitezke."

msgid "Creating custom media types"
msgstr "Mezu mota pertsonalizatuak sortzea"

msgid ""
"The Media module gives users with the <em>Administer media types</em> "
"permission the ability to <a href=\":media-new\">create new media "
"types</a> in addition to the default ones already configured. Each "
"media type has an associated media source (such as the image source) "
"which support thumbnail generation and metadata extraction. Fields "
"managed by the <a href=\":field\">Field module</a> may be added for "
"storing that metadata, such as width and height, as well as any other "
"associated values."
msgstr ""
"Media modulua <em>Media motak kudeatu</em> baimena duten "
"erabiltzaileei aukera ematen die <a href=\":media-new\">media mota "
"berriak sortzeko</a>, lehenetsitakoak gain. Media mota bakoitzak media "
"iturri bat du lotuta (adibidez, irudi iturria) eta horrek miniaturak "
"sortzea eta metadatuak ateratzea onartzen du. <a href=\":field\">Eremu "
"modulua</a> kudeatutako eremuak gehitu daitezke metadatu horiek "
"gordetzeko, hala nola zabalera eta altuera, baita lotutako bestelako "
"balio guztiak ere."

msgid ""
"The Media module also enables you to create multiple versions of any "
"media item, and revert to older versions using the <em>Revision "
"information</em> settings."
msgstr ""
"Media modulua aukera ematen dizu baita ere edozein media elementuren "
"bertsio anitz sortzeko, eta <em>Revision information</em> ezarpenak "
"erabiliz bertsio zaharragoetara itzultzeko."

msgid ""
"The Media module makes a number of permissions available, which can be "
"set by role on the <a href=\":permissions\">permissions page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Media modulua hainbat baimen eskaintzen ditu, eta hauek rolaren "
"arabera ezar daitezke <a href=\":permissions\">baimen orrialdean</a>."

msgid "Manage media types."
msgstr "Kudeatu inguruko motak."

msgid "Administer media types"
msgstr "Medien motak kudeatu"

msgid "Update own media"
msgstr "Eguneratu zure media propioa"

msgid "Delete own media"
msgstr "Zure media ezabatu"

msgid "View all media revisions"
msgstr "Ikusi media-berrikuntza guztiak"

msgid "To view a revision, you also need permission to view the media item."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa bat ikusteko, media elementua ikusteko baimena ere behar "
"duzu."

msgid "Full URI to a folder where the media icons will be installed"
msgstr "Media ikonoak instalatuko diren karpeta baten URI osoa"

msgid "Whether the thumbnail downloads should be queued"
msgstr "Thumbnail-ak deskargatzea ilaran jarri behar den ala ez"

msgid "Media source settings"
msgstr ""
"Euskarazko itzulpena:\n"
"\n"
"Eduki iturriaren ezarpenak"

msgid "\"File\" media source configuration"
msgstr "\"Fitxategi\" media iturria konfigurazioa"

msgid "\"Image\" media source configuration"
msgstr "\"Irudi\" hedapen iturriaren konfigurazioa"

msgid "Edit %type_label @label"
msgstr "Editatu %type_label @label"

msgid "@type %label has been created."
msgstr "@type %label sortu da."

msgid "@type %label has been updated."
msgstr "@type %label eguneratu da."

msgid "@type: added %label."
msgstr "@type: gehitutako %label."

msgid "@type: updated %label."
msgstr "@type: eguneratutako %label."

msgid "- Create -"
msgstr "- Sortu -"

msgid ""
"Select the field that will store essential information about the media "
"item. If \"Create\" is selected a new field will be automatically "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratu multimedia elementuari buruzko informazio garrantzitsua "
"gordeko duen eremua. \"Sortu\" hautatzen bada, eremu berria "
"automatikoki sortuko da."

msgid ""
"%field_type field will be automatically created on this type to store "
"the essential information about the media item."
msgstr ""
"%field_type eremua automatikoki sortuko da motore honen barruan, media "
"elementuari buruzko informazio funtsezkoa gordetzeko."

msgid ""
"%field_name field is used to store the essential information about the "
"media item."
msgstr ""
"%field_name eremua media elementuari buruzko oinarrizko informazioa "
"gordetzeko erabiltzen da."

msgid ""
"Media source that is responsible for additional logic related to this "
"media type."
msgstr "Media iturria mota honi buruzko logika osagarria arduratzen dena."

msgid "Media source configuration"
msgstr "Edukia iturrien konfigurazioa"

msgid ""
"Media sources can provide metadata fields such as title, caption, size "
"information, credits, etc. Media can automatically save this metadata "
"information to entity fields, which can be configured below. "
"Information will only be mapped if the entity field is empty."
msgstr ""
"Eduki iturriak metadatu eremuak eman ditzakete, hala nola izenburua, "
"azpititulua, tamainaren informazioa, kredituak, eta abar. Edukiak "
"metadatu informazio hau automatikoki gorde dezake entitate eremuetan, "
"eta hauek behean konfiguratu daitezke. Informazioa mapatuko da soilik "
"entitate eremua hutsik badago."

msgid "Media will be automatically published when created."
msgstr "Sorkuntza egitean, Media automatikoki argitaratuko da."

msgid ""
"Automatically create new revisions. Users with the \"Administer "
"media\" permission will be able to override this option."
msgstr ""
"Automatikoki sortu berrikuspen berriak. \"Administratu multimedia\" "
"baimena duten erabiltzaileek aukera hau gainditu ahal izango dute."

msgid ""
"Download thumbnails via a queue. When using remote media sources, the "
"thumbnail generation could be a slow process. Using a queue allows for "
"this process to be handled in the background."
msgstr ""
"Deskargatu miniaturak ilaran zehar. Atariko media iturriak "
"erabiltzean, miniatura sortzea prozesu motel samarra izan daiteke. "
"Ilara bat erabiltzeak prozesu hau atzealdean kudeatzea ahalbidetzen "
"du."

msgid "The media type %name has been updated."
msgstr "%s media motaren eguneratua izan da."

msgid "The media type %name has been added."
msgstr "%name media mota gehitu da."

msgid "Added media type %name."
msgstr "%name media mota gehitu da."

msgid "No media types available. <a href=\":url\">Add media type</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ez da media motarik eskuragarri. <a href=\":url\">Gehitu media "
"mota</a>."

msgid "The thumbnail of the media item."
msgstr "Media-elementuaren miniatura."

msgid "The time the media item was created."
msgstr "Eduki multimedia elementua sortu zen momentua."

msgid "The time the media item was last edited."
msgstr "Mezu mediatikoaren azken aldaketa egindako unea."

msgid "media type"
msgstr "media mota"

msgid "media types"
msgstr "hedapen mota batzuk"

msgid ""
"%type is used by @count media item on your site. You can not remove "
"this media type until you have removed all of the %type media items."
msgid_plural ""
"%type is used by @count media items on your site. You can not remove "
"this media type until you have removed all of the %type media items."
msgstr[0] ""
"%type erabiltzen da zure guneko @count media elementuetan. Ez duzu "
"media mota hau ezabatu ahal %type media elementu guztiak ezabatzen ez "
"dituzun artean.  \n"
"%type erabiltzen da zure guneko @count media "
"elementuetan. Ez duzu media mota hau ezabatu ahal %type media elementu "
"guztiak ezabatzen ez dituzun artean."

msgid "Linked to media item"
msgstr "Medien elementuari lotuta"

msgid "Use local files for reusable media."
msgstr "Erabili tokiko fitxategiak berrerabilgarri diren medioetarako."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Menu settings."
msgstr "Menuaren ezarpenak."

msgid ""
"You can only change the menu settings for the <em>published</em> "
"version of this content."
msgstr ""
"Edukien bertsio <em>argitaratuarentzat</em> soilik aldatu ditzakezu "
"menuaren ezarpenak."

msgid "To view a revision, you also need permission to view the content item."
msgstr "Berrikuspen bat ikusteko, edukia ikusteko baimena ere behar duzu."

msgid ""
"To revert a revision, you also need permission to edit the content "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa bat atzera egiteko, eduki elementua editatzeko baimena ere "
"behar duzu."

msgid ""
"To delete a revision, you also need permission to delete the content "
"item."
msgstr "Berrikuspen bat ezabatzeko, edukia ezabatzeko baimena ere behar duzu."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Path alias."
msgstr "Bide izena."

msgid ""
"You can only change the URL alias for the <em>published</em> version "
"of this content."
msgstr ""
"Eduki honen bertsio <em>argitaratua</em>ren URL aliasa bakarrik aldatu "
"dezakezu."

msgid ""
"REST support for content types (provided by the <a "
"href=\":node\">Node</a> module) is enabled by default. To enable "
"support for other content entity types, you can use a <a "
"href=\":config\" target=\"blank\">process based on configuration "
"editing</a> or the contributed <a href=\":restui\">REST UI module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Edukien motetarako REST laguntza (emaiten duena <a "
"href=\":node\">Node</a> modulua) lehenetsita dago aktibatuta. Beste "
"edukien entitate mota batzuk aktibatzeko, erabil dezakezu <a "
"href=\":config\" target=\"blank\">konfigurazio editatzean "
"oinarritutako prozesu bat</a> edo babestutako <a href=\":restui\">REST "
"UI modulua</a>."

msgid "Limited date range"
msgstr "Data tarte mugatua"

msgid "Your PHP installation has a limited date range."
msgstr "Zure PHP instalazioak data tarte mugatua du."

msgid ""
"You are running on a system where PHP is compiled or limited to using "
"32-bit integers. This will limit the range of dates and timestamps to "
"the years 1901-2038. Read about the <a href=\":url\">limitations of "
"32-bit PHP</a>."
msgstr ""
"PHP 32 bit-eko zenbaki osoak erabiltzera mugatuta dagoen edo "
"konpilatuta dagoen sistema batean ari zara exekutatzen. Honek data eta "
"ordu-txandaren artean mugak ezarriko ditu 1901-2038 urteetan. Irakurri "
"<a href=\":url\">32 bit-eko PHParen mugak</a> buruz."

msgid "A client error happened"
msgstr "Bezeroaren akats bat gertatu da"

msgid ""
"To run cron from outside the site, go to <a href=\":cron\" "
"class=\"system-cron-settings__link\">@cron</a>"
msgstr ""
"Webgunetik kanpo cron exekutatu nahi izanez gero, jo <a href=\":cron\" "
"class=\"system-cron-settings__link\">@cron</a> helbidera."

msgid "Run times of individual cron jobs will be written to watchdog"
msgstr "Cron lan indibidualen exekuzio denborak watchdog-era idatziko dira"

msgid "Delete temporary files after"
msgstr "Altxatu fitxategi behin-behinekoak ondoren"

msgid ""
"Temporary files are not referenced, but are in the file system and "
"therefore may show up in administrative lists. "
"<strong>Warning:</strong> If enabled, temporary files will be "
"permanently deleted and may not be recoverable."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi temporalak ez dira aipatzen, baina fitxategi sisteman daude "
"eta, beraz, administrazio zerrendetan ager daitezke. "
"<strong>Oharrak:</strong> Gaituta badago, fitxategi temporalak behin "
"betiko ezabatuko dira eta ezin izan daitezke berreskuratu."

msgid "Add the @label role to the selected user(s)"
msgstr "Hautatutako erabiltzaileari(eri) @label rola gehitu"

msgid "Remove the @label role from the selected user(s)"
msgstr "Aldatu hautatutako erabiltzaile(tar)etik @label rola ezabatzeko"

msgid ""
"This workflow is in use. You cannot remove this workflow until you "
"have removed all content using it."
msgstr ""
"Lan fluxu hau erabileran dago. Ez duzu lan fluxu hau ezin kendu arte "
"bertan erabiltzen den edukia guztia kendu ez baduzu."

msgid "Edit %label workflow"
msgstr "%label lan-fluxua editatu"

msgid ""
"This workflow state is in use. You cannot remove this workflow state "
"until you have removed all content using it."
msgstr ""
"Fluxu-lan honetako egoera erabileran dago. Egoera hau ezingo duzu "
"ezabatu, haren erabilerazko edukirik ezabatu arte."

msgid "Find and manage comments."
msgstr "Aurkitu eta kudeatu iruzkinak."

msgid "The approved comments listing."
msgstr "Onartutako iruzkinen zerrenda."

msgid "Comments published"
msgstr "Argitaratutako iruzkinak"

msgid "The unapproved comments listing."
msgstr "Baiezpenerik gabeko iruzkinak zerrendatzea."

msgid "Comments unapproved"
msgstr "Iruzkinak onartu gabeak"

msgid "{{ message }}"
msgstr "{{ message }}"

