msgid ""
"On the <a href=\":cache-settings\">Performance page</a>, you can "
"configure how long browsers and proxies may cache pages based on the "
"Cache-Control header; this setting is ignored by the Internal Page "
"Cache module, which caches pages permanently until invalidation, "
"unless they carry an Expires header. There is no other configuration."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":cache-settings\">Errendimendu orrian</a>, nabigatzaileek "
"eta proxyek zenbat denbora gorde dezaketen orriak Cache-Control "
"goiburuaren arabera konfiguratu dezakezu; ezarpen hau Internal Page "
"Cache modulua alde batera uzten du, modulua orriak behin betiko "
"gordetzen ditu baliogabetu arte, Expires goiburu bat daramatzaten "
"kasuak izan ezik. Beste ezarpenik ez dago."

msgid ""
"The Settings Tray module allows users with the <a "
"href=\":administer_block_permission\">Administer blocks</a> and <a "
"href=\":contextual_permission\">Use contextual links</a> permissions "
"to edit blocks without visiting a separate page. For more information, "
"see the <a href=\":handbook_url\">online documentation for the "
"Settings Tray module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Settings Tray moduluak <a "
"href=\":administer_block_permission\">Blokeak kudeatu</a> eta <a "
"href=\":contextual_permission\">Testuinguru loturak erabili</a> "
"baimenak dituzten erabiltzaileei baimentzen die blokeak beste orri "
"batera joan gabe editatu ditzaten. Informazio gehiago nahi izanez "
"gero, begiratu <a href=\":handbook_url\">Settings Tray modulurako "
"lineako dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "Editing blocks in place"
msgstr "Blokeak bertan editatzea"

msgid ""
"To edit blocks in place, either click the <strong>Edit</strong> button "
"in the toolbar and then click on the block, or choose \"Quick edit\" "
"from the block's contextual link. (See the <a "
"href=\":contextual\">Contextual Links module help</a> for more "
"information about how to use contextual links.)"
msgstr ""
"Blokeak bertan bertan editatzeko, sakatu tresnabarreko "
"<strong>Editatu</strong> botoia eta gero blokean klik egin, edo "
"hautatu \"Editatu azkar\" blokearen testuinguru-estekatik. (Ikusi <a "
"href=\":contextual\">Testuinguru Estekak moduluko laguntza</a> "
"testuinguruestekak erabiltzeko informazio gehiago izateko.)"

msgid ""
"The Settings Tray for the block will open in a sidebar, with a compact "
