msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Entity untranslatable fields"
msgstr "Entitate itzultzerik gabeko eremuak"

msgid ""
"The Content Moderation module allows you to expand on Drupal's "
"\"unpublished\" and \"published\" states for content. It allows you to "
"have a published version that is live, but have a separate working "
"copy that is undergoing review before it is published. This is "
"achieved by using <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to apply "
"different states and transitions to entities as needed. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":content_moderation\">online "
"documentation for the Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Edukiaren Moderazio modulua Drupal-eko edukien \"argitaratu gabeko\" "
"eta \"argitaratutako\" egoerak zabaltzea ahalbidetzen du. Bizian "
"dagoen argitaratutako bertsio bat izatea uzten du, baina argitaratu "
"aurretik berrikuspen prozesu bat jasaten ari den kopia lana bereizi "
"bat izatea ahalbidetzen du. Hau lortzen da behar diren entitateei "
"egoera eta trantsizio desberdinak aplikatzeko <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Lan-fluxuak</a> erabiliz. Informazio gehiago "
"lortzeko, ikus <a href=\":content_moderation\">Edukiaren Moderazio "
"moduluko lineako dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "Applying workflows"
msgstr "Lan fluxuak aplikatzea"

msgid "Moderating content"
msgstr "Edukiaren moderazioa"

msgid ""
"You can view a list of content awaiting moderation on the <a "
"href=\":moderated\">moderated content page</a>. This will show any "
"content in an unpublished state, such as Draft or Archived, to help "
"surface content that requires more work from content editors."
msgstr ""
"<b>Itzulpena:</b>  \n"
"Edukia moderaziorako zain duten eduki zerrenda "
"bat ikus dezakezu <a href=\":moderated\">eduki moderatuaren "
"orrian</a>. Honek argitaratu gabeko egoeran dagoen eduki oro "
"erakutsiko du, hala nola Zirriborro edo Artxibatua, eduki editoreek "
"gehiago lan egin behar duten edukia azaleratzeko lagungarria izateko."

msgid ""
"Each transition is exposed as a permission. If a user has the "
"permission for a transition, they can use the transition to change the "
"state of the content item, from Draft to Published."
msgstr ""
"Trantsizio bakoitza baimen gisa agertzen da. Erabiltzaile batek "
"trantsiziorako baimena badu, trantsizioa erabil dezake eduki "
"elementuaren egoera aldatzeko, Zirriborrotik Argitaraturaino."

