msgstr "Menuko zuhaitzaren hierarkia."

msgid ""
"You can only change the hierarchy for the <em>published</em> version "
"of this menu link."
msgstr ""
"Menu lotura honen <em>sargaitutako</em> bertsioaren hierarkia bakarrik "
"alda dezakezu."

msgid ""
"%capital_name contains 1 menu link with pending revisions. "
"Manipulation of a menu tree having links with pending revisions is not "
"supported, but you can re-enable manipulation by getting each menu "
"link to a published state."
msgid_plural ""
"%capital_name contains @count menu links with pending revisions. "
"Manipulation of a menu tree having links with pending revisions is not "
"supported, but you can re-enable manipulation by getting each menu "
"link to a published state."
msgstr[0] ""
"%capital_name menu esteka 1 du zain dauden bertsioekin. Zain dauden "
"bertsioak dituen menuaren egitura manipulatzeko ez da onartzen, baina "
"berriz martxan jar dezakezu menu esteka bakoitza argitaratuta dagoen "
"egoerara eramanez.  \n"
"%capital_name-k @count menu esteka ditu zain "
"dauden bertsioekin. Zain dauden bertsioak dituen menuaren egitura "
