msgstr ""
"Guraso eguneratuak dituzten terminoak beste erabiltzaile batek aldatu "
"ditu, eta aldaketak ezin izan dira gorde."

msgid ""
"%capital_name contains 1 term with pending revisions. Drag and drop of "
"terms with pending revisions is not supported, but you can re-enable "
"drag-and-drop support by getting each term to a published state."
msgid_plural ""
"%capital_name contains @count terms with pending revisions. Drag and "
"drop of terms with pending revisions is not supported, but you can "
"re-enable drag-and-drop support by getting each term to a published "
"state."
msgstr[0] ""
"%capital_name-k 1 aldaketa zain duen termino dauka. Aldaketa zain "
"dituzten terminoen drag and drop-a ez dago onartuta, baina drag and "
"drop gaitasuna berriro aktiba dezakezu termino bakoitza argitaratuta "
"jarriz.  \n"
"%capital_name-k @count aldaketa zain dituzten termino "
"dauzka. Aldaketa zain dituzten terminoen drag and drop-a ez dago "
"onartuta, baina drag and drop gaitasuna berriro aktiba dezakezu "
"termino bakoitza argitaratuta jarriz."

msgid ""
"You can only change the hierarchy for the <em>published</em> version "
"of this term."
msgstr ""
"Terminu honen <em>argitaratutako</em> bertsioaren hierarkia bakarrik "
"alda dezakezu."

msgid "Use the toolbar"
msgstr "Erabili tresnabarra"

msgid "Link to display"
msgstr "Erakusteko esteka"

msgid ""
"Displays a link to a path-based display of this view while keeping the "
"filter criteria, sort criteria, pager settings and contextual filters."
msgstr ""
"Ikuspegi honen bide batean oinarritutako bertsio baten esteka "
"erakusten du, filtro irizpideak, sailkapen irizpideak, orrialdatze "
"ezarpenak eta testuinguru filtroak mantenduz."

msgid "The display ID of the view display to link to."
msgstr "Ikuspegiaren bistaratzearen IDa estekatzeko."

msgid "Is Latest Translation Affected Revision"
msgstr "Azken Itzulpenak Afectatutako Berrikuspena Duen"

msgid ""
"Restrict the view to only revisions that are the latest translation "
"affected revision of their entity."
msgstr ""
"Ikuspegia mugatu entitatearen azken itzulpen eragina duten "
"berrikuspenak bakarrik erakusteko."

msgid ""
"To make sure the results are the same when switching to the other "
"display, it is recommended to make sure the display:"
msgstr ""
"Bestelako bistara aldatzean emaitzak berdinak izatea bermatzeko, "
"gomendatzen da display hori ziurtatzea:"

msgid "Has a path."
msgstr "Bide bat dauka."

msgid "Has the same filter criteria."
msgstr "Bera filter-irizpideak ditu."

msgid "Has the same sort criteria."
msgstr "Antzeko iragazteko irizpideak ditu."

msgid "Has the same pager settings."
msgstr "Berrogei orrialdeko konfigurazio berberak ditu."

msgid "Has the same contextual filters."
msgstr "Testuinguru-iragazki berdinak ditu."

msgid "There are no path-based displays available."
msgstr "Bidez oinarritutako bistaratzeak ez daude eskuragarri."

msgid ""
"%current_display: The link in the %area area has no configured "
