msgid ""
"The CKEditor 5 migration enabled the following plugins to support tags "
"that are allowed by the %text_format text format: "
"%enabling_message_content. The text format must be saved to make these "
"changes active."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5eko migrazioak hurrengo pluginak gaitzea ahalbidetu zuen, "
"%text_format testu-formatuak onartzen dituen etiketei laguntza "
"emateko: %enabling_message_content. Testu-formatua gorde behar da "
"aldaketa hauek aktibatzeko."

msgid ""
"The following tags were permitted by the %text_format text format's "
"filter configuration, but no plugin was available that supports them. "
"To ensure the tags remain supported by this text format, the following "
"were added to the Source Editing plugin's <em>Manually editable HTML "
"tags</em>: @unsupported_string. The text format must be saved to make "
"these changes active."
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo etiketa hauek %text_format testu formatuko iragazkiaren "
"konfigurazioak onartu zituen, baina ez zegoen haiek onartzen zuen "
"pluginik erabilgarri. Etiketak testu formato honek jarraitu ditzala "
"bermatzeko, hauek gehitu ziren Source Editing pluginaren <em>Manually "
"editable HTML tags</em> atalera: @unsupported_string. Aldaketa hauek "
"aktibo izan daitezen, testu formatoa gorde behar da."

msgid ""
"The CKEditor 5 migration process enabled the following plugins to "
"support specific attributes that are allowed by the %text_format text "
"format: %enabled_for_attributes_message_content."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5eko migrazio prozesuak honako plugin hauek gaitzea "
"ahalbidetu zuen, %text_format testu-formatuak onartzen dituen atributu "
"espezifikoak laguntzeko: %enabled_for_attributes_message_content."

msgid ""
"As part of migrating to CKEditor 5, it was found that the %text_format "
"text format's HTML filters includes plugins that support the following "
"tags, but not some of their attributes. To ensure these attributes "
"remain supported, the following were added to the Source Editing "
"plugin's <em>Manually editable HTML tags</em>: @missing_attributes. "
"The text format must be saved to make these changes active."
msgstr ""
"CKEditor 5-era migratzean, %text_format testu-formatuko HTML "
"iragazkiek etiketa hauek onartzen dituzten pluginak barne hartzen "
"dituztela aurkitu zen, baina ez zituzten bere atributu batzuk "
"onartzen. Atributu hauek onartzen jarraitzeko, honako hauek gehitu "
"ziren Source Editing pluginaren <em>Manually editable HTML tags</em> "
"atalera: @missing_attributes. Testu-formatua gorde egin behar da "
"aldaketa hauek aktibo egon daitezen."

msgid ""
"As part of migrating the %text_format text format to CKEditor 5, the "
"following tag(s) were added to <em>Limit allowed HTML tags and correct "
"faulty HTML</em>, because they are needed to provide fundamental "
"CKEditor 5 functionality : @missing_tags. The text format must be "
"saved to make these changes active."
msgstr ""
"%text_format testu-formatua CKEditor 5-era migratzean, honako etiketak "
"gehitu dira <em>Onartutako HTML etiketak mugatu eta ataza duten "
"HTML-ak zuzendu</em> atalera, CKEditor 5 funtzionaltasun oinarrizkoak "
"emateko beharrezkoak direlako: @missing_tags. Testu-formatua gorde "
"behar da aldaketa hauek aktibatzeko."

