msgstr "Denbora diferentzia gisa erakutsi (adibidez, '6 hilabete lehenago')"

msgid ""
"Use the <code>@interval</code> placeholder to represent the formatted "
"time difference interval. E.g. <code>@interval hence</code> will be "
"displayed as <em>2 hours 5 minutes hence</em>."
msgstr ""
"Erabili <code>@interval</code> lekukoa formateatutako "
"denbora-tartearen aldearen ordez. Adibidez, <code>@interval "
"hence</code> honela erakutsiko da: <em>2 ordu 5 minutu barru</em>."

msgid ""
"Use the <code>@interval</code> placeholder to represent the formatted "
"time difference interval. E.g. <code>@interval ago</code> will be "
"displayed as <em>2 hours 5 minutes ago</em>."
msgstr ""
"Erabili <code>@interval</code> leku-hartzailea denbora-diferentzia "
"formatatua adierazteko. Adibidez, <code>@interval ago</code> honela "
"erakutsiko da: <em>2 ordu 5 minutu lehenago</em>."

msgid ""
"How many time units will be used in formatting the time difference. "
"For example, if '1' is selected then the displayed time difference "
"will only contain a single time unit such as '2 years' or '5 minutes' "
"never '2 years 3 months' or '5 minutes 8 seconds'."
msgstr ""
"Denbora-diferentzia formatatzeko zenbat denbora-unitate erabiliko "
"diren. Adibidez, '1' aukeratzen bada, bistaratuko den "
"denbora-diferentziak denbora-unitate bakarra izango du, hala nola '2 "
"urte' edo '5 minutu', baina ez inoiz '2 urte 3 hilabete' edo '5 minutu "
"8 segundu'."

msgid ""
"How often to refresh the displayed time difference. The time "
"difference is refreshed on client-side, by JavaScript, without "
"reloading the page."
msgstr ""
"Ezarritako denbora-diferentzia eguneratzeko maiztasuna. "
"Denbora-diferentzia bezero-aldean eguneratzen da, JavaScript bidez, "
"orria birkargatu gabe."

msgid "Fallback configuration"
msgstr "Ezarpen alternatiboa"

msgid ""
"The configuration below is used as a fallback when JavaScript is not "
"available on the page."
msgstr ""
"Beheko konfigurazioa erabiltzen da JavaScript orrialdean ez dagoenean "
"erabiltzeko."

msgid ""
"Select the date format to be used for the title and displayed on mouse "
"hover."
msgstr ""
"Izenburuarentzako eta saguaren gainean jartzean bistaratuko den data "
"formatua hautatu."

msgid "- No tooltip -"
msgstr "- Ez dago aholkuontzirik -"

msgid "Displayed as a time difference"
msgstr "Denbora-alderak bezala erakusia"

msgid "Refresh every @interval"
msgstr "Berritu @interval bakoitzean"

msgid "Disabled JavaScript format: @date_format"
msgstr "Gaituta gabeko JavaScript formatua: @date_format"

msgid "Tooltip date format: @date_format"
msgstr "Tresna-laginaren data formatua: @date_format"

msgid "Reference type: @entity_type"
msgstr "Erreferentzia mota: @entity_type"

msgid "The submitted value %choice in the %name element is not allowed."
msgstr "%sarrera %choice %name elementuan ez da onartzen."

msgid ""
"The image toolkit '@toolkit' failed processing '@operation' for image "
"'@image'. Reported error: @class - @message"
msgstr ""
"Irudi-tresnak '@toolkit' huts egin du '@operation' prozesatzean "
"'@image' irudirako. Aitorritako errorea: @class - @message"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Plugin exists"
msgstr "Plugin-a existitzen da"

msgid "The '@plugin_id' plugin does not exist."
msgstr "'@plugin_id' plugin-a ez dago."

msgid "The '@plugin_id' plugin must implement or extend @interface."
msgstr "'@plugin_id' plugina @interface inplementatu edo luzatu behar du."

msgid "Optimized assets files"
msgstr "Optimizatutako asetak fitxategiak"

msgid "Public local optimized assets files served by the webserver."
msgstr ""
"Web zerbitzariak zerbitzatutako tokiko optimizatutako jabetza "
"publikoak."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Valid mapping keys"
msgstr "Baliozko mapaketa giltzarrak"

msgid "'@key' is not a supported key."
msgstr "'@key' ez da onartutako gako bat."

msgid "Numerically indexed arrays are not allowed."
msgstr "Zenbaki bidez indexatutako array-ak ez dira onartzen."

msgid "Edit machine name"
msgstr "Makina-izena editatu"

msgid ""
"The Announcements module displays announcements from the Drupal "
"community. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":documentation\">online documentation for the Announcements "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Drupal komunitatearen iragarkiak erakusten ditu Announcements modulua. "
"Informazio gehiagorako, ikus <a href=\":documentation\">Announcements "
"modulearen lineako dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "Accessing announcements"
msgstr "Iragarpenetara sartzea"

msgid "Displays announcements from the Drupal community."
msgstr "Drupal komunitatearen iragarkiak erakusten ditu."

msgid "View official announcements related to Drupal"
msgstr "Drupal-ekin lotutako iragarki ofizialak ikusi"

msgid "Community announcements"
msgstr "Komunitatearen iragarkiak"

msgid "Announcements Settings"
msgstr "Jakinarazpenen Ezarpenak"

msgid "Cache announcements for max-age seconds."
msgstr "Cache iragarkiak max-age segundoko iraungitzearekin."

msgid "Cron interval for fetching announcements in seconds."
msgstr "Oharak jasotzeko cron tartea segundutan."

msgid "Number of announcements that will be displayed."
msgstr "Erakutsiko diren iragarki kopurua."

msgid "The feed format is not valid."
msgstr "Elikagaiaren formatua ez da baliogarria."

msgid ""
"An error occurred while parsing the announcements feed, check the logs "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Oharretarako feed-a aztertzen akatsa gertatu da, informazio gehiago "
"lortzeko egiaztatu log-ak."

msgid "No announcements available"
msgstr "Ez dago iragarpenik erabilgarri."

msgid "Allows banning visits from specific IP addresses."
msgstr "Baimena ematen du bisitak debekatzeko IP helbide zehatz batzuetatik."

msgid "Provides an HTTP Basic authentication provider."
msgstr "HTTP Basic autentifikazio hornitzaile bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Adding content blocks"
msgstr "Edukia blokeak gehitzea"

msgid ""
"You can add content blocks, if the <em>Block Content</em> module is "
"installed. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":blockcontent-help\">Block Content help page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Edukia blokeak gehitu ditzakezu, <em>Block Content</em> modulua "
"instalatuta badago. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, ikusi <a "
"href=\":blockcontent-help\">Block Content laguntza orria</a>."

msgid ""
"Allows users to configure blocks (containing content, forms, etc.) and "
"to place them in the regions of a theme."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek blokeak (edukia, inprimakiak, eta abar edukitzen "
"dituztenak) konfiguratzea eta gai baten eremuetan jartzea ahalbidetzen "
"du."

msgid "Creating and managing block types"
msgstr "Bloke motak sortzea eta kudeatzea"

msgid "Creating content blocks"
msgstr "Edukia blokeak sortzea"

msgid "Allows the creation of content blocks and block types."
msgstr "Eduki blokeak eta bloke mota berriak sortzea ahalbidetzen du."

msgid ""
"Create and manage fields, forms, and display settings for your content "
"blocks."
msgstr ""
"Sortu eta kudeatu eremuak, inprimakiak eta zure edukien blokeen "
"bistaratze ezarpenak."

msgid "Access the Content blocks overview page"
msgstr "Egin klik Eduki blokeen ikuskapen orrialdera sartzeko"

msgid "Get an overview of all content blocks."
msgstr "Jaso eduki-bloke guztien ikuspegi orokorra."

msgid ""
"Maintain the block types of block content available and the fields "
"that are associated with those types."
msgstr ""
"Mantendu erabilgarri dauden bloke-edukien bloke mota eta mota horiekin "
"lotuta dauden eremuak."

msgid ""
"View, edit and delete all block content regardless of permission "
"restrictions."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi, editatu eta ezabatu bloke-eduki guztia baimen-mugak kontuan "
"hartu gabe."

msgid "Edit content block %label"
msgstr "Edukia aldatu %label blokean"

msgid "%type_name: Create new content block"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki bloke berria sortu"

msgid "%type_name: Edit content block"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki-blokea editatu"

msgid "%type_name: Delete content block"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki-blokea ezabatu"

msgid "%type_name: View content block history pages"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki-blokearen ikuspegiaren historia orriak"

msgid "%type_name: Revert content block revisions"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki-blokeen berrikuspenak atzera bota"

msgid "%type_name: Delete content block revisions"
msgstr "%type_name: Eduki-blokeen bertsioak ezabatu"

msgid "Edit %label block type"
msgstr "Editatu %label bloke mota"

msgid "Block type %label has been updated."
msgstr "%label bloke mota eguneratu da."

msgid "Block type %label has been added."
msgstr "%label bloke mota gehitu da."

msgid "Add %type content block"
msgstr "Gehitu %type edukia blokea"

msgid "Content block ID"
msgstr "Eduki blokearen IDa"

msgid "The content block ID."
msgstr "Edukien blokearen ID-a."

msgid "The content block UUID."
msgstr "Eduki-blokearen UUID-a."

msgid "The content block language code."
msgstr "Eduki blokearen hizkuntza kodea."

msgid "The time that the content block was last edited."
msgstr "Azken aldiz editu zen edukia blokean."

msgid "content block"
msgstr "eduki blokea"

msgid "content blocks"
msgstr "eduki blokeak"

msgid "block type"
msgstr "bloke mota"

msgid "block types"
msgstr "bloke motak"

msgid ""
"%label is used by 1 content block on your site. You can not remove "
"this block type until you have removed all of the %label blocks."
msgid_plural ""
"%label is used by @count content blocks on your site. You may not "
"remove %label until you have removed all of the %label content blocks."
msgstr[0] ""
"%label zure webgunean 1 edukiblockek erabiltzen dute. Ezingo duzu "
"blokearen mota hau ezabatu %label block guztiak kendu arte.  \n"
"%label "
"zure webgunean @count edukiblockek erabiltzen dute. Ezingo duzu %label "
"kendu %label edukiblock guztiak kendu arte."

msgid ""
"Block with uuid %uuid does not exist. <a href=\":url\">Add content "
"block</a>."
msgstr ""
"%uuid duen blokeak ez du existitzen. <a href=\":url\">Gehitu edukia "
"bloke</a>."

msgid "Input format of the content block/box content."
msgstr "Edukio bloke/kutxa baten edukien sarrera-formatua."

msgid "Add a <a href=\":url\">content block</a>."
msgstr "Gehitu <a href=\":url\">eduki bloke</a>."

msgid "Provides the CKEditor 5 rich text editor."
msgstr "CKEditor 5 testu aberatsa editore gisa eskaintzen du."

msgid "Language label"
msgstr "Hizkuntza etiketa"

msgid "Images can only be uploaded."
msgstr "Irudiak bakarrik igo daitezke."

msgid "Images can only be added by URL."
msgstr "Irudiak URL bidez bakarrik gehitu daitezke."

msgid ""
"A list of programming languages that will be provided in the \"Code "
"Block\" dropdown. Enter one value per line, in the format key|label. "
"Example: php|PHP."
msgstr ""
"Programazio lengoaien zerrenda bat emango da \"Code Block\" "
"dropdown-ean. Sartu balio bat lerro bakoitzeko, formatuan key|label. "
"Adibidez: php|PHP."

msgid ""
"Line @line-number does not contain a valid value. Enter a valid "
"language key followed by a pipe symbol and a label."
msgid_plural ""
"Lines @line-numbers do not contain a valid value. Enter a valid "
"language key followed by a pipe symbol and a label."
msgstr[0] ""
"@line-number lerroak ez dauka balio zuzena. Sartu hizkuntza giltza "
"zuzena, ondoren hesi ikurra eta etiketaren bat.  \n"
"@line-numbers "
"lerroek ez dute balio zuzena. Sartu hizkuntza giltza zuzena, ondoren "
"hesi ikurra eta etiketaren bat."

msgid "Allows importing and exporting configuration changes."
msgstr "Konfigurazioko aldaketak inportatu eta esportatzea ahalbidetzen du."

msgid ""
"Content Moderation allows you to apply <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows</a> to content, content blocks, and "
"other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with "
"background on content entities\">content entities</a>, to provide more "
"fine-grained publishing options. For example, a Basic page might have "
"states such as Draft and Published, with allowed transitions such as "
"Draft to Published (making the current revision \"live\"), and "
"Published to Draft (making a new draft revision of published content)."
msgstr ""
"Edukiaren Moderazioa <a href=\":workflows\">Lan-fluxuak</a> "
"aplikatzeko aukera ematen dizu edukiari, edukien blokeei eta beste <a "
"href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on "
"content entities\">eduki-entitateei</a>, argitalpen aukerak "
"zehatzagoak izan daitezen. Adibidez, Oinarrizko orri batek egoerak "
"izan ditzake, hala nola Zirriborroa eta Argitaratua, eta "
"egoera-aldaketak baimenduak, hala nola Zirriborrotik Argitaraturako "
"(egungo berrikuspena \"bizirik\" jarriz) eta Argitaraturatik "
"Zirriborroarako (argitaratutako edukiarentzako zirriborro berri bat "
"sortuz)."

msgid ""
"Provides additional publication states that can be used by other "
"modules to moderate content."
msgstr ""
"Argitalpen-egoera osagarriak eskaintzen ditu, beste modulu batzuek "
"edukia moderatzeko erabiltzeko."

msgid ""
"The Content Translation module allows you to translate content, "
"comments, content blocks, taxonomy terms, users and other <a "
"href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module help, with background on "
"content entities\">content entities</a>. Together with the modules <a "
"href=\":language\">Language</a>, <a "
"href=\":config-trans\">Configuration Translation</a>, and <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interface Translation</a>, it allows you to build "
"multilingual websites. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":translation-entity\">online documentation for the Content "
"Translation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Eduki Itzulpen moduluak edukiak, iruzkinak, edukiontzi blokeak, "
"taksonomia terminoak, erabiltzaileak eta beste <a href=\":field_help\" "
"title=\"Field module help, with background on content entities\">eduki "
"entitateak</a> itzultzea ahalbidetzen du. <a "
"href=\":language\">Hizkuntza</a>, <a "
"href=\":config-trans\">Konfigurazio Itzulpena</a> eta <a "
"href=\":locale\">Interfazearen Itzulpena</a> moduekin batera, webgune "
"aniz-hizkuntzatuak eraikitzen uzten dizu. Informazio gehiagorako, ikus "
"<a href=\":translation-entity\">Eduki Itzulpen moduluko online "
"dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "Defines field types for storing dates and times."
msgstr "Data eta orduak gordetzeko eremu motak definitzen ditu."

msgid ""
"When enabled, images can only be uploaded. When disabled, images can "
"only be added by URL."
msgstr ""
"Gaituta dagoenean, irudiak soilik igo daitezke. Desgaituta dagoenean, "
"irudiak soilik URL bidez gehitu daitezke."

msgid ""
"The Text Editor module provides a framework for managing editors. To "
"use it, you also need to install a text editor. This can either be the "
"core <a href=\":ckeditor5\">CKEditor5 module</a>, which can be "
"installed on the <a href=\":extend\">Extend page</a>, or a contributed "
"module for any other text editor. When installing a contributed text "
"editor module, be sure to check the installation instructions, because "
"you will most likely need to download an external library as well as "
"the Drupal module."
msgstr ""
"Testu Editorearen modulua editoreak kudeatzeko marko bat eskaintzen "
"du. Erabiltzeko, testu editore bat ere instalatu behar duzu. Hori izan "
"daiteke oinarrizko <a href=\":ckeditor5\">CKEditor5 modula</a>, <a "
"href=\":extend\">Luza orrian</a> instalatu daitekeena, edo beste "
"edozein testu editoreentzako modulu ekarpen bat. Testu editore ekarpen "
"modulu bat instalatzean, ziurtatu instalazio argibideak kontsultatzea, "
"izan ere, litekeena da Drupal modulaz gain liburutegi kanpoko bat ere "
"deskargatu behar izatea."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to associate text editors (like WYSIWYGs) and "
"toolbars with text formats."
msgstr ""
"Testu-formatuekin testu-editoreak (hala nola WYSIWYGak) eta "
"tresna-barreak lotzeko egitura bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Text editors"
msgstr "Testu-editoreak"

msgid ""
"Ensures that the latest versions of images uploaded via a Text Editor "
"are displayed, along with their dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Text Editor bidez igotako irudiaren azken bertsioak eta haien neurriak "
"bistaratzen direla ziurtatzen du."

msgid ""
"The website's content and configuration is managed using "
"<em>entities</em>, which are grouped into <em>entity types</em>. "
"<em>Content entity types</em> are the entity types for site content "
"(such as the main site content, comments, content blocks, taxonomy "
"terms, and user accounts). <em>Configuration entity types</em> are "
"used to store configuration information for your site, such as "
"individual views in the Views module, and settings for your main site "
"content types."
msgstr ""
"Gune honetako edukia eta konfigurazioa <em>entitate</em> erabiliz "
"kudeatzen dira, eta hauek <em>entitate mota</em>etan taldekatuta "
"daude. <em>Edukien entitate motak</em> gune edukientzako entitate "
"motak dira (adibidez, guneko edukia nagusia, iruzkinak, edukien "
"blokeak, sailkapen terminoa eta erabiltzaile kontuak). "
"<em>Konfigurazio entitate motak</em> zure gunerako "
"konfigurazio-informazioa gordetzeko erabiltzen dira, hala nola Views "
"moduluko ikuspegi banakakoak eta guneko eduki nagusien motetarako "
"ezarpenak."

msgid "Provides the capabilities to add fields to entities."
msgstr "Entitateei eremuak gehitzeko gaitasunak eskaintzen ditu."

msgid ""
"Once you have created a field, you can use it again in other sub-types "
"of the same entity type. For instance, if you create a field for the "
"article content type, you can also use it for the page content type, "
"but you cannot use it for content blocks or taxonomy terms. If there "
"are fields available for re-use, after clicking <em>Add field</em> "
"from the <em>Manage fields</em> page, you will see a list of available "
"fields for re-use. After selecting a field for re-use, you can "
"configure the sub-type-level settings."
msgstr ""
"Behin eremu bat sortu duzunean, berriro erabil dezakezu entitate mota "
"beraren azpi-mota ezberdinetan. Adibidez, artikuluaren edukirako eremu "
"bat sortzen baduzu, orriaren edukirako ere erabil dezakezu, baina ezin "
"duzu erabiltzeko edukiblock edo taxonomia terminoetarako. "
"Erabilerarako eremuak badaude, <em>Kudeatu eremuak</em> orrialdetik "
"<em>Gehitu eremua</em> sakatuta, erabilerarako eskuragarri dauden "
"eremuak agertuko zaizkizu zerrendan. Erabilerarako eremu bat "
"hautatuta, azpi-motaren mailako ezarpenak konfiguratu ahal izango "
"dituzu."

msgid "Provide a pre-filled value for the editing form."
msgstr "Editatzeko formularioari balio bat aurrez beteazu."

msgid "You need to select a field type."
msgstr "Eremu mota bat hautatu behar duzu."

msgid ""
"You can re-use a field from other sub-types of the same entity type. "
"Re-using a field creates another usage of the same field storage."
msgstr ""
"Entitate mota bereko azpimotako beste batzuetako eremu bat berrerabili "
"dezakezu. Eredu bera duten betegarriak berrerabiltzearen bidez, "
"eremuaren biltegiratze bera beste erabilera bat sortzen da."

msgid "Filter by field or field type"
msgstr "Ebazteko eremuz edo eremu motaz iragazi"

msgid "Used in: @list"
msgstr "Erabilita: @list"

msgid "Re-use"
msgstr "Berrerabili"

msgid "Reuse @field_name"
msgstr "Erabili berriro @field_name"

msgid "There was a problem reusing field %label: @message"
msgstr "%label eremuaren berrerabileran arazoa egon da: @message"

msgid "Single value"
msgid_plural "Multiple values: @cardinality"
msgstr[0] "Balio bakarra"
msgstr[1] "Balio anitzak: @cardinality"

msgid "Create a new field"
msgstr "Sortu eremu berria"

msgid ""
"Provides a field type for files and defines a \"managed_file\" Form "
"API element."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategientzako eremu mota bat eskaintzen du eta \"managed_file\" "
"Form API elementu bat definitzen du."

msgid "Filters text content in preparation for display."
msgstr "Testu-edukia iragazten du bistaratze-rako prestatzeko."

msgid "Lazy load images"
msgstr "Irudiak karga motela egiteko"

msgid ""
"Instruct browsers to lazy load images if dimensions are specified. Use "
"in conjunction with and place after the 'Track images uploaded via a "
"Text Editor' filter that adds image dimensions required for lazy "
"loading. Results can be overridden by <code>&lt;img "
"loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code>."
msgstr ""
"Nabigatzaileei irudiak lazy load moduan kargatzeko agindu dimentsioak "
"zehazten badira. Erabili hau batera eta jarri 'Track images uploaded "
"via a Text Editor' iragazkiaren ondoren, irudiaren dimentsioak lazy "
"load egiteko beharrezkoak direnak gehitzen dituen iragazkia. Emaitzak "
"<code>&lt;img loading=&quot;eager&quot;&gt;</code> kodeak gainidatzi "
"ditzake."

msgid "Generates help pages and provides a Help block with page-level help."
msgstr ""
"Laguntza orriak sortzen ditu eta orri-mailako laguntzarekin laguntza "
"bloke bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "What are content blocks?"
msgstr "Zer dira edukia blokeak?"

msgid ""
"Content blocks are blocks whose content you can edit. You can define "
"one or more <em>block types</em>, and attach fields to each block "
"type. Content blocks can be placed just like blocks provided by other "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Eduki blokeak edukia editatu dezakezun blokeak dira. <em>Bloke "
"mota</em> bat edo gehiago defini ditzakezu, eta eremuak erantsi bloke "
"mota bakoitzari. Eduki blokeak beste moduluek emandako blokeak "
"bezalaxe kokatu daitezke."

msgid "Overview for managing blocks"
msgstr "Blokeak kudeatzeko ikuspegi orokorra"

msgid ""
"The <em>Block</em> module allows you to place blocks in regions of "
"your installed themes, and configure block settings. The <em>Block "
"Content</em> module allows you to manage block types and content "
"blocks. See the related topics listed below for specific tasks."
msgstr ""
"<em>Block</em> modulua aukera ematen dizu blokeak zure instalatutako "
"gaien eremuetan jartzeko eta blokeen ezarpenak konfiguratzeko. "
"<em>Block Content</em> modulua bloke motak eta edukizko blokeak "
"kudeatzeko balioko dizu. Ikusi behean zerrendatutako gai erlazionatuak "
"zeregin zehatzetarako."

msgid "Creating a content block"
msgstr "Edukia bloke bat sortzea"

msgid "Create a content block, which can later be placed on the site."
msgstr "Sortu eduki-bloke bat, eta geroago gunean kokatu daitekeena."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Content</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa menu administratiboan, nabigatu "
"<em>Content</em> atalera."

msgid "Open the @library_link tab."
msgstr "Ireki @library_link fitxa."

msgid ""
"Click <em>Add content block</em>. If you have more than one block type "
"defined on your site, click the name of the type you want to create."
msgstr ""
"Sakatu <em>Eduki blokea gehitu</em>. Zure gunean bloke mota bat baino "
"gehiago baduzu definituta, sakatu sortu nahi duzun motaren izena."

msgid "Defining a block type"
msgstr "Bloke mota bat definitzea"

msgid "Define a block type and its fields."
msgstr "Bloke mota bat eta haren eremuak definitu."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@types_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@types_link</em> atalerako."

msgid "Click  <em>Add block type</em>."
msgstr "Klikatu <em>Bloke mota gehitu</em>."

msgid ""
"A comment is a piece of content, typically posted by a website "
"visitor, which provides discussion or commentary on other content like "
"blog posts and news articles. Comments are a type of content entity, "
"and can have fields that store text, HTML markup, and other data. "
"Comments are attached to other content entities via Comment fields. "
"See @content_structure_topic for more about content entities and "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"Iruzkina edukizko zati bat da, normalean webgune bisitari batek "
"argitaratua, eta beste edukiei buruzko eztabaida edo iruzkinak "
"eskaintzen ditu, hala nola blog mezuak eta albiste artikuluak. "
"Iruzkinak edukizko entitate motak dira, eta testua, HTML markaketa eta "
"bestelako datuak gordetzen dituzten eremuak izan ditzakete. Iruzkinak "
"beste edukizko entitate batzuei atxikita daude Iruzkin eremuen bidez. "
"Ikusi @content_structure_topic edukizko entitate eta eremu gehiagori "
"buruz."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@config_translation_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, egin nabigazioa "
"<em>Konfigurazioa</em> &gt; <em>Eskualdea eta hizkuntza</em> &gt; "
"<em>@config_translation_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Both personal and site-wide contact forms will always have "
"<em>Subject</em> and <em>Message</em> fields. You can add additional "
"fields for users to fill out if desired. Note that if you want to "
"display other content on a form page, such as text or images, you can "
"use a content block."
msgstr ""
"Pertsonaleko eta guneko kontaktu-inprimaki guztiek beti izango dituzte "
"<em>Gaia</em> eta <em>Mezua</em> eremuak. Behar izanez gero, "
"erabiltzaileek bete ditzaten eremu osagarriak gehitu ditzakezu. "
"Kontuan izan bestalde, inprimaki-orrialde batean testu edo irudiak "
"bezalako bestelako edukia erakutsi nahi baduzu, edukien bloke bat "
"erabil dezakezula."

msgid ""
"Users with <em>content moderation permissions</em> can change workflow "
"states. There are separate permissions for each transition. See "
"Permissions &gt; <em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> to "
"configure content moderation permissions."
msgstr ""
"<em>Edukien moderazio baimenak</em> dituzten erabiltzaileek "
"lan-fluxuko egoerak aldatu ditzakete. Trantsizio bakoitzerako baimen "
"bereiziak daude. Ikusi Baimenak &gt; "
"<em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> edukien moderazio "
"baimenak konfiguratzeko."

msgid ""
"Find the entity that you want to moderate in either the content "
"moderation view page, if you created one, or the appropriate "
"administrative page for managing that type of entity (such as the "
"administration page for content items; see @content_link)."
msgstr ""
"Aurki ezazu moderatu nahi duzun entitatea edukiaren moderazio "
"ikuspegiko orrian, zuk sortu baduzu, edo entitate mota horren "
"kudeaketa egiteko egokitutako administrazio orrian (adibidez, eduki "
"elementuetarako administrazio orria; ikus @content_link)."

msgid ""
"Users with <em>workflows permissions</em> (typically administrators) "
"can configure workflows. See Permissions &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_permissions_link</em> to configure workflows "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"<em>Lan-fluxuen baimenak</em> dituzten erabiltzaileek (ohikoena "
"administratzaileak izatea da) lan-fluxuak konfiguratu ditzakete. Ikusi "
"Baimenak &gt; <em>@workflows_permissions_link</em> lan-fluxuen "
"baimenak konfiguratzeko."

msgid ""
"To implement your plan, in the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, "
"navigate to <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Workflow</em> &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_link</em>. A list of workflows is shown, including the "
"default workflow <em>Editorial</em> that you can adapt."
msgstr ""
"Zure plana ezartzeko, <em>Manage</em> kudeaketa menu administratiboan, "
"joan <em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Workflow</em> &gt; "
"<em>@workflows_link</em> ataletara. Workflowen zerrenda bat agertuko "
"da, tartean aldatu ditzakezun <em>Editorial</em> lan-fluxu lehenetsia."

msgid ""
"Under <em>This workflow applies to:</em>, find the entity type that "
"you want this workflow to apply to, such as Content revisions, Content "
"block revisions, or Taxonomy term revisions. Click <em>Select</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Lan-fluxu hau honi aplikatzen zaio:</em> azpian, aurkitu lan-fluxu "
"hau aplikatu nahi duzun entitate motaren bat, hala nola Edukiaren "
"bertsioak, Eduki-blokeen bertsioak edo Taxonomia-termioen bertsioak. "
"Egin klik <em>Hautatu</em>-n."

msgid ""
"Follow the steps in @user_permissions_topic to assign permissions for "
"each transition to roles. The permissions are listed under the "
"<em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> section; there is one "
"permission for each transition in each workflow."
msgstr ""
"Jarraitu @user_permissions_topic ataleko pausoak, eta egoera-aldaketa "
"bakoitzerako baimenak esleitu rolei. Baimenak "
"<em>@content_moderation_permissions_link</em> atalpean daude "
"zerrendatuta; egoera-aldaketa bakoitzerako baimen bat dago workflow "
"bakoitzean."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@translation_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>Configuration</em> &gt; "
"<em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@translation_settings_link</em> "
"atalerako."

msgid ""
"A <em>content entity</em> (or more commonly, <em>entity</em>) is an "
"item of content data, which can consist of text, HTML markup, images, "
"attached files, and other data. Content entities are grouped into "
"<em>entity types</em>, which have different purposes and are displayed "
"in very different ways on the site. Most entity types are also divided "
"into <em>entity sub-types</em>, which are divisions within an entity "
"type to allow for smaller variations in how the entities are used and "
"displayed. For example, the <em>Content item</em> entity type that "
"stores page-level content is divided into <em>content type</em> "
"sub-types; the <em>Content block</em> entity type has <em>block "
"types</em>; but the <em>User</em> entity type (for user profile "
"information) does not have sub-types."
msgstr ""
"<em>Eduki entitate</em> (edo ohikoagoa den moduan, <em>entitate</em>) "
"eduki datu baten elementua da, testua, HTML markaketa, irudiak, "
"atxikitako fitxategiak eta beste datu batzuk izan ditzakeena. Eduki "
"entitateak <em>entitate mota</em>-etan taldekatuak daude, eta mota "
"hauek helburu desberdinak dituzte eta sarbidean modu oso desberdinetan "
"erakusten dira. Entitate motak, gehienetan, <em>entitate "
"azpimotak</em> ere dituzte banatuta; hauek entitate mota baten barruko "
"sailkapenak dira, entitateak nola erabiltzen eta erakusten diren "
"aldagai txikiagoak onartzeko. Adibidez, orri-mailako edukia gordetzen "
"duen <em>Eduki elementu</em> entitate motak <em>eduki mota</em> "
"azpimotak ditu; <em>Eduki bloke</em> entitate motak <em>bloke "
"mota</em> ditu; baina <em>Erabiltzaile</em> entitate motak "
"(erabiltzailearen profilaren informaziorako) ez du azpimotorik."

msgid ""
"Depending on the core and contributed modules that you currently have "
"installed on your site, the related topics below and other topics "
"listed on the main help page (see @help_link) will help you with tasks "
"related to content structure."
msgstr ""
"Oinarri- eta ekarpen-moduluak, zeinak une honetan zure gunean "
"instalatuta dituzun, kontuan hartuta, beheko gai lotunek eta laguntza "
"nagusiko orrialdean (@help_link ikusi) zerrendatutako beste gai "
"batzuek edukien egiturarekin lotutako zereginetan lagunduko dizute."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@languages_link."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, nabigatu <em>Konfigurazioa</em> "
"&gt; <em>Eremua eta hizkuntza</em> &gt; @languages_link-ra."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>Languages</em> &gt; @detection_link."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa menu nagusian, joan <em>Configuration</em> "
"&gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>Languages</em> &gt; "
"@detection_link atalera."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>User "
"interface translation</em> &gt; @import_link."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio-menuan, nabigatu <em>Konfigurazioa</em> "
"&gt; <em>Eskualdea eta hizkuntza</em> &gt; <em>Erabiltzaile "
"interfazearen itzulpena</em> &gt; @import_link."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@translate_link."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>Configuration</em> &gt; "
"<em>Region and language</em> &gt; @translate_link helbidera."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"@language_link."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>Konfigurazioa</em> &gt; "
"<em>Eskualdea eta hizkuntza</em> &gt; @language_link atalera."

msgid ""
"When users visit the main search page (see @search_link), they will "
"see the configured search pages that they have access to. Each search "
"page has a search form on it, and the page will display search results "
"after the user enters keywords into the form and clicks the search "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek bilaketa nagusira (ikusi @search_link) sartzean, "
"sartzeko baimena duten bilaketa orriak ikusiko dituzte. Bilaketa orri "
"bakoitzean bilaketa formulario bat dago, eta orriak bilaketaren "
"emaitzak erakutsiko ditu erabiltzaileak hitz-gakoak formularioan sartu "
"eta bilaketa botoian klik egin ondoren."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@performance_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio menuan, nabigatu <em>Configuration</em> "
"&gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; <em>@performance_link</em>-era."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>System</em> &gt; "
"<em>@information_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio menuan, nabigatu <em>Configuration</em> "
"&gt; <em>System</em> &gt; <em>@information_link</em> atalera."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@regional_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, joan <em>Konfigurazioa</em> "
"&gt; <em>Eskualdea eta hizkuntza</em> &gt; "
"<em>@regional_link</em>-era."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; "
"<em>@datetime_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio-menuan, nabigatu <em>Configuration</em> "
"&gt; <em>Region and language</em> &gt; <em>@datetime_link</em> "
"atalerako."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Error pages</em> section, enter the URL for your 403/404 "
"pages, starting after the site home page URL. For example, if your "
"site URL is <em>https://example.com</em> and your 404 page is "
"<em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, you would enter "
"<em>/not-found</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Errore orrialdeak</em> atalean, sartu zure 403/404 orrialdeen "
"URL-a, hasierako orrialdearen URL-aren ondoren. Adibidez, zure "
"gunearen URL-a <em>https://example.com</em> bada eta zure 404 "
"orrialdea <em>https://example.com/not-found</em>, <em>/not-found</em> "
"sartu beharko zenuke."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@log_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, joan <em>Ezarpenak</em> &gt; "
"<em>Garapena</em> &gt; <em>@log_settings_link</em> atalerako."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>Development</em> &gt; "
"<em>@maintenance_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, joan <em>Konfigurazioa</em> "
"&gt; <em>Garapena</em> &gt; <em>@maintenance_link</em> atalerako."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@extend_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, nabigatu "
"<em>@extend_link</em>-era."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Extend</em> &gt; <em>@uninstall_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>Extend</em> &gt; "
"<em>@uninstall_link</em> atalaya."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Reports</em> &gt; <em>@status_link</em> to see a report that "
"summarizes the health and status of your site. If there are any "
"warnings or errors, you will need to fix them. Take note of any "
"upcoming highly critical security releases that may impact your site."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa menuko <em>Reports</em> &gt; "
"<em>@status_link</em> ataletik sartu, zure gunearen osasuna eta egoera "
"laburbiltzen dituen txostena ikusteko. Oharrak edo erroreak badaude, "
"zuzendu egin beharko dira. Zure gunean eragina izan dezaketen laster "
"iritsiko diren segurtasun kaleratze kritikoak kontuan hartu."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@themes_link</em>."
msgstr "<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>@themes_link</em> atarira."

msgid ""
"Click the <em>Uninstall</em> link to uninstall the theme. If there is "
"not an <em>Uninstall</em> link, the theme cannot be uninstalled "
"because it is either being used as the site default theme, being used "
"as the <em>Administration theme</em>, or is the base theme for another "
"installed theme."
msgstr ""
"Sakatu <em>Desinstalatu</em> lotura gaiari desinstalatzeko. "
"<em>Desinstalatu</em> loturarik ez badago, gaiak ezin da desinstalatu, "
"izan ere, edo webgunearen gai lehenetsia bezala erabiltzen ari da, "
"<em>Administrazio gai</em> gisa erabiltzen ari da, edo beste gai "
"bateko oinarria den gai bat delako."

msgid ""
"Taxonomy reference fields can be added to any entity, such as user "
"accounts, content blocks, or regular content items. If you use them to "
"classify regular content items, your site will automatically be set up "
"with taxonomy listing pages for each term; each of these pages lists "
"all of the content items that are classified with that term."
msgstr ""
"Sailkapen erreferentziazko eremuak edozein entitatetara gehitu "
"daitezke, hala nola erabiltzaile kontuak, edukien blokeak edo eduki "
"arruntak. Eduki arruntak sailkatzeko erabiltzen badituzu, zure gunea "
"automatikoki konfiguratu egingo da termino bakoitzerako sailkapen "
"orrialdeekin; orri horietako bakoitzak termino horrekin sailkatutako "
"eduki guztiak zerrendatzen ditu."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@people_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio-menutik, nabigatu "
"<em>@people_link</em>-era."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>People</em> &gt; <em>@roles_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>People</em> &gt; "
"<em>@roles_link</em> atalera."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>People</em> &gt; <em>@permissions_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> kudeaketa-menuan, joan <em>People</em> &gt; "
"<em>@permissions_link</em>-ra."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Configuration</em> &gt; <em>People</em> &gt; "
"<em>@account_settings_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Kudeatu</em> administrazio menuan, nabigatu <em>Konfigurazioa</em> "
"&gt; <em>Jendeari</em> &gt; <em>@account_settings_link</em>."

msgid ""
"Views using a table display format can include a bulk operations form, "
"which allows users with sufficient permission to select one or more "
"items from the view and apply an administrative action to them. The "
"bulk actions available are specific to the base data type of the view; "
"for example, a view of content items could support bulk publishing and "
"unpublishing actions. If you have the core Actions UI module "
"installed, see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more "
"about actions."
msgstr ""
"Taula erakusteko formatuan ikuspegiek masa-operazioak egiteko "
"inprimaki bat barne har dezakete, eta horrek baimen nahikoa duten "
"erabiltzaileei ikuspegitik elementu bat edo gehiago hautatzea eta "
"haiei administrazio-ekintza bat aplikatzea ahalbidetzen die. "
"Eskaintzen diren masa-ekintzak ikuspegiko oinarrizko datu motaren "
"arabera definitzen dira; adibidez, edukien ikuspegi batek "
"masa-argitalpen eta desargitalpen ekintzak lagundu ditzake. Core "
"Actions UI moduluarekin instalatuta baduzu, \"Ekintzak "
"konfiguratzeko\" gaiari buruzko informazio gehiago lortzeko begiratu "
"gaia."

msgid ""
"If you are not already editing your view, in the <em>Manage</em> "
"administrative menu, navigate to <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@views_link</em>. Find the view you want to edit, and click its "
"<em>Edit</em> link."
msgstr ""
"Oraindik zure ikuspegia editatzen ez badabilzu, <em>Manage</em> "
"administrazio menuan, nabigatu <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@views_link</em> ataletik. Aurkitu editatu nahi duzun ikuspegia, "
"eta klikatu bere <em>Edit</em> estekan."

msgid ""
"Add one or more existing actions as bulk operations to an existing "
"table-style view. If you have the core Actions UI module installed, "
"see the related topic \"Configuring actions\" for more information "
"about actions."
msgstr ""
"Sartu dagoen ekintza bat edo gehiago, operazio multzo gisa, dagoeneko "
"existitzen den taula estilo bateko ikuspegi batean. Core Actions UI "
"modura instalatuta baduzu, ikusi ekintzen inguruko \"Konfiguratu "
"ekintzak\" gaia xehetasun gehiago lortzeko."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>Structure</em> &gt; <em>@views_link</em>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio-menuan, joan <em>Structure</em> &gt; "
"<em>@views_link</em> atalera."

msgid ""
"Records which content users have viewed and marks it as new or "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek zein edukitzat ikusi duten erregistratzen du eta berri "
"edo eguneratua bezala markatzen du."

msgid ""
"Layout Builder allows you to use layouts to customize how content, "
"content blocks, and other <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module "
"help, with background on content entities\">content entities</a> are "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Layout Builder-ek aukera ematen dizu egiturak erabiltzeko, edukia, "
"eduki-blokeak eta beste <a href=\":field_help\" title=\"Field module "
"help, with background on content entities\">eduki-entitateak</a> nola "
"bistaratzen diren pertsonalizatzeko."

msgid "Create and edit content blocks"
msgstr "Sortu eta editu edukia blokeak"

msgid "Add a new content block"
msgstr "Ezarri eduki-bloke berri bat"

msgid "Provides a field type for internal and external URLs."
msgstr "Barneko eta kanpoko URLentzako eremu mota bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Updated default configuration to %langcode"
msgstr "Eguneratu da lehenetsitako konfigurazioa %langcode-ra"

msgid ""
"Allows users to translate interface text and to switch between "
"interface languages."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek interfaze testua itzultzea eta interfaze hizkuntzen "
"artean aldatzea ahalbidetzen du."

msgid "oEmbed loading settings"
msgstr "oEmbed kargatzeko ezarpenak"

msgid "oEmbed loading"
msgstr "oEmbed karga egiten"

msgid ""
"Lazy render oEmbed with native loading attribute "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). This improves performance by allowing "
"browsers to lazily load assets."
msgstr ""
"Lazy render oEmbed natibo karga ezaugarriarekin "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). Honek errendimendua hobetzen du "
"nabigatzaileek asset-ak modu arinean kargatzeko aukera emanez."

msgid "oEmbed loading attribute"
msgstr "oEmbed kargatzeko atributua"

msgid ""
"Select the loading attribute for oEmbed. <a href=\":link\">Learn more "
"about the loading attribute for oEmbed.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Hautatu oEmbed-eko loading atributua. <a href=\":link\">Ikasi gehiago "
"oEmbed-eko loading atributuari buruz.</a>"

msgid ""
"Delays loading the resource until that section of the page is visible "
"in the browser. When in doubt, lazy loading is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Itxaroten du baliabidea kargatzea orrialdeko atal hori nabigatzailean "
"ikusgai ez den bitartean. Zalantzarik badago, gomendagarria da lazy "
"loading erabiltzea."

msgid ""
"Force browsers to download a resource as soon as possible. This is the "
"browser default for legacy reasons. Only use this option when the "
"resource is always expected to render."
msgstr ""
"Arakatzileei baliabide bat ahal bezain laster deskargatzeko indarrez "
"eskatzea. Hau da arakatzailearen lehenetsi-doikuntza arrazoi "
"historikoengatik. Aukera hau baliatu baliabidea beti bistaratzea "
"espero denean bakarrik."

msgid "Loading attribute: @attribute"
msgstr "@attribute atributua kargatzen:"

msgid "Content of this type can be placed in the selected menus."
msgstr "Edukia mota honetakoak hautatutako menuetan kokatu daitezke."

msgid "Provides a user interface for managing menus."
msgstr "Menuak kudeatzeko erabiltzaile-interfaze bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Provides a framework for migrating data to Drupal."
msgstr "Drupal-era datuak migratzeko esparru bat eskaintzen du."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to migrate data from previous versions of Drupal "
"into the site."
msgstr ""
"Aurretiko Drupal bertsioetatik datuak gunean migratzeko marko bat "
"eskaintzen du."

msgid "This is not supported by Drupal."
msgstr "Hau ez du Drupalen bidez onartzen."

msgid "The recommended level for Drupal is \"READ COMMITTED\"."
msgstr "Drupalentzat gomendatutako maila \"READ COMMITTED\" da."

msgid ""
"For this to work correctly, all tables must have a primary key. The "
"following table(s) do not have a primary key: @tables."
msgstr ""
"Hori behar bezala funtzionatzeko, taula guztiek giltza nagusi bat izan "
"behar dute. Honako taula hauek ez dute giltza nagusirik: @tables."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction "
"isolation level</a> page for more information."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi <a href=\":performance_doc\">MySQL transakzio isolamendu maila "
"ezartzeko</a> orria informazio gehiagorako."

msgid "Transaction isolation level"
msgstr "Transakzioaren isolamendu-maila"

msgid "Provides the MySQL database driver."
msgstr "MySQL datu-base kontrolatzailea eskaintzen du."

msgid "READ COMMITTED"
msgstr "IRAKURRI BEHARTUTA"

msgid "REPEATABLE READ"
msgstr "IRAUKI BEHARREKO IRAKURKETA"

msgid "Use database default"
msgstr "Erabili datu-baseren lehenetsiak"

msgid ""
"The recommended database transaction level for Drupal is \"READ "
"COMMITTED\". For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":performance_doc\">setting MySQL transaction isolation "
"level</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Drupalentzat gomendatutako datu-base transakzio maila \"READ "
"COMMITTED\" da. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, ikus <a "
"href=\":performance_doc\">MySQL transakzio isolamendu maila "
"ezartzea</a> orria."

msgid ""
"Manages the creation, configuration, and display of the main site "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Webgune nagusiko edukien sorrera, konfigurazioa eta erakusketa "
"kudeatzen du."

msgid ""
"Defines field types with select lists, checkboxes, and radio buttons "
"to select values from fixed lists of options."
msgstr ""
"Aukera-zerrendetako, hautapeko koadroetako eta irratiko botoietako "
"eremu-motak definitzen ditu balioak aukera zerrenda finkoetatik "
"hautatzeko."

msgid "Allows users to create custom URLs for existing paths on the site."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek gunean dauden bideentzat URL pertsonalizatuak sortzea "
"ahalbidetzen du."

msgid "Provides the PostgreSQL database driver."
msgstr "PostgreSQL datu-basearen gidaria eskaintzen du."

msgid "Password Compatibility"
msgstr "Pasahitzaren bateragarritasuna"

msgid ""
"While you have the option to provide only one image style per "
"breakpoint, the sizes attribute allows you to provide more options to "
"browsers as to which image file it can display. If using sizes field "
"and art direction, all selected image styles should use the same "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shifting. Breakpoints are defined in the "
"configuration files of the theme."
msgstr ""
"Breakpoint bakoitzeko irudi estilo bat baino ez emateko aukera baduzu "
"ere, sizes atributuak arakatzaileei aukera gehiago eskaintzen dizkie, "
"zein irudi fitxategi erakutsi dezaketen aukeratzeko. sizes eremua eta "
"arte zuzendaria erabiltzen badituzu, hautatutako irudi estilo guztiak "
"alderdi proportzio bera erabili behar dute edukia desplazatzea "
"saihesteko. Breakpointak gaiaren konfigurazio fitxategietan zehazten "
"dira."

msgid ""
"The sizes attribute paired with the srcset attribute provides "
"information on how much space these images take up within the viewport "
"at different browser breakpoints, but the aspect ratios should remain "
"the same across those breakpoints. Once the sizes option is selected, "
"you can let the browser know the size of this image in relation to the "
"site layout, using the <em>Sizes</em> field. For a hero image that "
"always fills the entire screen, you could simply enter 100vw, which "
"means 100% of the viewport width. For an image that fills 90% of the "
"screen for small viewports, but only fills 40% of the screen when the "
"viewport is larger than 40em (typically 640px), you could enter "
"\"(min-width: 40em) 40vw, 90vw\" in the Sizes field. The last item in "
"the comma-separated list is the smallest viewport size: other items in "
"the comma-separated list should have a media condition paired with an "
"image width. <em>Media conditions</em> are similar to a media query, "
"often a min-width paired with a viewport width using em or px units: "
"e.g. (min-width: 640px) or (min-width: 40em). This is paired with the "
"<em>image width</em> at that viewport size using px, em or vw units. "
"The vw unit is viewport width and is used instead of a percentage "
"because the percentage always refers to the width of the entire "
"viewport."
msgstr ""
"sizes atributuak srcset atributuarekin batera ematen du informazioa "
"irudi hauek zenbat espazio hartzen duten ikusgailuaren barruan "
"nabigatzailearen tarteen arabera, baina alderdi-erlazioek berdin "
"jarraitu behar dute tarte horietan. sizes aukera hautatzean, "
"nabigatzaileari jakinarazi diezaiokezu irudiaren tamaina gunearen "
"diseinuarekiko erlazionatuta, <em>Sizes</em> eremua erabiliz. Pantaila "
"osoa betetzen duen hero irudi baterako, soilik 100vw sartzea nahikoa "
"litzateke, hau da, ikusgailuaren zabalera %100. Pantaila txikietan %90 "
"betetzen duen irudi baterako, baina ikusgailuaren zabalera 40em "
"(normalean 640px) baino handiagoa denean pantailaren %40 soilik "
"betetzen duena, <em>Sizes</em> eremuan \"(min-width: 40em) 40vw, "
"90vw\" sartu genezake. Komaz banatutako zerrendako azken elementua da "
"ikusgailu-tamaina txikiena; beste elementuek media egoera bat izan "
"behar dute irudiaren zabalera batekin pari. <em>Media egoerak</em> "
"media query baten antzekoak dira, askotan min-width bat bai "
"ikusgailuaren zabalera em edo px unitateetan erabiltzen dutena: "
"adibidez, (min-width: 640px) edo (min-width: 40em). Hau batera doa "
"<em>irudiaren zabalera</em>rekin ikusgailu tamaina horretan, px, em "
"edo vw unitateetan. Vw unitatea ikusgailuaren zabalera adierazten du "
"eta erabilia da ehunekoaren ordez, ehunekoa beti ikusgailu osoaren "
"zabalera izaten delako erreferentzia."

msgid ""
"Provides functionality to output responsive images using the HTML5 "
"picture tag."
msgstr ""
"HTML5 picture etiketa erabiliz irudi erantzunkorrak ateratzeko "
"funtzionaltasuna ematen du."

msgid ""
"Select the image style you wish to use as the style when a browser "
"does not support responsive images."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratu irudi estiloa, arakatzaileak irudi erantzunkorrak ez "
"dituenean estilo gisa erabiliko dena."

msgid ""
"Lazy render images with native image loading attribute "
"(<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). This improves performance by allowing "
"browsers to lazily load images. See <a href=\"@url\">Lazy loading</a>."
msgstr ""
"Irudiak renderizatzen uzten ditu berezko irudi kargatzeko "
"atributuarekin (<em>loading=\"lazy\"</em>). Honek errendimendua "
"hobetzen du nabigatzaileek irudiak nahi bezain lasai kargatzeko aukera "
"ematen duelako. Ikusi <a href=\"@url\">Lazy loading</a>."

msgid "Lazy"
msgstr "Alferra"

msgid "Eager"
msgstr "Gogotsu"

msgid "Lazy loading attribute"
msgstr "Kargatze atzeratua atributua"

msgid ""
"Select the lazy loading attribute for images. <a href=\":link\">Learn "
"more.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Irudietarako lazy loading atributua hautatu. <a href=\":link\">Ikasi "
"gehiago.</a>"

msgid ""
"In order to use REST on a website, you need to install modules that "
"provide serialization and authentication services. You can use the "
"Core module <a href=\":serialization\">serialization</a> for "
"serialization and <a href=\":basic_auth\">HTTP Basic "
"Authentication</a> for authentication, or install a contributed or "
"custom module."
msgstr ""
"REST webgune batean erabiltzeko, beharrezkoa da serializazioa eta "
"autentikazio zerbitzuak eskaintzen dituzten moduluek instalatzea. "
"Serializaziorako Core <a href=\":serialization\">modulua</a> erabil "
"dezakezu eta autentikaziorako <a href=\":basic_auth\">HTTP Basic "
"Authentication</a>, edo modu batean ekarritako edo pertsonalizatutako "
"modulu bat instalatu."

msgid "Provides a framework for exposing REST resources."
msgstr "REST baliabideak agerian jartzeko marko bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Allows discovery and rendering of self-contained UI components."
msgstr ""
"Bere osotasunean dagoen UI osagaien aurkikuntza eta bistaratzea "
"ahalbidetzen du."

msgid "All Components"
msgstr "Osagai guztiak"

msgid ""
"Provides a service for converting data to and from formats such as "
"JSON and XML."
msgstr ""
"JSON eta XML bezalako formatuetara eta horietatik datuak bihurtzeko "
"zerbitzu bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Allows users to create sets of shortcuts within the site."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek laburbide-multzoak sortzea ahalbidetzen du gune "
"barruan."

msgid "Provides the SQLite database driver."
msgstr "SQLite datu-basearen gidaria eskaintzen du."

msgid "Logs events to the web server's system log."
msgstr "Web zerbitzariaren sistemako log-ean gertaerak gordetzen ditu."

msgid "The base URL of the site, currently: @base_url"
msgstr "Gune honen oinarrizko URL-a, une honetan: @base_url"

msgid "The base path of the site, currently: @base_path"
msgstr "Gunearen oinarrizko bidea, une honetan: @base_path"

msgid ""
"The URL of the site's front page with the language prefix, if it "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"Webgunearen hasierako orriaren URLa hizkuntza aurrizkiarekin, "
"badagoenean."

msgid ""
"Obsolete extensions found: %extensions. Obsolete extensions are "
"provided only so that they can be uninstalled cleanly. You should "
"immediately <a href=\":uninstall_url\">uninstall these extensions</a> "
"since they may be removed in a future release."
msgstr ""
"Aurkitutako luzapen zaharkituak: %extensions. Luzapen zaharkituak "
"bakarrik ematen dira garbi desinstalatu daitezen. Berehala <a "
"href=\":uninstall_url\">desinstalatu beharko zenituzke luzapen "
"hauek</a> aurrerako bertsio batean ezabatuko dituztelako."

msgid "PHP APCu available caching"
msgstr "PHP APCu erabilgarri dagoen cacheatzea"

msgid ""
"APCu is using over 90% of its allotted memory (@apcu_actual_size). To "
"improve APCu performance, consider increasing this limit."
msgstr ""
"APCu-k bere esleitutako memoriaren %90 baino gehiago "
"(@apcu_actual_size) erabiltzen ari da. APCu-ren errendimendua "
"hobetzeko, muga hau handitzea kontuan hartu."

msgid ""
"APCu is using over 75% of its allotted memory (@apcu_actual_size). To "
"improve APCu performance, consider increasing this limit."
msgstr ""
"APCu-k bere esleitutako memoriaren %75 baino gehiago erabiltzen ari da "
"(@apcu_actual_size). APCu-ren errendimendua hobetzeko, muga hau "
"handitzea kontuan hartu."

msgid "SameSite cookie attribute"
msgstr "SameSite cookie atributua"

msgid ""
"This attribute should be explicitly set to Lax, Strict or None. If set "
"to None then the request must be made via HTTPS. See <a href=\":url\" "
"target=\"_blank\">PHP documentation</a>"
msgstr ""
"Atributu hau argi eta garbi ezarri behar da Lax, Strict edo None "
"bezala. None bezala ezarrita badago, eskaera HTTPS bidez egin behar "
"da. Ikusi <a href=\":url\" target=\"_blank\">PHPren dokumentazioa</a>"

msgid "Provides user interfaces for core systems."
msgstr "Sistema nagusientzako erabiltzaile-interfazeen eskaintza egiten du."

msgid "Region and language"
msgstr "Eskualdea eta hizkuntza"

msgid "Menu Linkset Settings"
msgstr "Menuaren Estekatze Multzoaren Ezarpenak"

msgid "Enable or disable the menu linkset endpoint"
msgstr "Gaitu edo desgaitu menu lotura-multzoaren endpoint-a"

msgid "System Feature Flags"
msgstr "Sistemaren Ezaugarri Banderak"

msgid "Enable the menu linkset endpoint"
msgstr "Gaitu menu lotura-multzoaren endpoint-a"

msgid ""
"Use this utility to update your database whenever a module, theme, or "
"the core software is updated."
msgstr ""
"Erabili tresna hau zure datu-basea eguneratzeko modulua, gaia edo "
"oinarrizko softwarea eguneratzen den bakoitzean."

msgid "Update your files (as described in the handbook page linked above)."
msgstr ""
"Eguneratu zure fitxategiak (goian estekatutako eskuliburuko orrian "
"azaltzen den bezala)."

msgid "Optimized assets file system path"
msgstr "Baliabide optimizatuen fitxategi sistema ibilbidea"

msgid ""
"A local file system path where optimized assets files will be stored. "
"This directory must exist and be writable by Drupal. This directory "
"must be relative to the Drupal installation directory and be "
"accessible over the web. This must be changed in settings.php"
msgstr ""
"Drupalekin optimizatutako asset fitxategiak gordeko diren tokiko "
"fitxategi-sistemaren bide bat. Karpeta honek existitu behar du eta "
"Drupalek idatz daitekeen moduan egon behar du. Karpeta hau Drupal "
"instalazio karpetaren erlatuan egon behar da eta web bidez "
"eskuragarria izan behar da. Hau settings.php fitxategian aldatu behar "
"da."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\"@docs-link\">decoupled menus documentation</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi <a href=\"@docs-link\">menu deskonposatuen dokumentazioa</a> "
"informazio gehiagorako."

msgid ""
"<strong class=\"error\">Set up the <a href=\":file-system\">optimized "
"assets file system path</a> to make these optimizations "
"available.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"error\"><a href=\":file-system\">Optimizatutako "
"aktiboen fitxategi-sistemaren bidea</a> ezarri optimizazio hauek "
"eskuragarri izan daitezen.</strong>"

msgid "Specify a relative URL to display as the front page."
msgstr "Aukeratu orrialde nagusian erakutsiko den erlaziozko URL bat."

msgid ""
"The path %path requires a leading forward slash when used with the "
"Pages setting."
msgstr ""
"%path bideak aurrerago aurreratzeko atzekoa behar du Pages "
"ezarpenarekin erabiltzean."

msgid "The image toolkit '@toolkit' can not process image '@image'."
msgstr "Irudien tresna '@toolkit' ezin du '@image' irudia prozesatu."

msgid ""
"The image toolkit '@toolkit' failed loading image '@image'. Reported "
"error: @class - @message"
msgstr ""
"Irudi-tresnak '@toolkit' ezin izan du '@image' irudia kargatu. "
"Jakinarazitako errorea: @class - @message"

msgid ""
"The image toolkit '@toolkit' failed saving image '@image'. Reported "
"error: @class - @message"
msgstr ""
"Irudi tresna-kutxa '@toolkit' huts egin du '@image' irudia gordetzean. "
"Jakinarazitako errorea: @class - @message"

msgid "The raw vocabulary ID."
msgstr "Hiztegiaren ID gordinia."

msgid "Defines field types for short and long text with optional summaries."
msgstr ""
"Testu motz eta luzeetarako eremu motak definitzen ditu, laburpen "
"aukerak barne."

msgid "Allowed text formats"
msgstr "Onartutako testu-formatuak"

msgid "The selected text format is not allowed."
msgstr "Hautatutako testu formatua ez da onartzen."

msgid ""
"Select the allowed text formats. If no formats are selected, all "
"available text formats will be displayed to the user."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratu onartutako testu-formatuak. Ez bada formatu bat hautatu, "
"erabiltzailerentzat eskuragarri dauden testu-formatu guztiak "
"erakutsiko dira."

msgid "Text editors may override this setting."
msgstr "Testu editoreek ezarpen hau gainidatzi dezakete."

msgid ""
"Provides an administration toolbar to display links provided by "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"Moduek emandako estekak erakusteko administrazio tresna-barra bat "
"eskaintzen du."

msgid ""
"Regularly review <a href=\":updates\">available updates</a> and update "
"as required to maintain a secure and current site. Always run the <a "
"href=\":update-php\">update script</a> each time you update software."
msgstr ""
"Aldizka berrikusi <a href=\":updates\">eskuragarri dauden "
"eguneratzeak</a> eta eguneratu behar bezala seguru eta gaurkotasuneko "
"gunea mantentzeko. Beti exekutatu <a href=\":update-php\">eguneratze "
"script-a</a> softwarea eguneratzen duzun bakoitzean."

msgid ""
"Permissions let you control what users can do and see on your site. "
"You can define a specific set of permissions for each role. (See the "
"<a href=\":role\">Roles</a> page to create a role.) Any permissions "
"granted to the Authenticated user role will be given to any user who "
"is logged in to your site. On the <a href=\":settings\">Role "
"settings</a> page, you can make any role into an Administrator role "
"for the site, meaning that role will be granted all permissions. You "
"should be careful to ensure that only trusted users are given this "
"access and level of control of your site."
msgstr ""
"Baieztapenek erabiltzaileek zure gunean egin eta ikusi dezaketen "
"kontrolatzen laguntzen dute. Rol bakoitzerako baiezapen zehatz bat "
"defini dezakezu. (Ikusi <a href=\":role\">Rolak</a> orria rola "
"sortzeko.) Edonola ere, Authenticated erabiltzaile rolari emandako "
"baiezapen oro zure gunean saioa hasi duen edonorentzat izango da. <a "
"href=\":settings\">Rol ezarpenak</a> orrian, edozein rol "
"Administratzaile rol bihur dezakezu gunean, horrek esan nahi du rola "
"baiezapen guztiak jasoko dituela. Kontuz ibili behar duzu soilik "
"erabiltzaile fidagarriak izan daitezen sarbide eta kontrol maila hau "
"jasotzen dutenak zure gunean."

msgid ""
"Allows users to register and log in, and manages user roles and "
"permissions."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek erregistratzeko eta saioa hasteko aukera ematen du, eta "
"erabiltzaileen rolen eta baimenak kudeatzen ditu."

msgid "This role will be automatically granted all permissions."
msgstr "Rolta honek automatikoki emango dizkio baimen guztiak."

msgid ""
"Provides a framework to fetch information from the database and to "
"display it in different formats."
msgstr ""
"Informazioa biltegitik eskuratzeko eta formatu desberdinetan "
"erakusteko esparru bat eskaintzen du."

msgid "Use the administration theme when rendering the view page"
msgstr "Ikuspegi orria erreproduzitzen denean, erabili kudeaketa gaia"

msgid "Yes (admin path)"
msgstr "Bai (admin bidea)"

msgid "Use the administration theme when rendering this display."
msgstr "Erabili administrazio gaia pantaila hau erreproduzitzeko."

msgid "Use the administration theme"
msgstr "Erabili kudeaketa gaia"

msgid "Paths starting with \"@admin\" always use the administration theme."
msgstr ""
"\"@admin\" -ekin hasten diren bideek beti administrazio gaiaren "
"erabilera egiten dute."

msgid "No %title option selected."
msgstr "Ez da %title aukerarik hautatu."

msgid ""
"The view %id failed to load an entity of type %entity_type at row "
"%index for field %field"
msgstr ""
"Ikuspegiak %id ezin izan du karga %entity_type motako entitate bat "
"%index lerroan, %field eremurako."

msgid "Perform actions on the selected items in the %view_title view"
msgstr ""
"Hartu ekintzak aukeratutako elementuetan %view_title ikuskariaren "
"barruan"

msgid "Find and manage content blocks."
msgstr "Aurki eta kudeatu edukia blokeak."

msgid "There are no content blocks available."
msgstr "Edukia blokeik ez dago eskuragarri."

msgid "Create and edit content blocks."
msgstr "Sortu eta editu edukia blokeak."

msgid ""
"Field %field_name exists but is missing a corresponding field "
"definition and may be misconfigured."
msgstr ""
"%field_name eremua existitzen da, baina eremuaren definizio dagokor "
"bat falta zaio eta gaizki konfiguratu zegoen liteke."

msgid "Enter 0 to show all comments."
msgstr "Sartu 0 iruzkin guztiak erakusteko."

msgid "Viewing Drupal announcements"
msgstr "Drupal iragarkien ikustea"

msgid "What are Drupal announcements?"
msgstr "Zer dira Drupal iragarkiak?"

msgid ""
"A feed of announcements about the Drupal project and Drupal "
"Association programs."
msgstr ""
"Drupal proiektuari eta Drupal Elkartearen programetara buruzko "
"iragarki sorta bat."

msgid ""
"The purpose of this feed is to provide a channel for outreach directly "
"to Drupal site owners. This content must be highly relevant to site "
"owners interests, serve the strategic goals of the project, and/or "
"promote the sustainability of the project and the Drupal Association."
msgstr ""
"Jariapen honen helburua Drupal guneen jabeekin zuzenean harreman kanal "
"bat eskaintzea da. Eduki hau gune-jabeen interesa oso zuzeneko izan "
"behar da, proiektuaren helburu estrategikoak lagundu behar ditu "
"eta/edo proiektuaren eta Drupal Elkartearen iraunkortasuna sustatu "
"behar du."

msgid ""
"The module sources its content from a JSON feed generated from <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">here</a>. The "
"governance policy for the content is documented <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Moduluak bere edukiak <a "
"href=\"https://www.drupal.org/about/announcements\">hemendik</a> "
"sortutako JSON elikadura batetik jasotzen ditu. Edukiaren gobernantza "
"politika <a href=\"https://www.drupal.org/node/3274085\">hemen</a> "
"dokumentatuta dago."

msgid "How can I see the Announcements in my site?"
msgstr "Nola ikus dezaket iragarkiak nire gunean?"

msgid ""
"If you have the toolbar module enabled, you will see a direct link to "
"them in the toolbar. If the toolbar module is not enabled, the content "
"can always be accessed in the <em>@actions_link</em> page."
msgstr ""
"Toolbar moduluarekin gaituta badago, horiei zuzeneko esteka bat "
"ikusiko duzu toolbarrean. Toolbar moduluak ez badu gaituta, edukiari "
"beti sar daiteke <em>@actions_link</em> orrian."

msgid "Who can see the Announcements?"
msgstr "Nor ikusi dezake Jakinarazpenak?"

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>@permissions_link</em> permission can view Drupal "
"announcements."
msgstr ""
"<em>@permissions_link</em> baimena duten erabiltzaileek Drupal "
"iragarkiak ikusi ditzakete."

msgid "Announcement module overview"
msgstr "Aldaketa moduluaren ikuspegi orokorra"

msgid "Twig development mode"
msgstr "Twig garapen modua"

msgid ""
"Twig development mode settings are turned on. Go to @link to disable "
"them."
msgstr "Twig garapen modua aktibatuta dago. Desaktibatzeko joan @link-era."

msgid "Markup caching disabled"
msgstr "Markup cachea desgaituta dago"

msgid ""
"Render cache, dynamic page cache, and page cache are bypassed. Go to "
"@link to enable them."
msgstr ""
"Render cache-a, orrialde dinamikoen cache-a eta orrialde cache-a "
"saihesten dira. Joan @link-era hauek gaitzeko."

msgid "Configure theme development settings"
msgstr "Gaikako garapenaren ezarpenak konfiguratu"

msgid ""
"These settings should only be enabled on development environments and "
"never on production."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen hauek garapen inguruneetan soilik aktibatu behar dira eta "
"inoiz ez produkzioan."

msgid "Exposes Twig development settings."
msgstr "Twig garapen ezarpenak erakusten ditu."

msgid ""
"Provides Twig's <code>dump()</code> function for debugging, outputs "
"template suggestions to HTML comments, and automatically recompile "
"Twig templates after changes."
msgstr ""
"Twig-en <code>dump()</code> funtzioa ematen du arazketa egiteko, "
"txantiloiaren iradokizunak HTML iruzkinetan bistaratzen ditu, eta Twig "
"txantiloien berrenkapsulazioa automatikoki egiten du aldaketak egin "
"ondoren."

msgid "Disable Twig cache"
msgstr "Desgaitu Twig cache-a"

msgid "Twig templates are not cached and are always compiled when rendered."
msgstr ""
"Twig txantiloiek ez dute cache-rik eta beti konpilatzen dira "
"bistaratzerakoan."

msgid "Do not cache markup"
msgstr "Ez cacheatu markup-a"

msgid "Disables render cache, dynamic page cache, and page cache."
msgstr ""
"Gaitzen du renderizazio cache-a, orri dinamiko cache-a, eta orri "
"cache-a desgaitzea."

msgid ""
"Your Drupal site's <code>composer.json</code> file must be valid "
"according to <code>composer validate</code>. See <a "
"href=\":url\">Composer's documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Zure Drupal guneko <code>composer.json</code> fitxategia baliogarria "
"izan behar da <code>composer validate</code> arabera. Informazio "
"gehiagorako, ikus <a href=\":url\">Composer-aren dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":url\">online documentation "
"for the Package Manager module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Informazio gehiago lortzeko, ikusi <a href=\":url\">Package Manager "
"modulurako dokumentazio lineala</a>."

msgid "FAQs related to Composer"
msgstr "Composer-ekin lotutako ohiko galderak"

msgid ""
"What if it says the <code>proc_open()</code> function is disabled on "
"your PHP installation?"
msgstr ""
"Zer gertatzen da zure PHP instalazioan <code>proc_open()</code> "
"funtzioa desgaituta dagoela esaten badu?"

msgid ""
"Ask your system administrator to remove <code>proc_open()</code> from "
"the <a href=\":url\">disable_functions</a> setting in "
"<code>php.ini</code>."
msgstr ""
"Eskatu zure sistemaren administratzaileari <code>proc_open()</code> "
"kentzeko <code>php.ini</code>-ko <a "
"href=\":url\">disable_functions</a> ezarpenetik."

msgid "What if it says the <code>composer</code> executable cannot be found?"
msgstr ""
"Zer gertatzen da <code>composer</code> exekutagarria ezin dela aurkitu "
"esaten badu?"

msgid "What if it says the detected version of Composer is not supported?"
msgstr ""
"Zer gertatuko da Composer detektatutako bertsioa ez badagoela "
"onartuta?"

msgid "What if it says the <code>composer validate</code> command failed?"
msgstr ""
"Zer gertatzen da <code>composer validate</code> komandoak huts egin "
"badu?"

msgid ""
"Composer detected problems with your <code>composer.json</code> and/or "
"<code>composer.lock</code> files, and the project is not in a "
"completely valid state. See <a href=\":url\">the Composer "
"documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Composerrek arazoak detektatu ditu zure <code>composer.json</code> "
"eta/edo <code>composer.lock</code> fitxategiekin, eta proiektua ez "
"dago osorik baliogarri den egoeran. Ikusi <a href=\":url\">Composerren "
"dokumentazioa</a> informazio gehiago izateko."

msgid "Using rsync"
msgstr "rsync erabiltzea"

msgid "Enabling PHP-TUF protection"
msgstr "PHP-TUF babesa gaitzea"

msgid ""
"Package Manager requires <a href=\":php-tuf\">PHP-TUF</a>, which "
"implements <a href=\":tuf\">The Update Framework</a> as a way to help "
"secure Composer package downloads via the <a "
"href=\":php-tuf-plugin\">PHP-TUF Composer integration plugin</a>. This "
"plugin must be installed and configured properly in order to use "
"Package Manager."
msgstr ""
"Package Manager-ek <a href=\":php-tuf\">PHP-TUF</a> behar du, zeinak "
"<a href=\":tuf\">The Update Framework</a> gauzatzen duen Composer "
"paketeen deskargak seguruagoak izan daitezen laguntzeko, <a "
"href=\":php-tuf-plugin\">PHP-TUF Composer integrazio plugin</a>-aren "
"bidez. Plugin hau behar bezala instalatu eta konfiguratu behar da "
"Package Manager erabiltzeko."

msgid ""
"To install and configure the plugin as needed, you can run the "
"following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Plugin-a behar bezala instalatu eta konfiguratzeko, honako komando "
"hauek exekutatu ditzakezu:"

msgid ""
"Installation or removal of <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> via "
"Package Manager is not supported. You can install or remove it "
"manually by running Composer commands in your site root."
msgstr ""
"<code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> paketea instalatzea edo kentzea "
"Pakete Kudeatzailearen bidez ez dago onartuta. Eskuz instalatu edo "
"kendu dezakezu Composer komandoak zure gunearen erroan exekutatuz."

msgid "composer.lock not found in @dir."
msgstr "composer.lock ez da aurkitu @dir-en."

msgid ""
"The detected Composer version, @version, does not satisfy "
"<code>@constraint</code>."
msgstr ""
"Aurkitutako Composer bertsioa, @version, ez da "
"<code>@constraint</code> betetzen."

msgid ""
"Any packages other than the implicitly allowed packages are not "
"allowed to scaffold files. See <a href=\":url\">the scaffold "
"documentation</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"Baimentzen diren pakete inplizituetatik kanpoko beste edozein paketek "
"ez dute baimena fitxategiak sortzeko. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, "
"ikusi <a href=\":url\">eskemaren dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "<code>@name</code>"
msgstr "<code>@izena</code>"

msgid ""
"<code>@name</code> is supported, but only version "
"<code>@supported_version</code>, found "
"<code>@installed_version</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code>@name</code> onartzen da, baina bertsioa "
"<code>@supported_version</code> bakarrik, eta aurkitutako bertsioa da "
"<code>@installed_version</code>."

msgid ""
"Composer cannot be used because the <code>proc_open()</code> function "
"is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Composer ezin da erabili <code>proc_open()</code> funtzioa desgaituta "
"dagoelako."

msgid "Unable to determine Composer <code>@key</code> setting."
msgstr "Composer <code>@key</code> ezarpena zehaztu ezin izan da."

msgid "TLS must be enabled for HTTPS Composer downloads."
msgstr "HTTPS Composer deskargetarako TLS aktibatuta egon behar da."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the help page</a> for more information "
"on how to configure Composer to download packages securely."
msgstr ""
"@message Ikusi <a href=\":url\">laguntza orria</a> Composer paketak "
"modu seguruan deskargatzeko nola konfiguratu gehiago jakiteko."

msgid ""
"@message See <a href=\":url\">the Composer documentation</a> for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"@message Ikusi <a href=\":url\">Composer dokumentazioa</a> informazio "
"gehiago lortzeko."

msgid ""
"You should also check the value of <code>secure-http</code> and make "
"sure that it is set to <code>true</code> or not set at all."
msgstr ""
"Era berean, <code>secure-http</code>-ren balioa egiaztatu beharko "
"zenuke eta ziurtatu <code>true</code> ezarri dela edo ez dela batere "
"ezarri."

msgid "HTTPS must be enabled for Composer downloads."
msgstr "Composer deskargetarako HTTPS gaituta egon behar da."

msgid "Composer settings don't satisfy Package Manager's requirements."
msgstr ""
"Composer-en ezarpenek ez dituzte Paketearen Kudeatzailearen "
"eskakizunak betetzen."

msgid "'@name' @type (provided by <code>@package</code>)"
msgstr "'@name' @type (<code>@package</code>-ek emana)"

msgid ""
"The update cannot proceed because the following enabled Drupal "
"extension was removed during the update."
msgid_plural ""
"The update cannot proceed because the following enabled Drupal "
"extensions were removed during the update."
msgstr[0] ""
"Eguneratzea ezin da aurrera eraman, eguneratzean ondorengo Drupal "
"luzapena desgaitu egin baita.  \n"
"Eguneratzea ezin da aurrera eraman, "
"eguneratzean ondorengo Drupal luzapenak desgaitu egin baitziren."

msgid "<a href=\":url\">@message</a>"
msgstr "<a href=\":url\">@message</a>"

