msgstr "@project_name (@package_name) @version"

msgid ""
"The Password Compatibility module provides the password checking "
"algorithm for user accounts created with Drupal prior to version "
"10.1.0. For more information, see the <a href=\":phpass\">online "
"documentation for the Password Compatibility module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 bertsioa baino lehen sortutako erabiltzaile kontuetarako "
"pasahitzaren egiaztapenerako algoritmoa ematen du Password "
"Compatibility modulak. Informazio gehiagorako, ikus <a "
"href=\":phpass\">Password Compatibility modulurako dokumentazio "
"lineala</a>."

msgid ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 and later use a different algorithm to compute the "
"hashed password. This provides better security against brute-force "
"attacks. The hashed passwords are different from the ones computed "
"with Drupal versions before 10.1.0."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0tik aurrerako bertsioek algoritmo desberdin bat "
"erabiltzen dute pasahitz hashatua kalkulatzeko. Honek segurtasun hobea "
"eskaintzen du bortizkeria-eraikuntzaren aurkako erasoei aurre egiteko. "
"Pasahitz hashatuak ezberdinak dira 10.1.0 aurreko Drupal bertsioekin "
"kalkulatutakoetatik."

msgid ""
"When the Password Compatibility module is installed, a user can log in "
"with a username and password created before Drupal 10.1.0. The first "
"time these credentials are used, a new hash is computed and saved. "
"From then on, the user will be able to log in with the same username "
"and password whether or not this module is installed."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 baino lehen sortutako erabiltzaile-izena eta "
"pasahitzarekin sartzeko aukera ematen du Password Compatibility "
"modulua instalatuta dagoenean. Behin erabiltzaile-izen eta pasahitz "
"hauek lehen aldiz erabiltzen direnean, hash berri bat kalkulatzen eta "
"gordetzen da. Ordutik aurrera, erabiltzaileak modu hori instalatuta "
"egon ala ez, erabiltzaile-izen eta pasahitz berarekin saioa hasi ahal "
"izango du."

msgid ""
"Passwords created before Drupal 10.1.0 <strong>will not work</strong> "
"unless they are used at least once while this module is installed. "
"Make sure that you can log in before uninstalling this module."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 baino lehen sortutako pasahitzak <strong>ez dute "
"funtzionatuko</strong> modu hau instalatuta dagoen bitartean behintzat "
"behin erabiltzen ez badira. Ziurtatu modu hau desinstalatu aurretik "
"saioa hasteko gai zarela."

msgid ""
"Make sure that you can log in before uninstalling the Password "
"Compatibility module. For more information, see the <a "
"href=\":phpass\">online documentation for the Password Compatibility "
"module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ziurtatu saioa hasteko gai zarela Password Compatibility modulua "
"desinstalatu aurretik. Informazio gehiagorako, ikusi <a "
"href=\":phpass\">Password Compatibility modulurako lineako "
"dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid ""
"Provides the password checking algorithm for user accounts created "
"with Drupal prior to version 10.1.0."
msgstr ""
"Drupal 10.1.0 bertsiora arte sortutako erabiltzaile kontuentzako "
"pasahitzaren egiaztapen algoritmoa eskaintzen du."

