msgid ""
"The following core software modules and mechanisms can improve your "
"site's performance:"
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo oinarrizko software moduluek eta mekanismoek zure gunearen "
"errendimendua hobetzeko aukera dute:"

msgid ""
"The following administrative interface components are provided by the "
"core software and its modules (some contributed modules offer "
"additional functionality):"
msgstr ""
"Ondorengo kudeaketa interfazeko osagaiak software nagusiak eta bere "
"moduluak eskaintzen dituzte (modulu laguntzaile batzuek "
"funtzionalitate gehigarriak eskaintzen dituzte):"

msgid "The following core software modules provide web services:"
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo oinarrizko software moduluek web zerbitzuak eskaintzen "
"dituzte:"

msgid ""
"Provides a way for web services to be authenticated using HTTP Basic "
"authentication against site user accounts."
msgstr ""
"Web zerbitzuak autentifikatzeko modu bat eskaintzen du, HTTP Basic "
"autentifikazioa erabiliz, guneetako erabiltzaile kontuekin."

msgid ""
"In the <em>Manage</em> administrative menu, navigate to "
"<em>@extend_link</em>. Verify that the Search, Help, and Block modules "
"are installed (or install them if they are not already installed)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Manage</em> administrazio-menuan, joan <em>@extend_link</em> "
"ataritik. Egiaztatu Search, Help eta Block moduluak instalatuta "
"daudela (edo instalatu ez badaude)."

msgid "Working with help topics"
msgstr "Laguntza gaietan lan egitea"

msgid "What is a help topic?"
msgstr "Zer da laguntza gai bat?"

msgid ""
"A help topic describes a concept, or steps to accomplish a task, "
"related to a feature provided by one or more modules or themes. If the "
"core Search module is enabled, these topics are also searchable."
msgstr ""
"Laguntza gai batek kontzeptu bat edo zeregin bat betetzeko pausoak "
"azaltzen ditu, moduluek edo gaiek emandako funtzionalitate bati "
"lotuta. Core Search modulua gaituta badago, gai hauek ere bilatu "
"daitezke."

msgid "Where are help topics listed?"
msgstr "Non daude laguntza gaien zerrendak?"

msgid ""
"The top-level help topics are listed at @help_link. Links to other "
"topics, including non-top-level help topics, can be found under the "
"\"Related\" heading when viewing a topic page."
msgstr ""
"Goiko mailako laguntza gaiak @help_link-en daude zerrendatuta. Beste "
"gai batzuetarako estekak, goiko mailako laguntza gaiak izan ezik, "
"\"Related\" izenburuaren azpian aurki daitezke gai baten orria "
"ikustean."

msgid "How are help topics provided?"
msgstr "Nola eskaintzen dira laguntza-gaien edukiak?"

msgid ""
"Modules and themes can provide help topics as Twig-file-based plugins "
"in a project sub-directory called <em>help_topics</em>; plugin "
"metadata is provided in YAML front matter within each Twig file. "
"Plugin-based help topics provided by modules and themes will "
"automatically be updated when a module or theme is updated. Use the "
"plugins in <em>core/modules/help/help_topics</em> as a guide when "
"writing and formatting a help topic plugin for your theme or module."
msgstr ""
"Modulu eta gaiek <em>help_topics</em> izeneko proiektuaren "
"azpidirektorio batean oinarritutako Twig-fitxategi-pluginekin laguntza "
"gaiak eskaintzeko aukera dute; each Twig fitxategian YAML front matter "
"bidez ematen da pluginen metadata. Modulu eta gaiek emandako pluginen "
"bidezko laguntza gaiak automatikoki eguneratuko dira modulu edo gaia "
"eguneratzen denean. Erabili <em>core/modules/help/help_topics</em> "
"barruko pluginak gida gisa zure gaia edo moduluarentzat laguntza gai "
"plugin bat idazteko eta formateatzeko."

msgid "How are help topics translated?"
msgstr "Nola itzultzen dira laguntza gaiak?"

msgid ""
"The title and body text of help topics provided by contributed modules "
"and themes are translatable using @translate_link (provided by "
"Interface Translation module). Topics provided by custom modules and "
"themes are also translatable if they have been viewed at least once in "
"a non-English language, which triggers putting their translatable text "
"into the translation database."
msgstr ""
"Laguntza gaietarako izenburua eta testu nagusia, modulu eta gai "
"emandakoek, itzuli daitezke @translate_link erabiliz (Interface "
"Translation modulua emandakoa). Modulu eta gai pertsonalizatuen gaiak "
"ere itzuli daitezke hizkuntza ez-ingelesean behin baino gehiagotan "
"ikusi badira, eta horrek itzultzeko testua itzulpen datu-basean "
"sartzea eragiten du."

msgid "How can users search for help topics?"
msgstr "Nola bilatu dezakete erabiltzaileek laguntza gaien inguruan?"

msgid ""
"To enable users to search help, including help topics, you will need "
"to install the core Search module, configure a search page, and add a "
"search block to the Help page or another administrative page. (A "
"search page is provided automatically, and if you use the core Claro "
"administrative theme, a help search block is shown on the main Help "
"page.) Then users with search permissions, and permission to view "
"help, will be able to search help. See the related topic, "
"@help_search_topic, for step-by-step instructions."
msgstr ""
"Laguntza bilatzeko, laguntza gaiak barne, erabiltzaileek core Search "
"modulua instalatu, bilaketa orri bat konfiguratu eta bilaketa bloke "
"bat gehitu beharko dituzue Laguntza orrian edo beste administrazio "
"orri batean. (Bilaketa orri bat automatikoki ematen da, eta core Claro "
"administrazio gaiaren erabilera bada, laguntza bilaketa bloke bat "
"bistaratzen da Laguntza orri nagusian.) Ondoren, bilaketa baimenak eta "
"laguntza ikusteko baimenak dituzten erabiltzaileek laguntza bilatu "
"ahal izango dute. Ikusi lotutako gai hau, @help_search_topic, urratsez "
"urrats argibideak jasotzeko."

msgid "Help Topics Standards"
msgstr "Laguntza Gaiak Araudiak"

msgid ""
"Field to reference media. Allows uploading and selecting from uploaded "
