"The '@bundle' bundle does not exist on the '@entity_type_id' entity "
"type."
msgstr "'@entity_type_id' entitate motan '@bundle' multzoa ez da existitzen."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Whether this config schema type is fully validatable"
msgstr "Konfigurazio eskema mota hau guztiz balidatu daitekeen ala ez"

msgid ""
"'@key' is an unknown key because @dynamic_type_property_path is "
"@dynamic_type_property_value (see config schema type "
"@resolved_dynamic_type)."
msgstr ""
"'@key' giltza ezezaguna da, @dynamic_type_property_path "
"@dynamic_type_property_value delako (ikus konfigurazioaren eskema mota "
"@resolved_dynamic_type)."

msgid "'@key' is a required key."
msgstr "'@key' giltza beharrezkoa da."

msgid ""
"'@key' is a required key because @dynamic_type_property_path is "
"@dynamic_type_property_value (see config schema type "
"@resolved_dynamic_type)."
msgstr ""
"'@key' beharrezko gakoa da, izan ere, @dynamic_type_property_path "
"@dynamic_type_property_value da (@resolved_dynamic_type konfigurazio "
"eskema-mota ikus)."

msgid "Your comment has been updated."
msgstr "Zure iruzkina eguneratu da."

msgid "@id (@label)"
msgstr "@id (@label)"

msgid "Limit (messages per interval)"
msgstr "Muga (mezuak tarte bakoitzeko)"

msgid "Interval (seconds)"
msgstr "Tartea (segundoak)"

msgid ""
"Ideal when date and time needs to be input by users, like event dates "
"and times"
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek data eta ordua sartzea beharrezkoa denean egokia, hala "
"nola ekitaldiaren data eta orduekin."

msgid "Date or date and time stored in a readable string format"
msgstr "Data edo data eta ordua formatu irakurgarrian gordeta"

msgid "Easy to read and understand for humans"
msgstr "Gizakientzat erraza irakurri eta ulertzeko"

msgid "Display both start and end dates"
msgstr "Hasiera eta amaiera datak biek erakutsi"

msgid "Display start date only"
msgstr "Hasiera data soilik erakutsi"

msgid "Display end date only"
msgstr "Amaierako data soilik erakutsi"

msgid ""
"Ideal for storing durations that consist of start and end dates (and "
"times)"
msgstr ""
"Hasiera eta amaiera data (eta orduak) osatzen dituzten iraupenak "
"gordetzeko aproposa"

msgid ""
"Choose between setting both date and time, or date only, for each "
"duration"
msgstr ""
"Aukeratu iraupen bakoitzerako data eta ordua ezartzea edo data "
"bakarrik ezartzea"

msgid ""
"The system automatically validates that the end date (and time) is "
"later than the start, and both fields are completed"
msgstr ""
"Sistemak automatikoki egiaztatzen du amaiera-data (eta ordua) hasiera "
"baino beranduago dagoela, eta bi eremuak osatuta daudela."

msgid "File already locked for writing."
msgstr "Fitxategia idazteko dagoeneko blokeatuta dago."

msgid "Bytes (KB, MB, ...)"
msgstr "Byte-ak (KB, MB, ...)"

msgid "For uploading files"
msgstr "Fitxategiak igotzeko"

msgid ""
"Can be configured with options such as allowed file extensions and "
"maximum upload size"
msgstr ""
"Baieztatu daiteke fitxategi luzapen onartuekin eta igoera handiena "
"neurriarekin bezalako aukerekin"

msgid "Temporary file data for could not be written"
msgstr "Fitxategi aldiuneko datuak ezin izan dira idatzi"

msgid "Temporary file could not be opened for file upload"
msgstr "Fitxategi aldagarria ez da ireki ahal izan fitxategia igotzeko."

msgid ""
"No image toolkit is configured on the site. Check PHP installed "
"extensions or add a contributed toolkit that doesn't require a PHP "
"extension. Make sure that at least one valid image toolkit is "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Gunean ez dago inongo irudi tresna-kit konfiguratuta. Egiaztatu PHPn "
"instalatutako luzapenak edo gehitu PHP luzapenik behar ez duen "
"tresna-kit bat. Ziurtatu gutxienez irudi tresna-kit baliagarri bat "
"instalatuta dagoela."

msgid "For uploading images"
msgstr "Irudiak igo ahal izateko"

msgid ""
"Allows a user to upload an image with configurable extensions, image "
"dimensions, upload size"
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile bati irudi bat igo ahal izatea baimentzen du luzapen "
"konfiguragarriak, irudiaren neurriak eta igoeraren tamaina dituztenak."

msgid ""
"Can be configured with options such as allowed file extensions, "
"maximum upload size and image dimensions minimums/maximums"
msgstr ""
"Baitezke konfiguratu honako aukera hauekin: onartutako fitxategi "
"luzapenak, igoeraren tamaina maximoa eta irudiaren neurri "
"minimoak/makimoak."

msgid "Missing file with ID %id."
msgstr "%id duten fitxategia falta da."

msgid ""
"The \"@name\" at \"@target_entity_type_id:@target_bundle\" references "
"the \"@entity_type_id:@bundle\" entity type that does not exist."
msgstr ""
"\"@target_entity_type_id:@target_bundle\" helburuan dagoen \"@name\" "
"ez da existitzen den \"@entity_type_id:@bundle\" entitate motara "
"erreferentzia egiten."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":href\">online documentation "
"for the Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Informazio gehiago lortzeko, ikus <a href=\":href\">Layout Builder "
"Expose All Field Blocks moduluko dokumentazio lineala</a>."

msgid "Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks"
msgstr "Layout Builder Erakutsi Ditu Eremu Bloke Guztiak"

msgid ""
"When enabled, this module exposes all fields for all entity view "
"displays. When disabled, only entity type bundles that have layout "
"builder enabled will have their fields exposed. Enabling this module "
"could significantly decrease performance on sites with a large number "
"of entity types and bundles."
msgstr ""
"Aktibatuta dagoenean, modul honek entitate ikuspegi guztietako eremu "
"guztiak bistaratzen ditu. Desaktibatuta dagoenean, layout builder "
"aktibatuta duten entitate motako soilik izango dute haien eremuak "
"ikusgai. Modulu hau aktibatzeak errendimendua nabarmen murriztu dezake "
"entitate mota eta multzo kopuru handia duten gunetan."

msgid "Could not retrieve the remote URL (@url): %error"
msgstr "Kanpoko URLa (@url) ezin izan da lortu: %error"

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Media Mapping Constraint"
msgstr "Media Erregistroaren Murrizketa"

msgid ""
"It is not possible to map the source field @source_field_name of a "
"media type."
msgstr ""
"Ezin da mapatu @source_field_name iturburu-eremua media motaren "
"batean."

msgid "Migration messages"
msgstr "Migratze mezuak"

msgid "View the migration messages."
msgstr "Ikusi migrazio mezuak."

msgid "View migration messages"
msgstr "Migrazio-mezuak ikusi"

msgid "There are no migration message tables."
msgstr "Ez dago migrazio mezu taularik."

msgid "No migration messages available."
msgstr "Migrazio mezuak ez daude erabilgarri."

msgid "The message table is missing for this migration."
msgstr "Mezuen taula falta da migrazio honetarako."

msgid ""
"When there is an error processing a row, the migration system saves "
"the error message but not the source ID(s) of the row. That is why "
"some messages in this table have 'Not available' in the source ID "
"column(s)."
msgstr ""
"Errore bat gertatzen denean errenkada bat prozesatzean, migrazio "
"sistema errore-mezua gordetzen du, baina ez errenkadaren iturri "
"ID(a)(ak). Horregatik, taula honetan dauden mezu batzuek 'Ez "
"erabilgarri' dute iturri ID zutabean(etan)."

msgid ""
"The upgrade process may log messages about steps that require user "
"action or errors. This page allows you to view these messages"
msgstr ""
"Arintze prozesuak erabiltzailearen ekintza edo akatsak eskatzen "
"dituzten pausoen inguruko mezuak erregistratu ditzake. Orrialde honek "
"mezu hauek ikustea ahalbidetzen dizu."

msgid "Review the detailed upgrade log."
msgstr "Egurutu eskaera xehekoa berritzeko loga."

msgid ""
"Enter credentials for the database of the Drupal site you want to "
"upgrade, not the new site."
msgstr ""
"Sartu eguneratu nahi duzun Drupal guneko datu-basearen "
"autentifikazio-datuak, ez berria den gunearena."

msgid "Check whether there is translated content of these types:"
msgstr "Egiaztatu ea honako mota hauetako edukirik dagoen itzulita:"

msgid ""
"Possible ID conflicts for translations are not automatically detected "
"in the current version of Drupal. Refer to the <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">Upgrading Drupal handbook</a> for "
"instructions on how to avoid ID conflicts with translated content."
msgstr ""
"Itzulpenetako ID gatazkak ez dira automatikoki hautematen Drupal-en "
"egungo bertsioan. Ikusi <a target=\"_blank\" "
"href=\":id-conflicts-handbook\">Drupal eguneratzeko eskuliburua</a> "
"itzulitako edukiarekin ID gatazkak nola saihestu azaltzen duten "
"argibideetarako."

msgid ""
"<strong>Install all modules on this new site</strong> that are enabled "
"on the old site. For example, if the old site uses the Book module, "
"then install the Book module on this new site so that the existing "
"data can be imported to it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Instalatu modulu guztiak gunearen gainean</strong> aktibatuta "
"daudenak gunearen zaharrean. Adibidez, gunearen zaharrean Book "
"moduluak badu erabilera, orduan instalatu Book modulu berri honetan, "
"existitzen diren datuak bertara inportatu ahal izateko."

msgid ""
"The Navigation module provides a left-aligned, collapsible, vertical "
"sidebar navigation."
msgstr ""
"Navigation moduluak alde ezkerrean lerrokatutako, txikitu daitekeen, "
"bertikaleko alboko nabigazioa eskaintzen du."

msgid ""
"For more information, see the <a href=\":docs\">online documentation "
"for the Navigation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"Informazio gehiagorako, ikus <a href=\":docs\">Nabigazio modulurako "
"dokumentazio lineala</a>."

msgid ""
"This layout builder tool allows you to configure the blocks in the "
"navigation toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Nabigazio tresnabarra blokeak konfiguratzeko aukera ematen dizun "
"diseinu eraikitzaile tresna hau da."

msgid "Toolbar and Navigation modules are both installed"
msgstr "Toolbar eta Navigation moduluek bietan instalatuta daude"

msgid ""
"The Navigation module is a complete replacement for the Toolbar module "
"and disables its functionality when both modules are installed. If you "
"are planning to continue using Navigation module, you can uninstall "
"the Toolbar module now."
msgstr ""
"Nabigazio modulua Toolbar modulua ordezkatzeko osoko alternatiba da "
"eta bi moduluek instalatuta daudenean bere funtzionaltasuna desgaitzen "
"du. Nabigazio moduluarekin jarraitu nahi baduzu, orain dezakezu "
"Toolbar moduluaren desinstalazioa."

msgid "Navigation Top Bar"
msgstr "Nabigazio Goiko Barra"

msgid "Saved navigation blocks"
msgstr "Gordetako nabigazio blokeak"

msgid "Navigation Shortcuts"
msgstr "Nabigazio Azkartzak"

msgid "Navigation flag"
msgstr "Nabigazio bandera"

msgid "Values stored are floating-point numbers"
msgstr "Bilketa barnean gordetako balioak koma-ondoan dauden zenbakiak dira"

msgid "For example, 'Fraction': 0 => 0, .25 => 1/4, .75 => 3/4, 1 => 1"
msgstr "Adibidez, 'Zatikia': 0 => 0, .25 => 1/4, .75 => 3/4, 1 => 1"

msgid "Values stored are numbers without decimals"
msgstr "Martutako balioak desmarjinarik gabeko zenbakiak dira"

msgid ""
"For example, 'Lifetime in days': 1 => 1 day, 7 => 1 week, 31 => 1 "
"month"
msgstr ""
"Adibidez, 'Bizitza iraupena egunetan': 1 => 1 egun, 7 => 1 aste, 31 => "
"1 hilabete"

msgid "Values stored are text values"
msgstr "Gorde diren balioak testu-balioak dira"

msgid "For example, 'US States': IL => Illinois, IA => Iowa, IN => Indiana"
msgstr "Adibidez, 'AEBko Estatuak': IL => Illinois, IA => Iowa, IN => Indiana"

msgid ""
"Specify the existing path you wish to alias. For example: /node/28, "
"/media/1, /taxonomy/term/1."
msgstr ""
"Adierazi zein bide dagoen aliasatu nahi duzun. Adibidez: /node/28, "
"/media/1, /taxonomy/term/1."

msgid "Install the Help module for more information on the sizes attribute."
msgstr ""
"Laguntzako modulua instalatu sizes atributuari buruzko informazio "
"gehiago lortzeko."

msgid ""
"This theme requires the listed modules to operate correctly. They must "
"first be installed by a user with permissions to do so."
msgstr ""
"Gaia ondo funtzionatzeko beharrezkoak diren modulu hauek eskatzen "
"ditu. Lehenik eta behin, baimenak dituen erabiltzaile batek instalatu "
"behar ditu."

msgid ""
"This theme requires the listed modules to operate correctly. They must "
"first be installed via the <a href=\":modules_url\">Extend page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Gaia ondo funtzionatzeko modulu hauek behar ditu. Lehena <a "
"href=\":modules_url\">Handitu orria</a> bidez instalatu behar dira."

msgid "Experimental modules installed"
msgstr "Modulu esperimentalak instalatuta"

msgid "Deprecated modules installed"
msgstr "Modulu zaharkituak instalatuta"

msgid "Experimental themes installed"
msgstr "Gaikuntza esperimentalak instalatuta"

msgid "Deprecated themes installed"
msgstr "Gaituta dauden gai zaharkituak"

msgid "Obsolete extensions installed"
msgstr "Instalatutako luzapen zaharkituak"

msgid ""
"The current database driver is provided by the module: %module. The "
"module is currently not installed. You should immediately <a "
"href=\":install\">install</a> the module."
msgstr ""
"Oraingo datu-basearen driverra honako modulutik dator: %module. Modulu "
"hau oraindik ez dago instalatuta. Berehala <a "
"href=\":install\">instalatu</a> beharko zenuke modulu hau."

msgid "Add and install modules to extend site functionality."
msgstr "Gehitu eta instalatu moduluek gunearen funtzionaltasuna zabaltzeko."

msgid "Some required modules must be installed"
msgstr "Beharrezko moduluek instalatuta egon behar dute"

msgid ""
"Install the <em>Automated Cron</em> module to allow cron execution at "
"the end of a server response."
msgstr ""
"Instalatu <em>Automated Cron</em> moduluak server erantzunaren "
"amaieran cron exekutatzeko aukera emateko."

msgid ""
"Module %name has been installed. Configure <a href=\":link\">related "
"permissions</a>."
msgid_plural ""
"@count modules have been installed: %names. Configure <a "
"href=\":link\">related permissions</a>."
msgstr[0] ""
"%name moduluak instalatu dira. <a href=\":link\">Lotutako baimenak</a> "
"konfiguratu.  \n"
"@count modulu instalatu dira: %names. <a "
"href=\":link\">Lotutako baimenak</a> konfiguratu."

msgid "Module %name has been installed."
msgid_plural "@count modules have been installed: %names."
msgstr[0] ""
"%name modulua instalatu da. \n"
"@count modulu instalatu dira: %names."

msgid "Are you sure you wish to install experimental and deprecated modules?"
msgstr ""
"Ziur zaude probako eta erabilera-galduko moduluek instalatu nahi "
"dituzula?"

msgid "Are you sure you wish to install an experimental module?"
msgid_plural "Are you sure you wish to install experimental modules?"
msgstr[0] ""
"Ziur zaude saiakera-modulu bat instalatu nahi duzula?  \n"
"Ziur zaude "
"saiakera-moduluak instalatu nahi dituzula?"

msgid "Are you sure you wish to install a deprecated module?"
msgid_plural "Are you sure you wish to install deprecated modules?"
msgstr[0] ""
"Ziur zaude zaharkitutako modulu bat instalatu nahi duzula?  \n"
"Ziur "
"zaude zaharkitutako moduluak instalatu nahi dituzula?"

msgid "Once uninstalled, the %install_profile profile cannot be reinstalled."
msgstr "Ezeztatu ondoren, ezin da berriro instalatu %install_profile profila."

msgid "Revert all term revisions"
msgstr "Termino guztiak aldaketak atzera bota"

msgid "Delete all term revisions"
msgstr "Ezabatu termino berrikuspen guztiak"

msgid "View all term revisions"
msgstr "Ikusi termino guztien aldaketak"

msgid "View vocabulary labels"
msgstr "Ikus hiztegi etiketaak"

msgid "%vocabulary: View term revisions"
msgstr "%vocabulary: Ikusi terminoaren berrikuspenak"

msgid "%vocabulary: Revert term revisions"
msgstr "%vocabulary: Termino aldaketak atzera bota"

msgid ""
"To revert a revision you also need permission to edit the taxonomy "
"term."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa bat atzera egiteko, baita taxonomia terminoaren edizioaren "
"baimena ere behar duzu."

msgid "%vocabulary: Delete term revisions"
msgstr "%vocabulary: Ezabatu terminoa berrikuspenak"

msgid ""
"To delete a revision you also need permission to delete the taxonomy "
"term."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa bat ezabatzeko, taxonomy term-a ezabatzeko baimena ere behar "
"duzu."

msgid "Create a new revision by default for this vocabulary."
msgstr "Defektuz, sortu berrikuspen berri bat hiztegi honentzat."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Taxonomy term hierarchy"
msgstr "Taxonomia terminen hierarkia"

msgid ""
"Ideal for titles and names that need to support markup such as bold, "
"italics or links"
msgstr ""
"Burmuinetarako eta izenetarako ezin hobea, hala nola lodiztatua, "
"etzana edo estekak bezalako markaketa babestu behar dutenak"

msgid "Good for fields with known or predictable lengths"
