msgid ""
"Umami is an example food magazine website that demonstrates some of "
"the features of Drupal core. It is intended to be used as an example "
"site, rather than as a foundation for building your own site. For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":demo_umami\">online documentation for "
"the Umami installation profile</a>."
msgstr ""
"Umami Drupal core-aren hainbat ezaugarri erakusten dituen elikagai "
"aldizkari baten webgune adibide bat da. Adibide gisa erabiltzeko "
"pentsatuta dago, zure webgunea eraikitzeko oinarri gisa baino. "
"Informazio gehiagorako, ikusi <a href=\":demo_umami\">Umami instalazio "
"profilaren online dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid "Demonstrating Drupal core functionality"
msgstr "Drupal core funtzionaltasuna erakusten"

msgid ""
"You can look around the site to get ideas for what kinds of features "
"Drupal is capable of, and to see how an actual site can be built using "
"Drupal core."
msgstr ""
"Drupal gai den ezaugarri motetarako ideia batzuk lortzeko, eta Drupal "
"core erabiliz nola era ki daitekeen benetako webgune bat ikusteko, "
"gunean zehar ibili zaitezke."

msgid ""
"The Umami profile is very handy if you are developing a feature and "
"need some sample content."
msgstr ""
"Umami profila oso erabilgarria da ezaugarri bat garatzen ari bazara "
"eta eduki lagin batzuk behar badituzu."

msgid "What to do when you are ready to build your Drupal website"
msgstr "Drupal zure webgunea eraikitzeko prest zaudenean zer egin"

msgid ""
"Once you've tried Drupal using Umami and want to build your own site, "
"simply reinstall Drupal and select a different installation profile "
"(such as Standard) from the install screen."
msgstr ""
"Drupal probatu ondoren Umamirekin eta zure propio gunea sortu nahi "
"baduzu, berriro instalatu Drupal eta hautatu instalazio-papera "
"(adibidez, Standard) instalazio-pantailatik."

msgid "Toggle the menu"
msgstr "Menua aldatzea"

msgid "Enter color in hexadecimal format (#abc123)."
msgstr "Sartu kolorea hegzazko formatuan (#abc123)."

msgid ""
"Get support and chat with the Drupal community on <a "
"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> or <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. When you’re looking for a "
"solution to a problem, go to <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal "
"Support</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers on Stack "
"Exchange</a>."
msgstr ""
"Jaso laguntza eta hitz egin Drupal komunitatearekin <a "
"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> edo <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a> bidez. Arazo bati irtenbide bat "
"bilatzen ari zarenean, jo <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal "
"Laguntza</a> edo <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Erantzunak Stack "
"Exchange-n</a>."

