msgid ""
"The Pathauto module provides a mechanism to automate the creation of "
"<a href=\"path\">path</a> aliases. This makes URLs more readable and "
"helps search engines index content more effectively.  For more "
"information, see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for "
"Pathauto</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pathauto moduluak mekanismo bat eskaintzen du <a "
"href=\"path\">bide</a> aliasak automatikoki sortzeko. Horrela, URLak "
"irakurrizkoagoak bihurtzen dira eta bilatzaileek edukia modu "
"eraginkorragoan indeksatu dezaten laguntzen du. Informazio gehiago "
"izan nahi baduzu, ikusi <a href=\":online\">Pathauto-ri buruzko "
"lineako dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid ""
"Pathauto is accessed from the tabs it adds to the list of <a "
"href=\":aliases\">URL aliases</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pathauto-rako sartzen da gehitzen dituen fitxetatik <a "
"href=\":aliases\">URL aliasen</a> zerrendan."

msgid "Creating Pathauto Patterns"
msgstr "Pathauto Patroiak Sortzea"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_pattern\">\"Patterns\"</a> page is used to "
"configure automatic path aliasing.  New patterns are created here "
"using the <a href=\":add_form\">Add Pathauto pattern</a> button which "
"presents a form to simplify pattern creation thru the use of <a "
"href=\"token\">available tokens</a>. The patterns page provides a list "
"of all patterns on the site and allows you to edit and reorder them. "
"An alias is generated for the first pattern that applies."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":pathauto_pattern\">\"Patroiak\"</a> orria bide alias "
"automatikoak konfiguratzeko erabiltzen da. Patron berriak hemen "
"sortzen dira <a href=\":add_form\">Patroi Pathauto berria gehitu</a> "
"botoia erabiliz, eta botoi horrek formulario bat erakusten du patroia "
"sortzea errazteko, <a href=\"token\">eskuragarri dauden tokenak</a> "
"erabiliz. Patronen orriak gunean dauden patroien zerrenda bat "
"eskaintzen du eta horiek editatu eta berriro antolatzeko aukera ematen "
"du. Alias bat sortzen da aplikatzen den lehenengo patroirako."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":settings\">\"Settings\"</a> page is used to customize "
"global Pathauto settings for automated pattern creation."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":settings\">\"Ezarpenak\"</a> orria Pathauto globala "
"automatizatutako patroiak sortzeko pertsonalizatzeko erabiltzen da."

msgid "Bulk Generation"
msgstr "Sortze Masiboa"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_bulk\">\"Bulk Generate\"</a> page allows you "
"to create URL aliases for items that currently have no aliases. This "
"is typically used when installing Pathauto on a site that has existing "
"un-aliased content that needs to be aliased in bulk."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":pathauto_bulk\">\"Massan Sortu\"</a> orriak URL aliasak "
"sortzeko aukera ematen dizu, une honetan aliasik ez duten "
"elementuetarako. Orokorrean, Pathauto instalatzean erabiltzen da, "
"aliasik gabeko edukia duen gune batean, eta edukia masa batean "
"aliasdatu behar denean."

msgid "Delete Aliases"
msgstr "Ezabatu aliasak"

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":pathauto_delete\">\"Delete Aliases\"</a> page allows "
"you to remove URL aliases from items that have previously been "
"assigned aliases using pathauto."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":pathauto_delete\">\"Aliasak Ezabatu\"</a> orriak aukera "
"ematen dizu pathauto erabilita aliasak esleitu zaizkion elementuetatik "
"URL aliasak kentzeko."

msgid ""
"You need to select a pattern type, then a pattern and filter, and a "
"label. Additional types can be enabled on the <a "
"href=\":settings\">Settings</a> page."
msgstr ""
"Patroi mota bat hautatu behar duzu, ondoren patroia eta iragazkia, eta "
"etiketa bat. Mota osagarriak <a href=\":settings\">Ezarpenak</a> "
"orrian gaitu daitezke."

msgid "Enabled entity types"
msgstr "Gaitutako entitate motak"

msgid ""
"Enable to add a path field and allow to define alias patterns for the "
"given type. Disabled types already define a path field themselves or "
"currently have a pattern."
msgstr ""
"Baidetsi bide-eremu bat gehitzeko eta zehaztu aldaera patroien "
"alias-ak emandako mota horretarako. Desgaitutako motek beren kabuz "
"bide-eremu bat definitzen dute jadanik edo oraingoz patroia dute."

msgid "Broken type"
msgstr "Mota hautsia"

msgid "AliasType"
msgstr "AliasMota"

msgid ""
"Bulk generation can be used to generate URL aliases for items that "
"currently have no aliases. This is typically used when installing "
"Pathauto on a site that has existing un-aliased content that needs to "
"be aliased in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Elementuentzako URL aliasak sortzeko erabil daiteke bolumen handian "
"sortzea, oraindik aliasik ez duten elementuentzat. Normalean, Pathauto "
"instalatzean erabiltzen da, jada aliasik ez duten edukiak bolumen "
"handian aliasatzeko beharra dagoenean."

msgid ""
"It can also be used to regenerate URL aliases for items that have an "
"old alias and for which the Pathauto pattern has been changed."
msgstr ""
"Aurrekoa duten elementuetarako eta Pathauto patroia aldatu den "
"elementuetarako URL aliasak berriro sortzeko ere erabil daiteke."

msgid ""
"Note that this will only affect items which are configured to have "
"their URL alias automatically set. Items whose URL alias is manually "
"set are not affected."
msgstr ""
"Kontuan izan honek automatikoki URL aliasa ezartzeko konfiguratutako "
"elementuak bakarrik eragingo duela. URL aliasa eskuz ezarritako "
"elementuak ez dira eragindakoak."

msgid "The %element-title doesn't allow the patterns ending with whitespace."
msgstr ""
"%element-title ez du onartzen espazio batez amaitzen diren patroien "
"erabilera."

msgid "Select the types of paths for which to generate URL aliases"
msgstr "Hautatu URL ordezkoak sortzeko bide motak"

msgid "Select which URL aliases to generate"
msgstr "Sortu nahi dituzun URL aliasak hautatu"

msgid "Generate a URL alias for un-aliased paths only"
msgstr "Alias gabeko bideetarako bakarrik sortu URL alias bat"

msgid ""
"<a href=\":url\">Pathauto settings</a> are set to ignore paths which "
"already have a URL alias. You can only create URL aliases for paths "
"having none."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":url\">Pathauto ezarpenak</a> dagoeneko URL alias bat duten "
"bideak baztertzeko konfiguratuak daude. URL aliasak soilik sor "
"ditzakezu aliasik ez duten bideentzat."

msgid "Update the URL alias for paths having an old URL alias"
msgstr "Berritu URL alias zaharra duten bideen URL alias-a"

msgid "Regenerate URL aliases for all paths"
msgstr "Berritu helmuga-izenezko alias guztiak bide guztientzat"

msgid "A short name to help you identify this pattern in the patterns list."
msgstr "Patronen zerrendan eredu hau identifikatzen laguntzeko izen labur bat."

msgid "Only delete automatically generated aliases"
msgstr "Automatikoki sortutako aliasak soilik ezabatu"

msgid ""
"When checked, aliases which have been manually set are not affected by "
