msgstr "Seguru diren tokenak"

msgid ""
"List of tokens that are safe to use in alias patterns and do not need "
"to be cleaned. For example urls, aliases, machine names. Separated "
"with a comma."
msgstr ""
"Alias patroietan erabil daitezkeen eta garbitu beharrik ez duten "
"tokenen zerrenda. Adibidez, URLak, aliasak, makina izenak. Komaz "
"banatuta."

