msgid ""
"The features of the <em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> module "
"are included in Drupal core since version 10.3 and therefore "
"<strong>it should be uninstalled</strong>.<br>Since the module is no "
"longer needed, it <em>will</em> be removed in future releases of "
"<em>Admin Toolbar</em> when support for versions lower than 10.3 is "
"dropped.<br>\n"
"See issues: <a href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> and <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Admin Toolbar Links Access Filter</em> moduluko ezaugarriak Drupal "
"oinarrian sartuta daude 10.3 bertsioaz geroztik eta, beraz, "
"<strong>desinstalatu beharko litzateke</strong>.<br>Modulua ez denez "
"beharrezkoa, <em>kenduko</em> da <em>Admin Toolbar</em> moduaren "
"etorkizuneko bertsioetan, 10.3 bertsio baino txikiagokoak ez diren "
"bertsioentzako laguntza ezabatu denean.<br>\n"
"Ikusi arazoak: <a "
"href=\":issue_url1\">#3463291</a> eta <a "
"href=\":issue_url2\">#3487246</a>."

msgid ""
"If set, the search input will be focused when the user presses the "
"keys: \"Alt + a\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with any "
"existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Baloratuta badago, erabiltzaileak \"Alt + a\" teklen konbinazioa "
"sakatzen duenean, bilaketa-sarrera hautatuko da.<br>Itzali ezarpen hau "
"teklatuaren konfigurazioarekin talka egiten badu."

msgid ""
"The Admin Toolbar module provides a better user experience for the "
"default Drupal Toolbar.<br>It is a drop-down menu that allows quicker "
"access to all the administration pages in a more efficient way, with "
"fewer clicks and less scrolling.<br><br>The following settings mostly "
"provide advanced configuration of the JavaScript behavior of the "
"Toolbar sticky and hoverIntent."
msgstr ""
"Admin Toolbar moduluak esperientzia hobea eskaintzen du default Drupal "
"Toolbar-rentzat.<br>Menu bat da, behera jaisten dena, eta "
"administrazio orrietara sarbidea azkarragoa egiten du modu "
"eraginkorrago batean, klik gutxiago eginez eta eskrolatu gutxiago "
"eginez.<br><br>Hurrengo ezarpen gehienak JavaScript-en portaera "
"aurreratua konfiguratzeko balio dute, esate baterako Toolbar-en "
"itsastea eta hoverIntent."

msgid ""
"By default, the Admin Toolbar sticky behavior is <em>enabled</em> so "
"it stays at the top of the browser window when scrolling up or "
"down.<br>Select <em>Disabled</em> to disable Admin Toolbar's sticky "
"behavior so it stays at the top of the page when scrolling up/down and "
"does not follow the browser window."
msgstr ""
"Lehenetsita, Admin Toolbar-aren itsaskorra den portaera "
"<em>gaituta</em> dago, beraz nabigatzailearen leihoaren goialdean "
"geratzen da gora edo behera irristatzen denean.<br>Aukeratu "
"<em>Desgaituta</em> Admin Toolbar-aren itsaskorra den portaera "
"desgaitzeko, orrialdearen goialdean geratu dadin gora/behera "
"irristatzen denean eta nabigatzailearen leihoa jarraitu gabe."

msgid ""
"If set, the toolbar will be hidden or visible when the user presses "
"the keys: \"Alt + p\".<br>Disable this setting if it conflicts with "
"any existing keyboard configuration."
msgstr ""
"Jartzen bada, tresnabarra ezkutatuko da edo bistaratuko da "
"erabiltzaileak honako teklen konbinazioa sakatzen duenean: \"Alt + "
"p\".<br>Desgaitu ezarpen hau teklatuaren konfigurazioarekin bat ez "
"badatorrenean."

msgid ""
"Provides a smoother user experience, where only menu items which are "
"paused over are expanded, to avoid accidental activations.<br>Disable "
"@hoverintent_source_link to use module's default basic JavaScript "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzailearen esperientzia leunagoa eskaintzen du, geldirik dauden "
"menu elementuak bakarrik zabaltzen direnak, ekintza akatsen "
"saihesteko.<br>Desgaitu @hoverintent_source_link moduluaren oinarrizko "
"JavaScript jokabide lehenetsia erabiltzeko."

msgid ""
"Sets the hoverIntent trigger timeout (steps of 250).<br>The higher the "
"value, the longer the menu dropdown stays visible, after the mouse "
"moves out (default: 500ms)."
msgstr ""
"Ezarri hoverIntent aktibatze-denbora-muga (250eko pausoak).<br>Zenbat "
"eta balio handiagoa izan, orduan eta luzeagoa egoten da menuaren "
"beherako zerrenda ikusgai, sagua irteten denetik (lehenetsia: 500ms)."

