msgid ""
"Keep CAPTCHA related counters in the <a href=\":statusreport\">status "
"report</a>. Note that this comes with a performance penalty as "
"updating the counters results in clearing the variable cache."
msgstr ""
"Mantendu CAPTCHAri lotutako kontagailuak <a "
"href=\":statusreport\">egoera txostenean</a>. Kontuan izan hau "
"errendimendu galerarekin datorrela, kontagailuak eguneratzeak aldagai "
"cachea garbitzea eragiten duelako."

msgid ""
"Note that the CAPTCHA module interacts with page caching (see <a "
"href=\":performancesettings\">performance settings</a>). Because the "
"challenge should be unique for each generated form, the caching of the "
"page it appears on is prevented. Make sure that these forms do not "
"appear on too many pages or you will lose much caching efficiency. For "
"example, if you put a CAPTCHA on the user login block, which typically "
"appears on each page for anonymous visitors, caching will practically "
"be disabled. The comment submission forms are another example. In this "
"case you should set the <em>Location of comment submission form</em> "
"to <em>Display on separate page</em> in the comment settings of the "
"relevant <a href=\":contenttypes\">content types</a> for better "
"caching efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Kontuan izan CAPTCHA moduluak orriaren cachearekin elkarreragiten "
"duela (ikus <a href=\":performancesettings\">errendimenduaren "
"ezarpenak</a>). Erronka bakoitza sortutako formulario bakoitzarentzat "
"bakarra izan behar delako, agertzen den orriaren cacheatzea saihesten "
"da. Ziurtatu formulario hauek ez direla orri askotan agertzen, bestela "
"cachearen eraginkortasuna asko galduko duzu. Adibidez, CAPTCHA "
"erabiltzailearen saioa hasteko blokean jartzen baduzu, normalean orri "
"guztietan agertzen dena bisitari anonimoentzat, cacheatzea ia "
"desaktibatuko da. Iruzkinak bidaltzeko formularioak beste adibide bat "
"dira. Kasu honetan, hobe da <em>Iruzkin bidalketa formularioaren "
"kokapena</em> <em>Orri berezian erakutsi</em> jartzea dagokion <a "
"href=\":contenttypes\">eduki motetan</a> iruzkin ezarpenetan, "
"cachearen eraginkortasuna hobetzeko."

msgid ""
"Users with the <em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">permission</a> "
"won't be offered a challenge. Be sure to grant this permission to the "
"trusted users (e.g. site administrators). If you want to test a "
"protected form, be sure to do it as a user without the <em>Skip "
"CAPTCHA</em> permission (e.g. as anonymous user)."
msgstr ""
"<em>Skip CAPTCHA</em> <a href=\":perm\">baimena</a> duten "
"erabiltzaileei ez zaie erronkarekin eskaintzen. Ziurtatu baimen hori "
"erabiltzaile fidagarriari ematea (adibidez, guneko "
"administratzaileei). Babestutako formulario bat probatu nahi baduzu, "
"ziurtatu egiten duzula baimen hori gabe; adibidez, erabiltzaile "
"anonimo moduan."

msgid ""
"CAPTCHA session reuse attack detected on @form_id <br/>Posted CAPTCHA "
"token: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Expected captcha token: "
"@expected_captcha_token"
msgstr ""
"@form_id-en CAPTCHA saio berrerabilpen eraso detektatua "
"<br/>Bidalitako CAPTCHA tokena: @posted_captcha_token <br/>Espero zen "
"CAPTCHA tokena: @expected_captcha_token"

