msgstr "Onartutako entitate motak"

msgid ""
"The Drupal application's codebase must be writable in order to use "
"Automatic Updates. This includes Drupal core, modules, themes and the "
"Composer dependencies in the <code>vendor</code> directory. This makes "
"Automatic Updates incompatible with some hosting platforms."
msgstr ""
"Drupal aplikazioaren kode-basea idatzizko izan behar da Auto "
"Eguneraketak erabiltzeko. Honek barne hartzen du Drupal nukleo, "
"moduluek, gaiek eta <code>vendor</code> direktorioan dauden Composer "
"mendekotasunak. Honek Auto Eguneraketak batzuen ostatu-plataformekin "
"bateragaitzak bihurtzen ditu."

msgid ""
"Staged changes failed to apply, and the site is in an indeterminate "
"state. It is strongly recommended to restore the code and database "
"from a backup."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa atzeratutakoak aplikatzea huts egin du, eta gunea egoera "
"zehaztugabean dago. Gogor iradokitzen da kodea eta datu-basea "
"babeslekutik lehengoratzea."

msgid ""
"Post-apply tasks are running in the same request during which staged "
"changes were applied to the active code base. This can result in "
"unpredictable behavior."
msgstr ""
"Aplikatu ondoren egin beharreko zereginak aldi berean exekutatzen dira "
"aldaketak kode aktiboan ezarrita dauden eskaera berean. Horrek "
"portaera aurreikusi ezinekoak sor ditzake."

msgid ""
"API module providing functionality to stage package installs and "
