"indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"Stage direktorioak @stage_count @stage_info_file instantzia ditu, "
"aktibo direktorioan dauden @active_count izanaren aldean. Honek "
"adierazten du luzapena bikoiztu dela instalatu izan litekeela."

msgid ""
"The stage directory has @stage_count instances of @stage_info_file. "
"This likely indicates that a duplicate extension was installed."
msgstr ""
"Stage direktorioak @stage_info_file-ren @stage_count instantzia "
"dauzka. Honek, ziurrenik, luzapen bikoitza instalatu dela adierazten "
"du."

msgid "The stage root directory will not able to be created at \"@dir\"."
msgstr "Ezingo da \"@dir\" helbidean fase erro direktorioa sortu."

msgid "The stage root directory \"@dir\" is not writable."
msgstr "\"@dir\" eszenatoki erro karpeta ez da idatzekoa."

msgid ""
"It only allows supported Composer plugins. If you have any, see <a "
"href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">What if it "
"says I have unsupported Composer plugins in my codebase?</a>."
msgstr ""
"Bakarrik onartzen ditu lagundutako Composer pluginak. Badituzue "
"batzuk, ikusi <a "
"href=\"#package-manager-faq-unsupported-composer-plugin\">Zer "
"gertatzen da nire kode-basean lagunduko ez diren Composer pluginak "
"ditudala esaten badu?</a>."

msgid ""
"If <code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> is installed, it must be "
"defined as a dependency of the main project (i.e., it must be listed "
"in the <code>require</code> or <code>require-dev</code> section of "
"<code>composer.json</code>). You can run the following command in your "
"site root to add it as a dependency of the main project:"
msgstr ""
"<code>cweagans/composer-patches</code> instalatuta badago, proiektu "
"nagusiaren menpeko gisa definitu behar da (hau da, "
"<code>composer.json</code>-eko <code>require</code> edo "
"<code>require-dev</code> atalean agertu behar da). Honako komando hau "
"exekutatu dezakezu zure gune-erroan proiektu nagusiaren menpeko gisa "
"gehitzeko:"

msgid "Cannot claim the stage because no stage has been created."
msgstr ""
"Ezinezkoa da eszenatokia eskuratzea, ez baitago sortutako eszenatoki "
"bat."

msgid ""
"All composer plugins are allowed because "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> is configured to <code>true</code>. "
"This is an unacceptable security risk."
msgstr ""
"Composer plugin guztiak onartzen dira "
"<code>config.allow-plugins</code> <code>true</code>-ean konfiguratuta "
"dagoelako. Hau arrisku segurantzazko onargaitza da."

msgctxt "Validation"
msgid "Extension exists"
msgstr "Luzapena existitzen da"

msgid ""
"The breakpoint group typically only needs a single breakpoint with an "
"empty media query in order to do <em>viewport sizing.</em> Multiple "
"breakpoints are used for changing the crop or aspect ratio of images "
"at different viewport sizes, which is often referred to as <em>art "
"direction.</em> A new breakpoint group should be created for each "
"aspect ratio to avoid content shift. Once you select a breakpoint "
"group, you can choose which breakpoints to use for the responsive "
"image style. By default, the option <em>do not use this "
"breakpoint</em> is selected for each breakpoint. See the <a "
"href=\":breakpoint_help\">help page of the Breakpoint module</a> for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Breakpointza-taldeak normalean breakpointza bakarra behar izaten du, "
"edukirik gabeko media kontsultarekin, <em>ikus-leihoaren tamaina "
"egiteko.</em> Breakpoint anitz erabiltzen dira irudien mozketa edo "
"alderantzizko erlazioa aldatzeko ikus-leihoaren tamaina desberdinetan, "
"eta hori maiz <em>artelan zuzendaritza</em> bezala ezagutzen da. "
"Alderantzizko erlazio bakoitzeko breakpoint taldea berri bat sortu "
"beharko litzateke edukia lekualdatzea saihesteko. Breakpoint taldea "
"hautatzen duzunean, erabiliko dituzun breakpoint-ak hautatu ditzakezu "
"irudi estilo erantzunkorrerako. Lehentasunez, hautapena <em>ez erabili "
"breakpoint hau</em> hautatzen da breakpoint bakoitzerako. Informazio "
"gehiago lortzeko, ikusi <a href=\":breakpoint_help\">Breakpoint "
"moduluko laguntza orria</a>."

msgid ""
"Composer must be configured for secure downloads. This means that <a "
"href=\":disable-tls\">the <code>disable-tls</code> option</a> must be "
"<code>false</code>, and <a href=\":secure-http\">the "
"<code>secure-http</code> option</a> must be <code>true</code> in the "
"<code>config</code> section of your <code>composer.json</code> file. "
"If these options are not set in your <code>composer.json</code>, "
"Composer will behave securely by default. To set these values at the "
"command line, run the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Composer segurtasunez deskargatzeko konfiguratu behar da. Honek esan "
"nahi du <a href=\":disable-tls\"><code>disable-tls</code> aukera</a> "
"<code>false</code> izan behar dela, eta <a "
"href=\":secure-http\"><code>secure-http</code> aukera</a> "
"<code>true</code> izan behar dela zure <code>composer.json</code> "
"fitxategiko <code>config</code> atalean. Aukera hauek zure "
"<code>composer.json</code> fitxategian ez badaude ezarrita, "
"Composer-ek lehenetsita modu seguruan jokatuko du. Baloia komando "
"lerroan ezartzeko, exekutatu hurrengo komandoak:"

msgid "Problem detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgid_plural "Problems detected in lock file during stage operations."
msgstr[0] ""
"Faseko operazioetan blokeatzeko fitxategian arazoak detektatu dira.  "
"\n"
"Faseko operazioetan blokeatzeko fitxategian arazoak detektatu dira."

msgid ""
"The stage directory is not protected by PHP-TUF, which is required to "
"use Package Manager securely."
msgstr ""
"Stage direktorioa ez dago PHP-TUF-ek babestuta, eta hori beharrezkoa "
"da Package Manager segurtasunez erabiltzeko."

msgid ""
"There appear to be no pending Composer operations because the active "
"lock file (@active_file) and the staged lock file (@staged_file) are "
"identical."
msgstr ""
"Itxuraz ez dago itxaron behar diren Composer operaziorik, izan ere, "
"aktibo dagoen blokeatutako fitxategia (@active_file) eta prest dagoen "
"blokeatutako fitxategia (@staged_file) berdinak dira."

