msgstr "TUF ez dago aktibatuta <code>@url</code> biltegian."

msgid ""
"The Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks module is a Feature Flag "
"module which exposes all fields on all bundles as field blocks for use "
"in Layout Builder."
msgstr ""
"Layout Builder Expose All Field Blocks modulua Feature Flag modulu bat "
"da, eta bilduma guztietako eremu guztiak eremu bloke gisa ikusgai "
"jartzen ditu Layout Builder-en erabilerarako."

msgid ""
"For example, if Layout Builder is enabled on a Node bundle (Content "
"type), and that bundle's display is using field blocks from the User "
"entity (e.g. the Author's name), but Layout Builder is not enabled for "
"the User bundle, then that field block would no longer exist after "
"uninstalling this module."
msgstr ""
"Adibidez, Layout Builder Nodo bildu batean (Eduki mota) aktibatuta "
"badago, eta bildu horren bistaratzeak Erabiltzaile entitateko eremu "
"blokeak erabiltzen baditu (adibidez, Egilearen izena), baina Layout "
"Builder ez badago aktibatuta Erabiltzaile bilduarentzat, orduan eremu "
"bloke hori ez da gehiago existituko modulu hau desinstalatzean."

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the <a "
"href=\":moderation\">Content Moderation module</a>."
msgstr ""
"<em>Soilik</em> gehi dezakezu lan-fluxuak <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Lan-fluxuen orrian</a>, APIa erabiltzen duen "
"modulu bat instalatu ondoren, hala nola <a "
"href=\":moderation\">Edukiaren Moderazio moduluak</a>."

msgid ""
"You can <em>only</em> add workflows on the <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflows page</a>, after you have installed a "
"module that leverages the API such as the Content Moderation module."
msgstr ""
"<em>Bakarrik</em> gehi dezakezu workflow-ak <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflow orrian</a>, APIa erabiltzen duen modulua "
"instalatu ondoren, adibidez Edukiaren Moderazioaren modulua."

msgid ""
"A workflow requires at least two states. States can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Lan-fluxuak gutxienez bi egoera behar ditu. Egoerak gehitu daitezke "
"lan-fluxua gehitu edo editatzean <a href=\":workflows\">Lan-fluxuen "
"orrian</a>."

msgid ""
"A transition defines in which state an item can be save as next. It "
"has one destination state, but can have several states <em>from</em> "
"which the transition can be applied. Transitions can be added when you "
"add or edit a workflow on the <a href=\":workflows\">Workflows "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Transizio batek zein egoeratan gorde daitekeen elementu bat hurrengoa "
"definiatzen du. Egoera bat du helmuga moduan, baina hainbat egoera "
"izan ditzake <em>nongo</em> transizioa aplika daitekeen. Transizioak "
"gehi daitezke workflow bat gehitzen edo editatzen duzunean <a "
"href=\":workflows\">Workflowen orrian</a>."

msgid ""
"The UploadProgress PHP extension must be enabled to configure the "
"progress indicator. Check the <a href=\":status\">status report</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"UploadProgress PHP luzapena aktibatuta egon behar da aurrerapen "
"adierazlea konfiguratzeko. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, egiaztatu <a "
"href=\":status\">egoeraren txostena</a>."

