"\"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"
msgstr ""
"<code>composer</code> exekutagarriaren bertsioak <code>@version</code> "
"bete behar du. Informazio gehiagorako, ikusi <a href=\":url\">Composer "
"dokumentazioa</a>, edo erabili komando hau Composer zure proiektuan "
"sartzeko: <code>composer require \"composer/composer:@version\"</code>"

msgid ""
"The path to Composer is set in configuration, which is no longer "
"supported. To fix this, add <code>composer/composer</code> to your "
"project's dependencies by running <code>composer require "
"'composer/composer:@version'</code>, <em>or</em> add the following "
"line to <code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> "
"for more information."
msgstr ""
"Composer-en bidea konfigurazioan zehazten da, eta hori ez da jada "
"onartzen. Horri irtenbidea emateko, gehitu "
"<code>composer/composer</code> zure proiektuaren menpekoen artean "
"<code>composer require 'composer/composer:@version'</code> exekutatuz, "
"<em>edo</em> gehitu lerro hau <code>settings.php</code>-ra: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_composer_path'] = "
"'@composer_path';</code>. Informazio gehiago lortzeko, ikus <a "
"href=\":url\">aldaketa-erregistro hau</a>."

msgid "Path to <code>rsync</code> is configured"
msgstr "<code>rsync</code>-erako bidea konfiguratu da"

msgid ""
"The path to <code>rsync</code> is set in configuration, which is no "
"longer supported. To fix this, add the following line to "
"<code>settings.php</code>: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"See <a href=\":url\">this change record</a> for more information."
msgstr ""
"<code>rsync</code>-erako bidea konfigurasioan ezarri da, baina hori ez "
"da gehiago onartzen. Horretarako, gehitu lerro hau "
"<code>settings.php</code>-ra: "
"<code>$settings['package_manager_rsync_path'] = '@rsync_path';</code>. "
"Informazio gehiago lortzeko, begiratu <a "
"href=\":url\">aldaketa-erregistro hau</a>."

