msgid ""
"The topic of the resource. Typically, the subject will be represented "
"using keywords, key phrases, or classification codes. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary. To describe the spatial or "
"temporal topic of the resource, use the Coverage element."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearen gaia. Oro har, gaia giltzarri-hitzak, giltzarri-esaldiak "
"edo sailkapen-kodeak erabiliz adieraziko da. Gomendatutako praktika "
"onena hizkera kontrolatua erabiltzea da. Baliabidearen gaia espaziala "
"edo denbora-aragikoa deskribatzeko, erabili Coverage elementua."

msgid ""
"An account of the resource. Description may include but is not limited "
"to: an abstract, a table of contents, a graphical representation, or a "
"free-text account of the resource."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearen azalpena. Deskribapena honako hauek barne hartu ditzake, "
"baina ez da hauekin mugatzen: laburpena, edukiaren taula, irudi baten "
"bidezko ordezkapena, edo baliabideari buruzko testu librea."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making the resource available. Examples of a "
"Publisher include a person, an organization, or a service. Typically, "
"the name of a Publisher should be used to indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidea erabilgarri jartzeaz arduratzen den entitate bat. "
"Argitaletxearen adibideak pertsona, erakunde edo zerbitzu bat izan "
"daitezke. Oro har, entitatea adierazteko Argitaletxearen izena erabili "
"beharko litzateke."

msgid ""
"An entity responsible for making contributions to the resource. "
"Examples of a Contributor include a person, an organization, or a "
"service. Typically, the name of a Contributor should be used to "
"indicate the entity."
msgstr ""
"Tresnari ekarpenak egiten dizkion entitatea. Ekarpen-egile baten "
"adibideak pertsona, erakunde edo zerbitzu bat izan daitezke. Oro har, "
"ekarpen-egile baten izena erabili behar da entitatea adierazteko."

msgid ""
"A point or period of time associated with an event in the lifecycle of "
"the resource. Date may be used to express temporal information at any "
"level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding "
"scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF]."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearen bizitza-zikloko gertaera batekin lotutako une edo epe "
"bat. Data erabil daiteke denbora-informazioa azaltzeko edozein "
"granularitate-mailatan. Praktika onena gomendatzen da kodeketa eskema "
"bat erabiltzea, hala nola ISO 8601eko W3CDTF profila [W3CDTF]."

msgid ""
"The file format, physical medium, or dimensions of the resource. "
"Examples of dimensions include size and duration. Recommended best "
"practice is to use a controlled vocabulary such as the list of "
"Internet Media Types [MIME]."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategiaren formatua, hedabide fisikoa edo baliabidearen neurriak. "
"Neurrien adibideak tamaina eta iraupena dira. Gomendatutako ohitura "
"onena hiztegi kontrolatua erabiltzea da, adibidez Interneteko Media "
"Moten zerrenda [MIME]."

msgid ""
"An unambiguous reference to the resource within a given context. "
"Recommended best practice is to identify the resource by means of a "
"string conforming to a formal identification system."
msgstr ""
"Testuinguru jakin batean baliabideari egiten zaion erreferentzia "
"argia. Praktika onena gomendatzen dena da baliabidea identifikatzea "
"identifikazio sistema formal bati jarraitzen dion kate baten bidez."

msgid ""
"A related resource from which the described resource is derived. The "
"described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole "
"or in part. Recommended best practice is to identify the related "
"resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification "
"system."
msgstr ""
"Deskribatutako baliabidea haren jatorria den lotutako baliabide "
"batetik eratortzen da. Deskribatutako baliabidea lotutako baliabide "
"horretatik osorik edo zati batean eratortzen daiteke. Praktika onena "
"gomendatzen dena da lotutako baliabidea identifikazio sistemarik "
"formal bati jarraitzen dion kate baten bidez identifikatzea."

msgid ""
"A related resource. Recommended best practice is to identify the "
"related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal "
"identification system."
msgstr ""
"Baliabide lotua. Praktika onena gomendatua da baliabide lotua "
"identifikatzea sistema ofizial bateko identifikazio-kate batekin bat "
"datorren kate baten bidez."

msgid ""
"The spatial or temporal topic of the resource, the spatial "
"applicability of the resource, or the jurisdiction under which the "
"resource is relevant. Spatial topic and spatial applicability may be a "
"named place or a location specified by its geographic coordinates. "
"Temporal topic may be a named period, date, or date range. A "
"jurisdiction may be a named administrative entity or a geographic "
"place to which the resource applies. Recommended best practice is to "
"use a controlled vocabulary such as the Thesaurus of Geographic Names "
"[TGN]. Where appropriate, named places or time periods can be used in "
"preference to numeric identifiers such as sets of coordinates or date "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearen gai espaziala edo denborazkoa, baliabidearen "
"aplikagarritasun espaziala, edo baliabideak lotura duen jurisdikzioa. "
"Gai espaziala eta aplikagarritasun espaziala lekua izendatua izan "
"daitezke edo kokapen geografikoaren koordinatuekin zehaztutako lekua. "
"Gai denborazkoa epe izendatua, data edo data-tartea izan daiteke. "
"Jurisdikzioa izendatutako administrazio-erakunde bat edo baliabideari "
"aplikatzen dion leku geografiko bat izan daiteke. Gomendatutako "
"praktika onena hiztegi kontrolatua erabiltzea da, hala nola Thesaurus "
"of Geographic Names [TGN]. Egokitzat jotzen denean, leku edo denbora "
"epe izendatuak erabil daitezke lehentasunez koordinatu multzo edo "
"data-tarte bezalako zenbaki identifikatzaileekin alderatuta."

msgid ""
"Information about rights held in and over the resource. Typically, "
"rights information includes a statement about various property rights "
"associated with the resource, including intellectual property rights."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearen gainean eta barruan dituen eskubideei buruzko "
"informazioa. Orokorrean, eskubideen informazioak baliabidearekin "
"lotutako higiezinen eskubideen inguruko adierazpen bat barne hartzen "
"du, barne dituena eskubide intelektualak."

msgid ""
"A description that concisely summarizes the content of the page, as "
"appropriate for presentation within a Tweet. Do not re-use the title "
"text as the description, or use this field to describe the general "
"services provided by the website. The string will be truncated, by "
"Twitter, at the word to 200 characters."
msgstr ""
"Orrialdearen edukia laburbiltzen duen deskribapen bat, Tweet batean "
