msgstr "Mugikorra: Ikuspegia"

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an Android mobile app. Should be in "
"the format 'package_name/host_path', e.g. "
"'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'. The 'android-app://' "
"prefix will be included automatically."
msgstr ""
"Android mugikorrerako aplikazio batera deeplinking egiteko katea "
"pertsonalizatua. Hurrengo formatuan egon behar da: "
"'package_name/host_path', adibidez, "
"'com.example.android/example/hello-screen'. 'android-app://' "
"atzekaldea automatikoki gehituko da."

msgid ""
"This informs iOS devices to display a banner to a specific app. If "
"used, it must provide the 'app-id' value, the 'affiliate-data' and "
"'app-argument' values are optional."
msgstr ""
"Honek iOS gailuei jakinarazten die bannerr bat erakutsi dezatela "
"aplikazio zehatz bati. Erabiliz gero, 'app-id' balioa zehaztu behar "
"da; 'affiliate-data' eta 'app-argument' balioak boluntarioak dira."

msgid ""
"If set to 'yes', the application will run in full-screen mode; the "
"default behavior is to use Safari to display web content."
msgstr ""
"Bai» bezala ezarrita badago, aplikazioa pantaila osoko moduan "
"exekutatuko da; alderantzizko portaera Safari erabiltzea da web edukia "
"erakusteko."

msgid ""
"Requires the 'Web app capable' meta tag to be set to 'yes'. May be set "
"to 'default', 'black', or 'black-translucent'."
msgstr ""
"'Web app capable' meta etiketa 'yes' bezala ezarri behar da. "
"'default', 'black' edo 'black-translucent' bezala ere ezar daiteke."

msgid ""
"A legacy meta tag for older versions of Internet Explorer on Windows, "
"use the value 'on' to enable it; this tag is ignored by all other "
"browsers."
msgstr ""
"Internet Explorer-en bertsio zaharretarako Windows-en, erabiltzen den "
"meta tag zaharra da, gaitzeko 'on' balioa erabili; tag hau beste "
"nabigatzaile guztiek ez dute kontuan hartzen."

msgid ""
"If set to 'telephone=no' the page will not be checked for phone "
"numbers, which would be presented."
msgstr ""
"Telefonoa=no\" bezala ezarrita badago, orrialdea ez da telefono "
"zenbakientzat egiaztatuko, eta horiek ez lirateke aurkeztuko."

msgid ""
"Some older mobile browsers will expect this meta tag to be set to "
"'true' to indicate that the site has been designed with mobile "
"browsers in mind."
msgstr ""
"Android zahar batzuek meta etiketa hau 'true' bezala ezarrita egotea "
"espero dute, guneak nabigatzaile mugikorretarako diseinatua dela "
"adierazteko."

msgid ""
"A custom string for deeplinking to an iOS mobile app. Should be in the "
"format 'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', e.g. "
"123456/example/hello-screen'. The 'ios-app://' prefix will be included "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"iOS mugikorreko aplikazio batera deeplinking egiteko katea "
"pertsonalizatua. Hurrengo formatuan egon beharko litzateke: "
"'itunes_id/scheme/host_path', adibidez, '123456/example/hello-screen'. "
"'ios-app://' aurrizkia automatikoki gehituko da."

msgid ""
"Using the value 'width' tells certain mobile Internet Explorer "
"browsers to display as-is, without being resized. Alternatively a "
"numerical width may be used to indicate the desired page width the "
"page should be rendered in: '240' is the suggested default, '176' for "
"older browsers or '480' for newer devices with high DPI screens."
msgstr ""
"'width' balioa erabiltzeak mugikorretarako Internet Explorer "
"nabigatzaile batzuei esaten die orria tamainaz aldatu gabe jatorrizko "
"moduan erakutsi dezatela. Bestela, zenbaki batean adierazitako "
"zabalera erabil daiteke orriak erakutsi beharreko zabaleraren "
"adierazle gisa: '240' da lehenetsitako gomendioa, '176' nabigatzaile "
"zaharrentzat edo '480' DPI handiko pantailak dituzten gailu "
"berrientzat."

msgid ""
"Allows tasks to be defined on child domains of the fully qualified "
"domain name associated with the pinned site. Should be either 'true' "
"or 'false'."
msgstr ""
"Aukera ematen du finkatutako guneari lotutako izen dominu osoko "
"izenaren azpiko domeinuetan zereginak definitzeko. 'true' edo 'false' "
"izan beharko luke."

msgid ""
"Should contain the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Browser "
"configuration schema</a> file that further controls tile "
"customizations."
msgstr ""
"Tile pertsonalizazioak gehiago kontrolatzen dituen <a "
"href='https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/dn320426(v=vs.85).aspx'>Nabigatzailearen "
"konfigurazio eskema</a> fitxategiaren URL osoa izan beharko luke."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string containing 'polling-uri=' (required), "
"'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', 'polling-uri4=' and 'polling-uri5=' "
"to indicate the URLs for notifications. May also contain a "
"'frequency=' value to specify how often (in minutes) the URLs will be "
"polled; limited to 30, 60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default). May also "
"contain the value 'cycle=' to control the notifications cycle."
msgstr ""
"'polling-uri=' (beharrezkoa), 'polling-uri2=', 'polling-uri3=', "
"'polling-uri4=' eta 'polling-uri5=' dituen puntu eta koma batez "
"bereizitako kate bat, jakinarazpenetarako URL-ak adierazteko. Era "
"berean, 'frequency=' balioa izan dezake, noizbehinka (minutuetan) "
"URL-ak kontsultatu behar diren zehazteko; 30, 60, 360, 720 edo 1440 "
"(lehentasunezkoa) mugatuta. Era berean, 'cycle=' balioa izan dezake "
"jakinarazpenen zikloa kontrolatzeko."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string defining the 'jump' list task. Should "
"contain the 'name=' value to specify the task's name, the "
"'action-uri=' value to set the URL to load when the jump list is "
"clicked, the 'icon-uri=' value to set the URL to an icon file to be "
"displayed, and 'window-type=' set to either 'tab' (default), 'self' or "
"'window' to control how the link opens in the browser."
msgstr ""
"'Jump' zerrendaren ataza definitzen duen punktuko eta koma batez "
"bereizitako kate bat. 'name=' balioa izan behar du atalari izena "
"zehazteko, 'action-uri=' balioa jump zerrenda klik egiten denean "
"kargatu beharreko URLa ezartzeko, 'icon-uri=' balioa erakutsiko den "
"ikono fitxategi baten URLa ezartzeko, eta 'window-type=' balioa 'tab' "
"(lehenetsia), 'self' edo 'window' izan daitekeela nabigatzailean "
"esteka nola irekitzen den kontrolatzeko."

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated value that controls the dimensions of the "
"initial window. Should contain the values 'width=' and 'height=' to "
"control the width and height respectively."
msgstr ""
"Hasierako leihoaren neurriak kontrolatzen dituen balio bat, puntu eta "
"komaz bereizita. 'width=' eta 'height=' balioak eduki behar ditu, "
"zabalera eta altuera hurrenez hurren kontrolatzeko."

msgid "Metatag: Open Graph Products"
msgstr "Metatag: Open Graph Produktuak"

msgid ""
"In the context of search engine optimization, providing an extensive "
"set of meta tags may help improve the site's and pages' rankings, thus "
"may aid with achieving a more prominent display of the content within "
"search engine results. They can also be used to tailor how content is "
"displayed when shared on social networks. For additional information, "
"see the <a href=\":online\">online documentation for Metatag</a>."
msgstr ""
"Bilatzaile optimizazioaren testuinguruan, meta etiketetako multzo "
"zabala emateak lagun dezake gune eta orrien sailkapenak hobetzen, eta "
"horrela edukia bilatzaile emaitzen barruan modu nabarmenago batean "
"erakustea lagundu dezake. Gainera, edukia sare sozialetan "
"partekatzerakoan nola erakutsiko den pertsonalizatzeko ere erabil "
"daitezke. Informazio osagarri gehiago lortzeko, ikus <a "
"href=\":online\">Metatag-en lineako dokumentazioa</a>."

msgid ""
"Override each of the <a href=\":defaults\">other defaults</a>, fill in "
"specific values and tokens that each item should have by default. This "
"allows e.g. for all nodes to have different values than taxonomy "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"Gainidatzi <a href=\":defaults\">beste lehenetsitako bakoitza</a>, eta "
"bete elementu bakoitzak lehenetsi beharko lituzkeen balio eta token "
"zehatzak. Honek, adibidez, nodo guztiek termino taksonomikoetatik "
"desberdinak diren balioak izatea ahalbidetzen du."

msgid ""
"These meta tags are designed to point visitors to versions of the "
"current page in other languages."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketa hauek bisitariak orri honen bertsioetara zuzentzeko "
"diseinatuta daude, beste hizkuntza batzuetan."

msgid "Sitename"
msgstr "Gune izena"

msgid ""
"Meta tag patterns are passed down from one level to the next unless "
"they are overridden. To view a summary of the individual meta tags and "
"the pattern for a specific configuration, click on its name below."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketetako ereduak maila bateanetik hurrengora pasatzen dira, "
"baldin eta ez badituzte gainditzen. Meta etiketako banakoen laburpena "
"eta konfigurazio zehatz baterako eredua ikusteko, klik egin bere "
"izenean behetik."

msgid ""
"The URL of an video which should represent the content. For best "
"results use a source that is at least 1200 x 630 pixels in size, but "
"at least 600 x 316 pixels is a recommended minimum. Object types "
"supported include video.episode, video.movie, video.other, and "
"video.tv_show."
msgstr ""
"Edukiaren ordezkari izan behar duen bideoren URL-a. Emaitza onenak "
"lortzeko, gutxienez 1200 x 630 pixel neurrikoa den iturburu bat "
"erabili, baina gutxienez 600 x 316 pixel izatea gomendatzen da minimo "
"bezala. Onartzen diren objektu motak honako hauek dira: video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other eta video.tv_show."

msgid ""
"The type of video referenced above. Should be either  video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other, and video.tv_show. Note: there should be one "
"value for each video, and having more than there are videos may cause "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"Goian aipatutako bideo motak izan behar dira video.episode, "
"video.movie, video.other edo video.tv_show. Kontuan izan: bideo "
"bakoitzerako balio bat egon behar dela, eta bideo kopuruarekin bat ez "
"datorren balio kopuruak arazoak sor ditzakeela."

msgid "Provides views integration for metatags."
msgstr "Metatagetarako ikuspegi integrazioa eskaintzen du."

msgid "Metatags for @view : @display have been saved."
msgstr "@view : @display metatagiak gorde dira."

msgid "Edit @language translation for %view: %display metatags"
msgstr "Editatu @language itzulpena %view: %display metatags-entzako"

msgid "Metatag display extender"
msgstr "Metatag erakutsi luzatzailea"

msgid "Metatag settings for this view."
msgstr "Ikuspegi honetarako Metatag ezarpenak."

msgid ""
"A link to the preferred page location or URL of the content of this "
"page, to help eliminate duplicate content penalties from search "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"Orriaren edukirako orrialde gustukoaren kokapenera edo URL-era esteka "
"bat, bilatzaileek edukien bikoiztutako zigorak saihesten laguntzeko."

msgid ""
"The text to display in the title bar of a visitor's web browser when "
"they view this page. This meta tag may also be used as the title of "
"the page when a visitor bookmarks or favorites this page, or as the "
"page title in a search engine result. It is common to append "
"'[site:name]' to the end of this, so the site's name is automatically "
"added. It is recommended that the title is no greater than 55 - 65 "
"characters long, including spaces."
msgstr ""
"Orri honek bisitariaren web nabigatzailearen goiburuko barran "
"erakutsiko den testua. Meta etiketa hau orriaren izenburu gisa ere "
"erabil daiteke, bisitariak orria markatzailean edo gustukoen artean "
"gehitzen duenean, edo bilatzaile baten emaitzetan orriaren izenburu "
"gisa. Ohikoa da azkenean '[site:name]' gehitzea, horrela automatikoki "
"plataformaren izena gehitzen delako. Gomendatzen da izenburuak ez "
"izatea 55 eta 65 karaktere bitartekoa, espazioak barne."

msgid "URL for a version of this page in %langcode"
msgstr "Orri honen bertsio bat %langcode hizkuntzan duten URL-a"

msgid "Hreflang per language"
msgstr "Hreflang hizkuntza bakoitzeko"

msgid ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Sets a "
"cookie</a> on the visitor's browser. Can be in either NAME=VALUE "
"format, or a more verbose format including the path and expiration "
"date; see the link for full details on the syntax."
msgstr ""
"<a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_http_equiv_set_cookie'>Cookie "
"bat ezartzen du</a> bisitariaren nabigatzailean. NAME=VALUE formatuan "
"egon daiteke, edo bide eta iraungitze data barne hartzen dituen "
"formatua gehiago deskribatua izan daiteke; sintaxiarako xehetasun "
"osoak estekan ikusi daitezke."

msgid "Enables metatags for custom routes"
msgstr "Baimendu metatags ibilbide pertsonalizatuentzat"

msgid "Add meta tag for custom route"
msgstr "Berria ibilbide pertsonalizatuarentzat meta etiketa gehitu"

msgid "Add custom metatag"
msgstr "Gehitu metataga pertsonalizatua"

msgid "The path must begin with /"
msgstr "Bidea /-rekin hasi behar da"

msgid "The admin routes should not have metatags."
msgstr "Admin bideek ez dute metatagik izan behar."

msgid "There are already metatags created for this route."
msgstr "Bide honetarako metatagsak jada sortuta daude."

msgid "The path does not exist as an internal Drupal route."
msgstr "Bidea ez da barruko Drupal ibilbide bat bezala existitzen."

msgid "Created metatags for the path: @url. Internal route: @route."
msgstr "@url bidearentzako metatageak sortu dira. Barneko ibilbidea: @route."

msgid "The metatags could not be created for the path: @url."
msgstr "Metatagleak ezin izan dira sortu ibilbide honetarako: @url."

msgid "Dublin Core: Instructional Method"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Irakaskuntza Metodoa"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Format Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Honen Formatoa Da"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Part Of"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Zati Da"

msgid "Dublin Core: Is Referenced By"
msgstr "Dublin Core: Honen bidez aipatzen da"

msgid ""
"Information about who can access the resource or an indication of its "
"security status. Access Rights may include information regarding "
"access or restrictions based on privacy, security, or other policies."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileak baliabidera sar daitezkeenaren informazioa edo bere "
"segurtasun-egoeraren adierazpena. Sarbide-eskubideek pribatutasun, "
"segurtasun edo bestelako politiketan oinarritutako sarbidea edo "
"murrizketak azaltzen dituzten informazioak barne har ditzakete."

msgid ""
"A bibliographic reference for the resource. Recommended practice is to "
"include sufficient bibliographic detail to identify the resource as "
"unambiguously as possible."
msgstr ""
"Bibliografia erreferentzia baliabiderako. Praktika gomendatua da "
"bibliografia datu nahikoak sartzea baliabidea ahalik eta modu "
"argienean identifikatzeko."

msgid ""
"Date of acceptance of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Accepted may be relevant are a thesis (accepted by a university "
"department) or an article (accepted by a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Iturria onartzeko data. Date Accepted egokia izan daitekeen iturrien "
"adibideak honako hauek dira: tesia (unibertsitate sailek onartutakoa) "
"edo artikulua (aldizkari batek onartutakoa)."

msgid ""
"Date of submission of the resource. Examples of resources to which a "
"Date Submitted may be relevant are a thesis (submitted to a university "
"department) or an article (submitted to a journal)."
msgstr ""
"Iturburuaren aurkezpen-data. Aurkezpen-data garrantzitsua izan "
"daitekeen iturburu adibideak dira tesi bat (unibertsitate sail bati "
"aurkeztua) edo artikulu bat (aldizkari bati aurkeztua)."

msgid ""
"A process, used to engender knowledge, attitudes and skills, that the "
"described resource is designed to support. Instructional Method will "
"typically include ways of presenting instructional materials or "
"conducting instructional activities, patterns of learner-to-learner "
"and learner-to-instructor interactions, and mechanisms by which group "
"and individual levels of learning are measured. Instructional methods "
"include all aspects of the instruction and learning processes from "
"planning and implementation through evaluation and feedback."
msgstr ""
"Prozesu bat, ezagutza, jarrera eta trebetasunak sortzeko erabiltzen "
"dena, eta deskribatutako baliabideak babesteko diseinatua dagoena. "
"Irakaskuntza Metodoak normalean irakaskuntza materialak aurkezteko edo "
"irakaskuntza jarduerak egiteko modu desberdinak barne hartzen ditu, "
"ikasleen arteko eta ikasle eta irakaslearen arteko elkarreraginen "
"ereduak, eta talde eta banakako ikaskuntzaren mailak neurtzeko "
"mekanismoak. Irakaskuntza metodoek irakaskuntza eta ikaskuntza prozesu "
"guztien alderdiak barne hartzen dituzte, plangintzatik eta "
"aplikaziotik hasi eta ebaluazio eta iradokizunetara arte."

msgid ""
"A related resource of which the described resource is a version, "
"edition, or adaptation. Changes in version imply substantive changes "
"in content rather than differences in format."
msgstr ""
"Deskribatutako baliabidearen bertsio, edizio edo egokitzapen den "
"baliabide lotua. Bertsioaren aldaketek edukiaren aldaketa sakonak "
"adierazten dituzte, ez formatuaren desberdintasunak."

msgid ""
"An entity that mediates access to the resource and for whom the "
"resource is intended or useful. In an educational context, a mediator "
"might be a parent, teacher, teaching assistant, or care-giver."
msgstr ""
"Baliabidearako sarbidea bitartekatzen duen entitate bat, eta "
"baliabidea norentzat den pentsatua edo baliagarria dena. "
"Hezkuntza-ingurune batean, bitartekari izan daiteke guraso, irakasle, "
"irakaslerako laguntzaile edo zaintzailea."

msgid ""
"A statement of any changes in ownership and custody of the resource "
"since its creation that are significant for its authenticity, "
"integrity, and interpretation. The statement may include a description "
"of any changes successive custodians made to the resource."
msgstr ""
"Jabetza eta baliabidearen zaintzan egindako aldaketa edozein "
"adierazpen, sortu zenetik, bere egiaztagarritasuna, osotasuna eta "
"interpretazioarentzat garrantzitsua dena. Adierazpenak baliabidea "
"zaintzen zuten pertsona edo erakundeek egindako aldaketa edozeinen "
"deskribapena ere barne hartu dezake."

msgid "Spatial Coverage"
msgstr "Estaldura Espaziala"

msgid ""
"Links a book to an author's Facebook profile, should be either URLs to "
"the author's profile page or their Facebook profile IDs."
msgstr ""
"Liburu bat egile baten Facebook profilera lotzen du, egilearen "
"profilaren orrira edo haien Facebook profilaren IDetara zuzendutako "
"URLak izan beharko lirateke."

msgid ""
"The URL of an image which should represent the content. The image must "
"be at least 200 x 200 pixels in size; 600 x 316 pixels is a "
"recommended minimum size, and for best results use an image least 1200 "
"x 630 pixels in size. Supports PNG, JPEG and GIF formats. Should not "
"be used if og:image:url is used. Note: if multiple images are added "
"many services (e.g. Facebook) will default to the largest image, not "
"specifically the first one."
msgstr ""
"Edukia ordezkatuko duen irudi baten URL-a. Irudiak gutxienez 200 x 200 "
"piksel tamaina izan behar du; gomendatutako gutxieneko tamaina 600 x "
"316 pixel da, eta emaitza onenak lortzeko, gutxienez 1200 x 630 pixel "
"tamaina duen irudi bat erabili. PNG, JPEG eta GIF formatuak onartzen "
"ditu. Ez da erabili behar og:image:url erabiltzen bada. Oharra: irudi "
"anitz gehitzen badira, zerbitzu askok (adibidez, Facebook-ek) handiena "
"den irudia hartuko dute lehenengoa ez specificoki."

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price amount"
msgstr "Open Graph Produktua: Prezio kopurua"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price currency"
msgstr "Open Graph Produktua: Prezioaren moneta"

msgid "Metatag: Pinterest"
msgstr "Metatag: Pinterest"

msgid "Provides support for Pinterest's custom meta tags."
msgstr "Pinterest-en meta tag pertsonalizatuentzako laguntza eskaintzen du."

msgid "Pinterest: Description"
msgstr "Pinterest: Deskribapena"

msgid "Pinterest: ID"
msgstr "Pinterest: ID"

msgid "Pinterest: Media"
msgstr "Pinterest: Media"

msgid "Pinterest: No hover"
msgstr "Pinterest: Ez da gainditu"

msgid "Pinterest: No pin"
msgstr "Pinterest: Ez da pinik egin"

msgid "Pinterest: URL"
msgstr "Pinterest: URLa"

msgid ""
"A set of meta tags used to control how the site's content is consumed "
"by <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a>."
msgstr ""
"Webgune baten edukia <a href='https://pinterest.com/'>Pinterest</a> "
"nola kontsumitzen den kontrolatzeko erabiltzen den meta etiketen "
"multzoa."

msgid "The Canonical Pinterest object to pin."
msgstr "Pinterest objektu kanonikoa itsatsi."

msgid "The URL of media which should represent the content."
msgstr "Edukia ordezkatu beharko lukeen multimedia-ren URL-a."

msgid ""
"Do not show hovering Save or Search buttons, generated by the "
"Pinterest browser extensions."
msgstr ""
"Pinterest arakatzaile luzapenek sortutako Gorde edo Bilatu botoiak ez "
"erakutsi, gainean gelditzen direnean."

msgid "No pin"
msgstr "Ez dago pinik"

msgid ""
"Do not pin anything from this page. When selected, this option will "
"take precedence over all options below."
msgstr ""
"Orri honetatik ez eutsi ezer ere. Hautatuta dagoenean, aukerak honako "
"hauek guztiak baino lehentasun handiagoa izango du."

msgid "Do not allow Pinterest visual search to happen from this page."
msgstr ""
"Ohar ezazu ez dela Pinterest ikusizko bilaketa baimendu behar orri "
"honetatik."

msgid "The URL which should represent the content."
msgstr "Edukia adierazi beharko lukeen URL-a."

msgid ""
"The custom admin pages for managing Views meta tags at "
"/admin/config/search/metatag/views have been disabled for now, "
"hopefully they'll be back in a future release. Until then, the meta "
"tags can be managed directly on each individual view via the \"Meta "
"tags\" section."
msgstr ""
"/view/metatag/admin/config/search/metatag/views helbidean ikusten "
"diren ikuspegiak kudeatzeko orrialde pertsonalizatuak momentuz "
"desgaituta daude, eta itxaropenez datorren bertsio batean berriro "
"erabilgarri egongo dira. Ordura arte, meta etiketak ikuspegi "
"bakoitzean zuzen kudeatu daitezke \"Meta tags\" atalaren bitartez."

msgid ""
"To view a list of displays with meta tags set up, click on a view "
"name. To view a summary of meta tags configuration for a particular "
"display, click on the display name. If you need to set meta tags for a "
"specific view, choose Add views meta tags. Reverting the meta tags "
"removes the specific configuration and falls back to defaults."
msgstr ""
"Erakusleihoekin meta etiketak ezarrita dauden zerrenda bat ikusteko, "
"klik egin ikuspegi baten izenean. Meta etiketak konfigurazioaren "
"laburpena ikusteko, klik egin erakusleihoaren izenean. Ikuspegi zehatz "
"baterako meta etiketak ezarri behar badituzu, hautatu Add views meta "
"tags. Meta etiketak leheneratzeak konfigurazio zehatza ezabatzen du "
"eta lehenetsietara itzultzen da."

msgid "Do you want to revert meta tags for @view_name : @display_name?"
msgstr "@view_name : @display_name meta etiketak leheneratu nahi dituzu?"

msgid ""
"You are about to revert the custom meta tags for the %display_name "
"display on the %view_name view. This action cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"%view_name ikuspegiaren %display_name bistaratzean pertsonalizatutako "
"meta etiketak atzera botatzen ari zara. Ekintza hau ezin da desegin."

msgid "Reverted meta tags for @view_name : @display_name"
msgstr "@view_name -rako @display_name -en meta etiketak leheneratu dira"

msgid "Mobile: Web Manifest"
msgstr "Sakagarria: Web Manifestua"

msgid "Web Manifest"
msgstr "Web Manifestu"

msgid "Image 'alt'"
msgstr "Irudiaren 'alt'"

msgid ""
"A description of what is in the image, not a caption. If the page "
"specifies an og:image it should specify og:image:alt."
msgstr ""
"Irudiaren edukia deskribatzen duen testua, ez irudiaren azpititulua. "
"Orriak og:image zehazten badu, og:image:alt ere zehaztu beharko "
"litzateke."

msgid "Provides metatag support for Page Manager variants."
msgstr "Orri Kudeatzailearen aldaketen metataguaren laguntza ematen du."

msgid ""
"Identify which metatag groups should be available on which entity type "
"/ bundle combination. Unselected groups will not appear on the "
"configuration form for that entity type, reducing the size of the form "
"and increasing performance. If no groups are selected for a type, all "
"groups will appear."
msgstr ""
"Zehaztu zein metataga-talde egon beharko diren entitate-mota / "
"paketearen konbinazio bakoitzean. Aukeratu gabe dauden taldeak ez dira "
"agertuko entitate-mota horretarako konfigurazio-inprimakian, "
"inprimakiaren tamaina murriztuz eta errendimendua hobetuz. Ez badago "
"talde aunitz aukeratzen mota baterako, talde guztiak agertuko dira."

msgid ""
"This meta tag communicates with Google. There are currently two "
"directives supported: 'nositelinkssearchbox' to not to show the "
"sitelinks search box, and 'notranslate' to ask Google not to offer a "
"translation of the page. Both options may be added, just separate them "
"with a comma. See <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>meta "
"tags that Google understands</a> for further details."
msgstr ""
"Meta tag honek Google-rekin komunikatzen da. Une honetan bi direktiba "
"daude babestuta: 'nositelinkssearchbox' sitelink-en bilaketa-kutxa ez "
"erakusteko, eta 'notranslate' Google-ri orrialdearen itzulpena eska ez "
"diezaiola esateko. Bi aukerak gehitu daitezke, banandu besterik ez "
"ditu koma batekin. Ikusi <a "
"href='https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/79812?hl=en'>Google-k "
"ulertzen dituen meta tag-ak</a> xehetasun gehiagorako."

msgid "SVG icon"
msgstr "SVG ikonoa"

msgid "Pocket"
msgstr "Poltsa"

msgid ""
"Warning: disabling the Global default metatag will prevent any "
"metatags from being used."
msgstr ""
"Ohartarazpena: Global default metatag desgaitzeak metatag guztiak "
"erabiltzea eragozten du."

msgid ""
"Set the maximum size of an image preview for this page in a search "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Ezarri orri honetako irudiaren aurrebistaren tamaina maximoa "
"bilaketa-emaitzetan."

msgid "Standard - a default image preview may be shown."
msgstr "Standard - irudi aurrebista lehenetsia erakutsi daiteke."

msgid ""
"Large - a larger image preview, up to the width of the viewport, may "
"be shown."
msgstr ""
"Handia - irudi aurrebista handiagoa erakuts daiteke, ikuspegiko "
"zabalera arte."

msgid "Metatag: Favicons"
msgstr "Metatag: Favicons"

msgid ""
"Provides an absolute URL to a specially formatted version of the "
"current page designed for 'feature phones', mobile phones that do not "
"support modern browser standards. See the <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>official "
"Google Mobile SEO Guide</a> for details on how the page should be "
"formatted."
msgstr ""
"Oraingo orriaren bertsio berezi baterako URL absolutua ematen du, "
"'feature phone' izendatutako telefono mugikorretarako diseinatua, eta "
"hauek ez dute gaur egungo nabigatzaile estandarrak onartzen. Ikusi <a "
"href='https://developers.google.com/webmasters/mobile-sites/mobile-seo/other-devices?hl=en#feature_phones'>Google-ren "
"Mugikorrerako SEO Gida ofiziala</a> orriaren formatua nola izan behar "
"duen azaltzeko."

msgid "Open Graph: Video duration"
msgstr "Open Graph: Bideoaren iraupena"

msgid ""
"The date this content will expire, with an optional time value. Needs "
"to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> "
"format."
msgstr ""
"Eduki honek iraungiko den data, aukera gehiagorekin ordutegi "
"balioarekin. <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> formatuan egon behar du."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Edukia azken aldiz noiz aldatu zen data, balio denbora "
"aukerazkoarekin. <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> formatuan egon behar du."

msgid ""
"The date this content was published on, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format."
msgstr ""
"Edukia argitaratu zen data, aukera bat den ordu-balioarekin. <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO 8601</a> formatuan "
"egon behar du."

msgid ""
"The date this content was last modified, with an optional time value. "
"Needs to be in <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> format. Can be the same as the 'Article modification date' "
"tag."
msgstr ""
"Eduki hau azken aldiz aldatu zen data, aukera bat den denbora "
"balioarekin. <a href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601'>ISO "
"8601</a> formatua izan behar du. 'Artikuluaren aldaketa data' etiketa "
"bera izan daiteke."

msgid ""
"Preferred page location or URL to help eliminate duplicate content for "
"search engines, e.g., <em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."
msgstr ""
"Bilatzaileen edukia bikoiztea saihesten laguntzeko orriaren kokapen "
"edo URLa aukeratua, adibidez, "
"<em>https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0117500/</em>."

msgid "All meta tags in the \"@group\" group."
msgstr "\"@group\" taldeko metatxo guztiak."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Pragma meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Nabigatzaileak orri zehatz bat tokian tokiko cacheatzen duen "
"kontrolatzeko erabiltzen da. Ez da maiz erabiltzen. Pragma meta "
"etiketarekin batera erabili beharko litzateke."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='next' link."
msgstr ""
"Orri-segida duen edukia erabiltzeko, rel='next' estekadun URL bat "
"emanez."

msgid ""
"Used to control whether a browser caches a specific page locally. Not "
"commonly used. Should be used in conjunction with the Cache-Control "
"meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Nabigatzaileak orri konkretu bat tokian bertan cacheatzen duen "
"kontrolatzeko erabiltzen da. Ez da ohikoena. Cache-Control meta "
"etiketarekin batera erabili beharko litzateke."

msgid "Used for paginated content by providing URL with rel='prev' link."
msgstr ""
"Orrikatutako edukirako erabiltzen da, rel='prev' lotura duen URLa "
"emanez."

msgid ""
"Provides the fifteen <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"Dublin Core Metadata Institute-etik <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/documents/dces/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Element Set 1.1</a> hamabost meta etiketak eskaintzen ditu."

msgid ""
"Provides forty additional meta tags from the <a "
"href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata Institute</a>."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"https://dublincore.org/\">Dublin Core Metadata "
"Institute</a>-tik datorren beste berrogei meta-etiketa eskaintzen "
"ditu."

msgid "Metatag: Hreflang"
msgstr "Metatag: Hreflang"

msgid ""
"A semi-colon -separated string that must contain the 'polling-uri=' "
"value with the full URL to a <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML file</a>. May also contain 'frequency=' value set to either 30, "
"60, 360, 720 or 1440 (default) which specifies (in minutes) how often "
"the URL should be polled."
msgstr ""
"Hautapen puntuz bereizturiko kate bat da, eta 'polling-uri=' balioa "
"eduki behar du, <a "
"href='https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/p/?LinkID=314019'>Badge Schema "
"XML fitxategi</a> baten URL osoarekin. Era berean, 'frequency=' balioa "
"ere izan dezake, 30, 60, 360, 720 edo 1440 (lehenetsia) balioetako "
"bat, eta horrek (minututan) adierazten du noizero polsatuko den URLa."

msgid "Metatag: Page Manager"
msgstr "Metatag: Orrialde Kudeatzailea"

msgid "If checked, the field will be placed in the sidebar on entity forms."
msgstr "Aukeratuta badago, eremua entitate-formen albo-barran jarriko da."

msgid "Use sidebar: Yes"
msgstr "Alboko barra erabili: Bai"

msgid ""
"Control when the browser's internal cache of the current page should "
"expire. The date must to be an <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a>-compliant "
"date string that is represented in Greenwich Mean Time (GMT), e.g. "
"'Thu, 01 Sep 2016 00:12:56 GMT'. Set to '0' to stop the page being "
"cached entirely."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolatu orainaldiko orriaren nabigatzailearen barne-cacheak noiz "
"iraungi behar duen. Data izan behar da <a "
"href='https://www.csgnetwork.com/timerfc1123calc.html'>RFC-1123</a> "
"bateragarria den data-kate bat, Greenwich Erdiko Orduan (GMT) "
"adierazia dagoena, adibidez, 'Ost, 2016ko irailaren 01a 00:12:56 GMT'. "
"Ezarri '0' balioa orria guztiz cachean gorde ez dadin."

msgid ""
"The number of seconds to wait before refreshing the page. May also "
"force redirect to another page using the format '5; "
"url=https://example.com/', which would be triggered after five "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"Orduaren kopurua orria berriro kargatu aurretik itxaron behar dena. "
"Era berean, beste orrialde batera bideratzea indarrez bete dezake '5; "
"url=https://example.com/' formatua erabiliz, eta hori bost segundoren "
"ondoren aktibatuko litzateke."

msgid ""
"The secure URL to an audio file that complements this object. All "
"'http://' URLs will automatically be converted to 'https://'."
msgstr ""
"Audio fitxategi honi osagarri den URL segurua. 'http://' den URL "
"guztiak automatikoki bihurtuko dira 'https://' formatura."

msgid "Metatag Extended Permissions"
msgstr "Metatagi Luzatuak baimenak"

msgid "Access %tag in %group"
msgstr "Sartu %group-ko %tag-ra"

msgid ""
"A color in hexadecimal format, e.g. '#0000ff' for blue; must include "
"the '#' symbol. Used by some browsers to control the background color "
"of the toolbar, the color used with an icon, etc."
msgstr ""
"Kolore bat hamalauzen formatuan, adibidez '#0000ff' urdinarentzat; '#' "
"sinboloa izan behar du. Nabigatzaile batzuek tresna-barra atzeko "
"kolorea kontrolatzeko erabiltzen dute, ikono batekin erabiltzen den "
"kolorea, eta abar."

msgid ""
"The <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are used to "
"control how Facebook, Pinterest, LinkedIn and other social networking "
"sites interpret the site's content.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"<a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta etiketak</a> erabiltzen dira "
"Facebookek, Pinterestek, LinkedInek eta beste sare sozial batzuk "
"gunearen edukia nola interpretatzen duten "
"kontrolatzeko.<br><br>Facebookeko <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> tresnak aukera ematen dizu zure edukia Facebooken "
"partekatzean nola ikusiko den aurrez ikusteko eta Open Graph "
"etiketekin dauden arazoak konpontzeko."

msgid ""
"These <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph meta tags</a> are for "
"describing products.<br><br>The Facebook <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a> lets you preview how your content will look when it's "
"shared to Facebook and debug any issues with your Open Graph tags."
msgstr ""
"Produktuen deskribapenerako dira <a href='https://ogp.me/'>Open Graph "
"meta etiketa hauek</a>.<br><br>Facebook-eko <a "
"href='https://developers.facebook.com/tools/debug/'>Sharing "
"Debugger</a>-rak aukera ematen dizu zure edukia Facebook-era "
"partekatzean nola agertuko den aurrebista egiteko eta zure Open Graph "
"etiketekin dauden arazoak konpontzeko."

msgid ""
"The URL to a unique image representing the content of the page. Do not "
"use a generic image such as your website logo, author photo, or other "
"image that spans multiple pages. Images larger than 120x120px will be "
"resized and cropped square based on longest dimension. Images smaller "
"than 60x60px will not be shown. If the 'type' is set to Photo then the "
"image must be at least 280x150px."
msgstr ""
"Orriaren edukia adierazten duen irudi bakar baten URL-a. Ez erabili "
"irudi orokorrik, hala nola zure webgunearen logoa, egilearen argazkia "
"edo orri anitzetan zabaltzen den beste irudi bat. 120x120px baino "
"handiagoak diren irudiak tamaina aldatu eta karratu egingo dira "
"dimentsio luzeenaren arabera. 60x60px baino txikiagoak diren irudiak "
"ez dira erakutsiko. 'type' Photo bezala ezarrita badago, irudiak "
"gutxienez 280x150px izan behar du."

msgid ""
"The full URL for an MP4 video (h.264) or audio (AAC) stream, takes "
"precedence over the other media player field."
msgstr ""
"MP4 bideo (h.264) edo audio (AAC) erreprodukzio-eremurako URL osoak "
"lehentasuna du beste media player eremuaren gainetik."

msgid ""
"To use tokens to image fields, the image field on that entity bundle "
"(content type, term, etc) must have the \"Token\" display settings "
"enabled, the image field must not be hidden, and it must be set to "
"output as an image, e.g. using the \"Thumbnail\" field formatter. It "
"is also recommended to use an appropriate image style that resizes the "
"image rather than output the original image; see individual meta tag "
"descriptions for size recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Tokenak irudi-eremuetan erabiltzeko, entitate-paketearen (eduki mota, "
"terminoa, eta abar) irudi-eremuan \"Token\" bistaratze-ezarpenak "
"gaituta egon behar dira, irudi-eremua ezkutuan egon gabe, eta irudia "
"bezala irteten jarri behar da, adibidez, \"Thumbnail\" "
"eremu-formatzailearen bidez. Era berean, irudiaren jatorrizko tamaina "
"atera beharrean irudia birformatzen duen irudi-estilo egokia "
"erabiltzea gomendatzen da; tamaina gomendioak ikusteko, ikusi "
"meta-etiqueta bakoitzaren deskribapenak."

msgid ""
"This will be able to extract the URL from an image field if the field "
"is configured properly."
msgstr ""
"Atal honek irudi-eremutik URL-a ateratzeko gai izango da, eremua behar "
"bezala konfiguratu bada."

msgid ""
"Used to rate content for audience appropriateness. This tag has little "
"known influence on search engine rankings, but can be used by "
"browsers, browser extensions, and apps. The <a "
"href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>most common "
"options</a> are general, mature, restricted, 14 years, safe for kids. "
"If you follow the <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA "
"Documentation</a> you should enter RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA"
msgstr ""
"Edukiaren egokitasuna audientziarentzat baloratzeko erabiltzen da. "
"Etiketa honek ez du bilatzaileetako sailkapenean eragin handirik, "
"baina nabigatzaileek, nabigatzaile luzapenek eta aplikazioek erabil "
"dezakete. <a href='https://www.metatags.org/meta_name_rating'>Aukera "
"ohikoenak</a> orokorra, heldua, mugatua, 14 urtekoa, eta haurrentzako "
"seguruak dira. <a "
"href='https://www.rtalabel.org/index.php?content=howto'>RTA "
"Dokumentazioaren</a> jarraituz, RTA-5042-1996-1400-1577-RTA sartu "
"beharko zenuke."

msgid "@label of @type"
msgstr "@type-ren @label"

msgid "@label of @type @entity-type-label"
msgstr "@label of @type @entity-type-label"

msgid "This plugin will be cloned from these settings for each custom tag."
msgstr ""
"Plugin hau tag pertsonalizatu bakoitzarentzako ezarpen hauekin "
"klonatuko da."

msgid "Place field in collapsed details container"
msgstr "Lekuz aldagaia itxitako xehetasun edukian jarri"

msgid "Trim method for trimmable tags."
msgstr "Moztu metodoa moztu daitezkeen etiketei."

msgid "Tag-specific maximum length"
msgstr "Etiketa-zehatzerako gehienezko luzera"

msgid "Tag maximum length in characters"
msgstr "Etiketa hasierako luzera gehienez karaktereetan"

msgid ""
"Adds individual permissions for each meta tag, allowing for "
"fine-grained access to the meta tags. Note: this may lead to "
"performance issues on the permissions admin page, please see the "
"included README.txt file for details."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketa bakoitzarentzat baimen indibidualak gehitzen ditu, meta "
"etiketetara sarbide finak ahalbidetuz. Oharra: honek arazoak eragin "
"ditzake baimenak kudeatzeko orrian, xehetasunetarako mesedez ikusi "
"barne dagoen README.txt fitxategia."

msgid "Mask icon color"
msgstr "Maskara ikonoaren kolorea"

msgid ""
"Color attribute for SVG (mask) icon in hexadecimal format, e.g. "
"'#0000ff'. Setting it will break HTML validation. If not set macOS "
"Safari ignores the Mask Icon entirely, making the Icon: SVG completely "
"useless."
msgstr ""
"SVG (maskara) ikonoaren kolore atributua hamazazpi formatoan, adibidez "
"'#0000ff'. Ezarpenak HTML balidazioa hautsi dezake. Ez bada ezartzen, "
"macOS Safari-k Maskara Ikonoa erabat baztertzen du, eta horrek Ikonoa: "
"SVG guztiz erabilgaitza bihurtzen du."

msgid "Mask icon (SVG)"
msgstr "Maskara ikonoa (SVG)"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Price availability"
msgstr "Open Graph Produktua: Prezioaren eskuragarritasuna"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Product condition"
msgstr "Open Graph Produktua: Produktuaren egoera"

msgid "Open Graph Product: Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "Open Graph Produktua: Saltzailearen Produktu IDa"

msgid "Product condition"
msgstr "Produktuen egoera"

msgid "The condition of the product."
msgstr "Produktua egoera."

msgid "Retailer Item ID"
msgstr "Saltzailearen Produktu ID-a"

msgid "The ID of the product as provided by the retailer."
msgstr "Saltzaileak emandako produktuaren ID-a."

msgid ""
"Empty update script to clear the site's caches so the new token "
"replacement functionality will work."
msgstr ""
"Gune honen cache-ak garbitzeko eguneratze script hutsa, beraz "
"funtzionalitate berria token ordezkapena ondo funtzionatuko du."

msgid "Metatag Trimming Options"
msgstr "Metatag Mozteko Aukerak"

msgid ""
"Many Meta-Tags can be trimmed on a specific length for search engine "
"optimization.<br/>If the value is set to '0' or left empty, the whole "
"Metatag will be untrimmed."
msgstr ""
"Meta-Etiketa asko luzera zehatz batera moztu daitezke bilatzaileetan "
"optimizaziorako.<br/>Balioa '0' edo hutsik uzten bada, Meta-etiqueta "
"osoa moztu gabe geratuko da."

msgid "Meta Tags:"
msgstr "Meta Etiketak:"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag after the word on the given value"
msgstr "Ebakal ezazu Meta Etiketa hitzaren ondoren emandako balioan"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag on the given value"
msgstr "Eraldatu Meta Etiketa emandako balioan"

msgid "Trim the Meta Tag before the word on the given value"
msgstr "Ebakitu Meta Etiketa emandako balioan hitzaren aurretik"

msgid "Wrap the meta tags in a collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Bildu meta etiketak informazio xehetasunak agertzen diren kontenedor "
"batean."

msgid ""
"If checked, the contents of the field will be placed inside a "
"collapsed details container."
msgstr ""
"Markatuta badago, eremuaren edukia xehetasun itxurako ontzi batean "
"kokatuko da."

msgid "Use details container: Yes"
msgstr "Erabili xehetasunen edukiontzia: Bai"

msgid "Use details container: No"
msgstr "Erabili xehetasun ontzia: Ez"

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude; longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958; -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>see Wikipedia for details</a>."
msgstr ""
"'Latitude; longitude' formatuan dagoen geo-leku informazioa, adibidez, "
"'50.167958; -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geographic_coordinate_system' "
"aria-label='see Wikipedia for details on the geographic coordinate "
"system'>ikusi Wikipedian xehetasunak</a>."

msgid ""
"Geo-spatial information in 'latitude, longitude' format, e.g. "
"'50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>see Wikipedia for "
"details</a>."
msgstr ""
"'Latitude, longitude' formatuan dagoen geo-espaziodun informazioa, "
"adibidez, '50.167958, -97.133185'; <a "
"href='https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ICBM_address' aria-label='see "
"Wikipedia for details on ICBM addresses'>ikus Wikipedia xehetasunen "
"berri izateko</a>."

msgid "Token Or"
msgstr "Token Edo"

msgid "Add max height value"
msgstr "Gehitu altuera maximo balioa"

msgid "Metatag Custom Routes (Paths)"
msgstr "Metatag Bide Pertsonalizatuak (Ibilbideak)"

msgid "Route / Path"
msgstr "Bide / Ibilbidea"

msgid ""
"Enter the route (path) for this new configuration, starting with a "
"leading slash.<br />Note: this must already exist as a path in Drupal."
msgstr ""
"Sartu ibilbide (bidea) konfigurazio berri honetarako, aurreneko "
"zigilua barra batekin hasi behar da.<br />Oharra: ibilbide hori "
"Drupal-en dagoen ibilbide bat izan behar da dagoeneko."

msgid "Site validation: SIWECOS"
msgstr "Gunearen balidazioa: SIWECOS"

msgid "Google Site Verification"
msgstr "Google Gunearen Egiaztapena"

msgid "SIWECOS"
msgstr "SIWECOS"

msgid "Metatag widget options"
msgstr "Metatag widget aukerak"

msgid ""
"Various options for the field widget used on entity forms, e.g. on "
"content type forms."
msgstr ""
"Entitate formetan erabiltzen den eremu widgeterako aukera desberdinak, "
"adibidez, edukia motako formetan."

msgid "Scroll maximum height"
msgstr "Gehienezko altuera irristatu"

msgid "eg 500px or 8rem"
msgstr "eg 500px edo 8rem"

msgid ""
"To enable scrolling please enter a value and its units, e.g. 500px, "
"8rem, etc. Removing this value will remove the scroll."
msgstr ""
"Iragaztea gaitzeko, sartu balio bat eta honen neurriak, adibidez "
"500px, 8rem, etab. Balio hau ezabatzeak iragaztea kenduko du."

msgid "Define the author of a page."
msgstr "Orrialde baten egilea definitu."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\"@module\">Token OR module</a> is suggested for when the "
"basic content tokens are not flexible enough, e.g. to make a meta tag "
"show the contents of one field if it is filled in or another if the "
"first one is empty."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"@module\">Token edo modulua</a> gomendatzen da oinarrizko "
"eduki tokenak ez direnean nahiko malguak, adibidez, meta etiketak bat "
"beste eremu baten edukia erakutsi dezan bete bada edo beste bat "
"lehenengoa hutsik badago."

msgid "Href per language"
msgstr "Hizkuntza bakoitzeko Href"

msgid ""
"This was expected to be an array but it is not: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Hau array bat izango zela espero zen, baina ez da: \n"
"%value"

msgid ""
"This could not be unserialized: \n"
"%value"
msgstr ""
"Hau ezin izan da deserializatu:  \n"
"%value"

msgid "Metatag Field Diff"
msgstr "Metatag Field Diff"

msgid "Use Maxlength module to force these limits?"
msgstr "Maxlength moduluaren erabilera muga hauek indartzeko?"

msgid "Install the Maxlength module to enable this option."
msgstr "Aktibatu aukera hau ahalbidetzeko, instalatu Maxlength modula."

msgid "Intended workflow"
msgstr "Nahi den lan-fluxua"

msgid ""
"Allows assigning meta tags to be used on custom routes, equivalent to "
"custom paths."
msgstr ""
"Baimena ematen du meta etiketak zehazteko, bide pertsonalizatuetan "
"erabiltzeko, bide pertsonalizatuen baliokidea."

msgid ""
"Indicate to search engines and other page scrapers whether or not "
"links should be followed. See <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>the W3C "
"specifications</a> for further details. Note: this serves the same "
"purpose as the HTTP header by the same name."
msgstr ""
"Bilatzaileei eta orrialdearen edukia kopiatzen duten beste tresnei "
"adierazi ea estekak jarraitu behar diren ala ez. Ikusi <a "
"href='https://w3c.github.io/webappsec/specs/referrer-policy/'>W3C "
"zehaztapenak</a> xehetasun gehiagorako. Oharra: honek helburu bera du "
"HTTP goiburu izen berekoarekin."

msgid "Max Snippet"
msgstr "Max Xehetasuna"

msgid ""
"Use a number character as a textual snippet for this search result. "
"\"0\" equals \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" will let the search engine decide "
"the most effective length."
msgstr ""
"Erabili numero karaktere bat testu zatiki gisa bilaketa emaitza "
"honetarako. \"0\" baliokidea da \"nosnippet\". \"-1\" bilatzaileari "
"luzera eraginkorrena aukeratzeko aukera emango dio."

msgid ""
"Use a maximum of number seconds as a video snippet for videos on this "
"page in search results. \"0\" will use a static a image. \"-1\" means "
"there is no limit."
msgstr ""
"Erabil ezazu segundoko gehieneko kopuru bat bideo zatitzeko bilaketa "
"emaitzetan orri honetako bideoentzat. \"0\" irudi estatiko bat "
"erabiliko du. \"-1\" mugarik ez dagoela adierazten du."

msgid "Max Image Preview"
msgstr "Irudiaren Aurrebista Maximoa"

msgid "Unavailable after date"
msgstr "Data igaro ondoren ez dago eskuragarri"

msgid "Do not show this page in search results after the specified date"
msgstr ""
"Ez erakutsi orrialde hau bilaketa emaitzetan adierazitako dataren "
"ondoren"

msgid ""
"There were no overridden Metatag records that needed to be updated to "
"store the data using JSON."
msgstr ""
"Ez zegoen eguneratu beharreko Metatag erregistro baliogabeturik datuak "
"JSON erabiliz gordetzeko."

msgid ""
"Processed @processed of @total updating Metatag records with the "
"Publisher or Name meta tags."
msgstr ""
"@total Metatag erregistroetatik @processed eguneratu dira Publisher "
"edo Name meta etiketekin."

msgid "There were no Metatag records to update."
msgstr "Eguneratzeko Metatag erregistroak ez zeuden."

msgid "Removed meta tags from the @config Metatag configuration."
msgstr "@config Metatag konfiguraziotik meta etiketak ezabatu dira."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus is not enabled, nothing to do."
msgstr "Metatag: Google Plus ez dago gaituta, ez dago ezer egiteko."

msgid "Metatag: Google Plus has been uninstalled."
msgstr "Metatag: Google Plus desinstalatu da."

msgid ""
"Corrected the Twitter Card \"type\" value in the @config Metatag "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"@config Metatag konfigurazioan Twitter Card \"type\" balioa zuzendu "
"da."

msgid "The computed meta tags for the entity."
msgstr "Entitatearentzako kalkulatutako meta etiketa."

msgid "Deprecated module, do not use. Will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr ""
"Moldatutako modulu hau zaharkituta dago, ez erabili. 3.0.0 bertsioan "
"kenduko da."

msgid ""
"Notes:<ul><li>no other fields are required for a Summary "
"card</li><li>Media player card requires the 'title', 'description', "
"'media player URL', 'media player width', 'media player height' and "
"'image' fields,</li><li>Summary Card with Large Image card requires "
"the 'Summary' field and the 'image' field,</li><li>App Card requires "
"the 'iPhone app ID' field, the 'iPad app ID' field and the 'Google "
"Play app ID' field,</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Oharra:<ul><li>Ez da beste eremu gehiagorik behar Laburpen txartel "
"baterako</li><li>Media player txartelak 'izenburua', 'deskribapena', "
"'media player URL', 'media player zabalera', 'media player altuera' "
"eta 'irudia' eremuak behar ditu,</li><li>Irudi Handidun Laburpen "
"Txartelak 'Laburpena' eta 'irudia' eremuak behar ditu,</li><li>App "
"Txartelak 'iPhone app ID', 'iPad app ID' eta 'Google Play app ID' "
"eremuak behar ditu,</li></ul>"

msgid "Separator used with multiple values"
msgstr "Balio anitzekin erabili den separadorea"

msgid ""
"Controls the separator used when a meta tag allows multiple values. "
"Multiple characters can be used together, it does not have to be one "
"single character long. Defaults to \":default\"."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketa batek balio anitz onartzen dituenean erabiltzen den "
"separadorea kontrolatzen du. Karaktere anitz elkarrekin erabil "
"daitezke, ez da beharrik karaktere bakarra izatea. Lehenetsia da "
"\":default\"."

msgid ""
"Multiple values may be used, separated by `:delimiter`. Note: Tokens "
"that return multiple values will be handled automatically."
msgstr ""
"Balio anitz erabil daitezke, `:delimiter` bidez bereizita. Oharra: "
"Balio anitz itzultzen dituzten tokenak automatikoki kudeatuko dira."

msgid ""
"The full URL for loading a media player, specifically an iframe for an "
"embedded video rather than the URL to a page that contains a player. "
"Required when using the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Media erreproduzitzaile bat kargatzeko URL osoa, bereziki iframe bat "
"txertatutako bideo baterako, erreproduzitzaile bat duen orrialde baten "
"URL ordez. Beharrezkoa Player Card mota erabiltzean."

msgid ""
"The height of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Media-entzulearen iframearen altuera, pixeletan. Beharrezkoa Player "
"Card motakoa erabiltzen denean."

msgid ""
"The width of the media player iframe, in pixels. Required when using "
"the Player Card type."
msgstr ""
"Jokoaren iframearen zabalera, pixeletan. Beharrezkoa Player Card "
"motako erabiltzean."

msgid ""
"This will be truncated to a maximum of %max characters after any "
"tokens are processed."
msgstr ""
"Hau %max karaktere gehienez moztuko da token guztiak prozesatu "
"ondoren."

msgid ""
"Because of how tokens are processed in meta tags, use of the Maxlength "
"module may not provide an accurate representation of the actual "
"current length of each meta tag, so it may cause more problem than it "
"is worth."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketetan tokenak nola prozesatzen diren kontuan hartuta, "
"Maxlength modulua erabiltzeak ez du meta etiketa bakoitzaren egungo "
"benetako luzera zehatza ematen, beraz, arazo gehiago sor dezake merezi "
"duen baino."

msgid ""
"Control the Metatag settings pages. Does not control access to the "
"Metatag field on content forms, etc, use the Field Permissions module "
"or hook_form_alter()."
msgstr ""
"Metatag ezarpen orriak kontrolatu. Ez du kontrolatzen Metatag "
"eremuaren sarbidea edukien formularioetan, etab., erabili Field "
"Permissions modulu edo hook_form_alter()."

msgid "End of the word trimming"
msgstr "Hitza moztearen amaiera"

msgid "This module provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Modulu honek laguntza ematen du meta etiketak pertsonalizatuak "
"definitu eta kudeatzeko."

msgid ""
"The module provides the option to create different <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Custom Tags\"</a> to use for different "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Moduluak aukera ematen du xede desberdinetarako erabiltzeko <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Etiketa Pertsonalizatu\" "
"desberdinak</a> sortzeko."

msgid "The best way of using Metatag: Custom Tags is as follows:"
msgstr "Metatag: Custom Tags erabiltzeko modurik onena hurrengoa da:"

msgid ""
"Create the <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, "
"fill in the specific values that every page should have."
msgstr ""
"Sortu <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Etiketa "
"Pertsonalizatua\"</a>, bete orri bakoitzak izan beharreko balio "
"zehatzak."

msgid "Configure Custom tags below."
msgstr "Beheko Etiketa Pertsonalizatuak konfiguratu."

msgid "Metatag: Custom Tags"
msgstr "Metatag: Etiketa Pertsonalizatuak"

msgid "Provides support to define and manage custom meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Metatagi pertsonalizatuak definitu eta kudeatzeko laguntza eskaintzen "
"du."

msgid "Add Custom tag"
msgstr "Gehitu Tag Pertsonalizatua"

msgid "Administer Custom tags"
msgstr "Etiketak pertsonalizatuak kudeatu"

msgid "Control the main settings pages and modify custom tags."
msgstr "Ongarri nagusiak kontrolatu eta etiketa pertsonalizatuak aldatu."

msgid "Delete Custom tag"
msgstr "Ezabatu Custom tag"

msgid "Specify the name of the custom tag."
msgstr "Adierazi etiketa pertsonalizatuaren izena."

msgid "Specify the description of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Zehaztu Pertsonalizatutako etiketa deskribapena."

msgid "Select the HTML element of the Custom tag."
msgstr "Hautatu Custom tag-aren HTML elementua."

msgid "Value attribute"
msgstr "Balio atributua"

msgid "Created %label Custom tag."
msgstr "Sortutako %label etiketa pertsonalizatua."

msgid "Updated %label Custom tag."
msgstr "%label etiketatxo pertsonalizatua eguneratua."

msgid "Edit Custom tag @label"
msgstr "Editatu @label etiketa pertsonalizatua"

msgid ""
"These custom tags are designed to use the custom purpose on the "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Tag hauek gunean helburu pertsonalizatua erabiltzeko diseinatuta "
"daude."

msgid "The entities routes metatags must be added by fields."
msgstr "Entitateen routes metatags-ak eremu bidez gehitu behar dira."

msgid "Trimming options"
msgstr "Mochaketa aukerak"

msgid ""
"A list of characters to trim at the end of all metatags. Provide a "
"single string without any separators, e.g. \"|,.\" (instead of \"| , "
".\"). Note that spaces, tabs, new lines, carriage returns and vertical "
"tabs (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") will be trimmed automatically and do not "
"need to be listed in this field. The trimming is applied at the very "
"end after the tag is trimmed for length, and after the trimming option "
"was executed."
msgstr ""
"Metatag guztien amaieran moztu beharreko karaktereen zerrenda bat. "
"Hiperespazio edo bestelako bereizgarririk gabeko kate bakarra eman, "
"adibidez \"|,.\" ( \"| , .\" ordez). Kontuan izan espazioak, "
"tabulazioak, lerro berri, karrito itzultzaileak eta bertikaleko "
"tabulazioak (\" \\n"
"\\r\\t\\v\") automatikoki moztuko direla eta ez "
"direla zerrendan sartu behar. Mozketa metatagiaren luzera murriztu "
"ondoren eta mozketa aukera exekutatu ondoren aplikatzen da azken "
"finean."

msgid "Configuration instance"
msgstr "Konfigurazio adibide"

msgid ""
"Meta tag configuration, stored as either a serialized array or a "
"JSON-encoded string."
msgstr ""
"Meta etiketa konfigurazioa, serieztatutako array gisa edo JSON "
"kodetze-string gisa gordeta."

msgid "Expected an array but got null or other type for group: @group_name"
msgstr ""
"Espero zen array bat, baina null edo beste mota bat jaso da "
"taldearentzat: @group_name"

msgid "Optional suffix to add"
msgstr "Gehitzeko aukera osagarri bat"

msgid "Element of the HTML tag. e.g. meta, link, etc."
msgstr "HTML etiketa baten elementua. adibidez, meta, link, eta abar."

msgid ""
"The name of the html value attribute. e.g. content, href, charset, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"html value atributuaren izena. Adibidez, content, href, charset, eta "
"abar."

msgid ""
"Enter a unique identifier for this custom tag. This identifier can "
"contain lowercase letters, numbers and underscores. This is only used "
"internally, it is not used in the actual HTML output."
msgstr ""
"Sartu identifikazio bakarra etiketarako. Identifikazio honek letra "
"xeheak, zenbakiak eta azpimarratzeak izan ditzake. Hau barne "
"erabilerarako bakarrik da, eta ez da benetako HTML irteeran erabili."

msgid ""
"Select the Value attribute of the Custom tag. This determines which "
"HTML attribute will contain the user-provided content."
msgstr ""
"Hautatu Custom etiketen Value atributua. Honek zehazten du zein HTML "
"atributuk edukiko duen erabiltzaileak emandako edukia."

msgid ""
"Define the HTML attributes for this custom meta tag. The first "
"attribute serves as the primary identifier and is required. Additional "
"attributes are optional and provide fixed values for all instances of "
"this tag."
msgstr ""
"Definitu atributu HTML hauek meta tag pertsonalizatu honentzako. "
"Lehengo atributua identifikatzaile nagusi gisa balio du eta "
"beharrezkoa da. Atributu osagarriak aukerakoak dira eta tag honen "
"instantzia guztientzat balio finkoak ematen dituzte."

msgid "Primary attribute (Required)"
msgstr "Atributu nagusia (Beharrezkoa)"

msgid "Additional attribute @num"
msgstr "Ezarpen gehigarri @num"

msgid "This attribute identifies the meta tag and is required."
msgstr "Atributu honek meta etiketa identifikatzen du eta derrigorrezkoa da."

msgid "This attribute provides a fixed value for all instances of this tag."
msgstr ""
"Ezaugarri honek balio finko bat eskaintzen du etiketa honen kasu "
"guztientzat."

msgid "Common values: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."
msgstr "Ohiko balioak: name, property, rel, http-equiv, itemprop."

msgid "Additional attribute name (e.g., type, sizes)."
msgstr "Atributu osagarrien izena (adibidez, type, sizes)."

msgid ""
"For new tags, defaults to the machine name. For existing tags, this "
"identifies the specific meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Etiketa berrientzat, makina izenari lehenetsia ematen zaio. Dagoeneko "
"dauden etiketaentzat, zehazten du meta etiketa berezia."

msgid "Fixed value for this attribute."
msgstr "Atributu honetarako balio finkoa."

msgid ""
"\n"
"        <h4>Common Examples:</h4>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Basic meta tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"description\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"description\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Open Graph tag:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: property = \"og:title\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"property=\"og:title\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Twitter Card:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: name = \"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;meta "
"name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"          "
"<li><strong>Link with type:</strong><br>\n"
"            Primary "
"attribute: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"            Additional attribute: type "
"= \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"            Result: &lt;link rel=\"icon\" "
"type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"        "
"</ul>\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"<h4>Adibide ohikoak:</h4>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  <li><strong>Meta etiketa "
"oinarrizkoa:</strong><br>\n"
"    Attributu nagusia: name = "
"\"description\"<br>\n"
"    Emaitza: &lt;meta name=\"description\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"  <li><strong>Open Graph "
"etiketa:</strong><br>\n"
"    Attributu nagusia: property = "
"\"og:title\"<br>\n"
"    Emaitza: &lt;meta property=\"og:title\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"  <li><strong>Twitter "
"Card:</strong><br>\n"
"    Attributu nagusia: name = "
"\"twitter:card\"<br>\n"
"    Emaitza: &lt;meta name=\"twitter:card\" "
"content=\"[user-input]\" /&gt;</li>\n"
"  <li><strong>Motarekin "
"lotura:</strong><br>\n"
"    Attributu nagusia: rel = \"icon\"<br>\n"
"    "
"Attributu osagarria: type = \"image/svg+xml\"<br>\n"
"    Emaitza: "
"&lt;link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"[user-input]\" "
"/&gt;</li>\n"
"</ul>"

msgid "At least one attribute with both name and value must be provided."
msgstr ""
"Gutxienez, izena eta balioa duten atributu bat edo gehiago eman behar "
"dira."

msgid "The primary attribute name and value are required."
msgstr "Ezarpen nagusiaren izena eta balioa beharrezkoak dira."

msgid "A scalable vector graphic (SVG) file."
msgstr "Eskalagarri den bektore-grafiko (SVG) fitxategia."

