"Provides many enhancements to the Extend page including the use of "
"tabs for packages."
msgstr ""
"Paketeetarako fitxen erabilera barne, Extend orrialdearentzako "
"hobekuntza asko eskaintzen ditu."

msgid "Settings for the Module Filter module."
msgstr "Module Filter modulurako ezarpenak."

msgid ""
"See the <a href=\":project_page\">project page on Drupal.org</a> for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"Ikusi <a href=\":project_page\">Drupal.org-eko proiektu orria</a> "
"xehetasun gehiagorako."

msgid ""
"The modules list page can become quite big when dealing with a fairly "
"large site or even just a dev site meant for testing new and various "
"modules being considered."
msgstr ""
"Modulu zerrendaren orria asko handitu daiteke gune handiago batekin "
"lan egiten denean, edo baita probako modulu berri eta desberdinak "
"testatzeko sortutako garapen gune batean ere."

msgid ""
"What this module aims to accomplish is the ability to quickly find the "
"module you are looking for without having to rely on the browsers "
"search feature which more times than not shows you the module name in "
"the -Required by- or -Depends on- sections of the various modules or "
"even some other location on the page like a menu item."
msgstr ""
"Modulu honek lortu nahi duena da modu azkarrean bilatzea bilatzen ari "
"zaren moduluari, nabigatzailearen bilaketa funtzioan oinarritu "
"beharrik gabe, sarritan moduluaren izena -Required by- edo -Depends "
"on- ataletan agertzen baita, moduletako hainbatetan edo baita "
"orrialdeko beste toki batzuetan ere, esaterako menu elementu batean."

msgid ""
"Boolean indicating whether the Extend page should be enhanced with "
"tabs"
msgstr "Abiatu balioa, Extend orria fitxekin hobetu behar den adierazten duena"

msgid "Show module path in modules list"
msgstr "Erakutsi moduluen bidea moduluen zerrendan"

