msgid "Menu link URL generator"
msgstr "Menu lotura URL sortzailea"

msgid "Generates menu link URLs by overriding the 'entity' URL generator."
msgstr "Menu lotura URLak sortzen ditu 'entity' URL sortzailea gainidatziz."

msgid "Entity URL generator"
msgstr "Entitatearen URL sortzailea"

msgid "Generates URLs for entity bundles and bundle overrides."
msgstr "Entitate ontzientzako eta ontzi gainidazketentzako URLa sortzen du."

msgid "Add sitemap"
msgstr "Gehitu sitemap-a"

msgid "Garbage collection in the simple_sitemap_views table"
msgstr "Simple_sitemap_views taulan dagoen zikinkeria bilketa"

msgid "Views URL generator"
msgstr "Views URL sortzailea"

msgid "Generates URLs for views."
msgstr "Ikuspegiak egiteko URLak sortzen ditu."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap settings for this display"
msgstr "Erakustaldi honetarako Simple XML Sitemap ezarpenak"

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this display changes. Search engine bots may "
"take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"Bista honek zenbat maiztasunarekin aldatzen den. Bilatzaileetako botek "
"hori erabiltzen dute zenbat maiz indexatu behar den adierazpide gisa."

msgid "Indexed arguments"
msgstr "Argumentu indizatuak"

msgid ""
"To enable indexing of an argument, you must enable indexing of all "
"previous arguments."
msgstr ""
"Lehen argumentu guztiak indizatzeko aukera aktibatzea beharrezkoa da "
"argumentu baten indizazioa gaitzeko."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap settings for this view."
msgstr "Ikuspegi honetarako XML Sitemap sinplearen ezarpenak."

msgid "Cron generation"
msgstr "Cron sortzea"

msgid "Cron generation interval"
msgstr "Kronoaren sortze tartea"

msgid "Generation duration"
msgstr "Sorkuntza iraunkortasuna"

msgid "Default variant"
msgstr "Lehentasunezko aldaera"

msgid "This setting will regenerate all sitemaps including the above changes."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpen honek gune-mapak guztiak berreratuko ditu, goiko aldaketak "
"barne."

msgid "Sitemap variant"
msgstr "Gune-orrien mapa aldaketa"

msgid "Sitemap status"
msgstr "Gune-maparen egoera"

msgid "Sitemaps can be regenerated on demand here."
msgstr "Hemen nahi izanez gero sitemap-ak berriz sor daitezke."

msgid "sitemaps"
msgstr "orrialde-mapaak"

msgid "generating"
msgstr "sortzen"

msgid ""
"Uncheck this if you intend to only regenerate the sitemaps manually or "
"via drush."
msgstr ""
"Gaitu gabeko hau, sitemapen berriz sortzea eskuz edo drush bidez "
"bakarrik egiteko asmoa baduzu."

msgid "Default sitemap generator"
msgstr "Lehenetsitako sitemap sortzailea"

msgid "Generates a standard conform hreflang sitemap of your content."
msgstr "Zure edukien hreflang estandarreko sitemap bat sortzen du."

msgid "Generating XML sitemaps"
msgstr "XML sitemap-ak sortzen"

msgid "Progress of sitemap regeneration"
msgstr "Gunearen egituraren berreraikuntzaren aurrerapena"

msgid "Sitemaps"
msgstr "Guneen mapa"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap PHP extensions"
msgstr "XML Sitemap PHP luzapen sinpleak"

msgid ""
"In order to be able to generate sitemaps, the Simple XML Sitemap "
"module requires the <em>xmlwriter</em> PHP extension to be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Sitemapak sortu ahal izateko, Simple XML Sitemap modulua "
"<em>xmlwriter</em> PHP luzapena gaituta egotea eskatzen du."

msgid "Include a stylesheet in the sitemaps for humans"
msgstr "Giza erabiltzaileentzat sitemapean estilo-orri bat gehitu"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Views)"
msgstr "XML Sitemap Sinplea (Ikuspegiak)"

msgid ""
"Provides integration of the Simple XML Sitemap module with the Views "
"module."
msgstr "Simple XML Sitemap modulua Views moduluekin integratzea eskaintzen du."

msgid ""
"No view displays are set to be indexed yet. <a href=\"@url\">Edit a "
"view.</a>"
msgstr ""
"Oraindik ez dago inxexatuko moduan ezarrita oraindik "
"ikuspegi-erakuspenik. <a href=\"@url\">Aldatu ikuspegi bat.</a>"

msgid "The priority this display will have in the eyes of search engine bots."
msgstr "Bilatzaile roboten begietan izango duen lehentasuna."

msgid "Maximum display variations"
msgstr "Bistaratze aldaketa gehienak"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of link variations to be indexed for this display. "
"If left blank, each argument will create link variations for this "
"display. Use with caution, as a large number of argument values​can "
"significantly increase the number of sitemap links."
msgstr ""
"Erakustaldi honentzako indekatuko diren esteka aldaketen gehienezko "
"kopurua. Hutsik uzten bada, argumentu bakoitzak esteka aldaketak "
"sortuko ditu erakustaldi honetarako. Erabili kontuz, argumentu balio "
"kopuru handiak sitemapeko esteka kopurua nabarmen handitu dezakeelako."

msgid "Resume generation"
msgstr "Curriculum vitae sortzea"

msgid "Add styling and sorting to sitemaps"
msgstr "Gehitu itxura eta sailkapena gune-mapetan"

msgid ""
"If checked, sitemaps will be displayed as tables with sortable entries "
"and thus become much friendlier towards human visitors. Search engines "
"will not care."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratuta badago, gune-mapak taula moduan bistaratuko dira, sailkapen "
"aukera dituzten sarrerak izango dituztenak, eta horrela bisitari "
"humanoentzat askoz atseginagoak izango dira. Bilatzaileek ez dute "
"horretaz axola izango."

msgid ""
"If checked, entity links are generated exclusively for languages the "
"entity has been translated to as long as the language is not excluded "
"below.<br>Otherwise entity links are generated for every language "
"installed on the site apart from languages excluded below.<br>Bear in "
"mind that non-entity paths like homepage will always be generated for "
"every non-excluded language."
msgstr ""
"Hautatuta badago, entitatearen estekak entitateak itzuli diren "
"hizkuntzetarako soilik sortuko dira, hizkuntza behean ez badago "
"salbuetsita.<br>Bestela, entitatearen estekak webgunean instalatutako "
"hizkuntza guztientzat sortuko dira, behean salbuetsitako hizkuntzak "
"izan ezik.<br>Kontuan hartu ez-entitateko ibilbideak, hala nola "
"hasierako orria, beti sortuko direla hizkuntza salbuetsirik ez dagoen "
"bakoitzeko."

msgid ""
"On some hosting providers it is impossible to pass parameters to cron "
"to tell Drupal which URL to bootstrap with. In this case the base URL "
"of sitemap links can be overridden here.<br>Example: <em>@url</em>"
msgstr ""
"Hosting zerbitzari batzuetan imposible da parametroak igarotzea "
"cron-era, Drupal-i zein URL erabiliz bootstrapatzea esan ahal izateko. "
"Kasu honetan, sitemap esteken oinarrizko URL-a hemen gainditu "
"daiteke.<br>Adibide: <em>@url</em>"

msgid ""
"The maximum duration <strong>in seconds</strong> the generation task "
"can run during a single cron run or during one batch process "
"iteration.<br>The higher the number, the quicker the generation "
"process, but higher the risk of PHP timeout errors."
msgstr ""
"Sortzeko lanak gauzatu daitezkeen <strong>segundotan</strong> denbora "
"maximoa, bat cron exekuzio batean edo batch prozesu baten itzuli "
"batean.<br>Zenbakia handiagoa izan ahala, sortzeko prozesua azkarragoa "
"da, baina PHP denbora-muga erroreen arriskua handiagoa da."

msgid ""
"Administer Simple XML Sitemap settings, alter inclusion settings of "
"content and generate sitemaps on demand."
msgstr ""
"Kudeatu Simple XML Sitemap ezarpenak, aldatu edukiaren barne sartze "
"ezarpenak eta sortu sitemapak eskaeran."

msgid "Regenerate all sitemaps after hitting <em>Save</em>"
msgstr "<em>Gorde</em> sakatu ondoren, berriz sortu gune-mapak guztiak"

msgid "Otherwise the sitemaps will be regenerated during a future cron run."
msgstr "Bestela, sitemap-ak berriz sortuko dira hurrengo cron exekuzio batean."

msgid ""
"The priority this <em>@bundle</em> entity will have in the eyes of "
"search engine bots."
msgstr ""
"Bilatzaileen bot-en begietan izango duen lehentasuna da "
"<em>@bundle</em> entitate honek izango duena."

msgid ""
"The frequency with which this <em>@bundle</em> entity changes. Search "
"engine bots may take this as an indication of how often to index it."
msgstr ""
"<em>@bundle</em> entitate honen aldaketa maiztasuna. Bilaketa-motorren "
"botek hau hartuko dute zehazteko zenbat maiz indexatu behar den."

msgid ""
"Determines if images referenced by this <em>@bundle</em> entity should "
"be included in the sitemap."
msgstr ""
"<em>@bundle</em> entitate honek aipatzen dituen irudiak sitemap-ean "
"sartu behar diren zehazten du."

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap (Search engines)"
msgstr "Simple XML Sitemap (Bilatzaileak)"

msgid "Search engine ID"
msgstr "Bilatzaile motorraren ID-a"

msgid "Last submitted"
msgstr "Azken ikusitakoa"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission settings"
msgstr "Bilatzaileentzako sitemap bidalketa ezarpenak"

msgid "Sitemap submission enabled"
msgstr "Gune-maparen aurkezpena aktibatuta"

msgid "Sitemap submission frequency"
msgstr "Webgunearen mapa bidalketa maiztasuna"

msgid "Sitemap search engine submission"
msgstr "Bilatzaileentzat sitemaparen bidalketa"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of links one sitemap can hold. If more links are "
"generated than set here, a sitemap index will be created and the links "
"split into several sub-sitemaps.<br>50 000 links is the maximum Google "
"will parse per sitemap, but choosing a lower value may be needed to "
"avoid PHP memory errors on huge sites.<br>If left blank, all links "
"will be shown on a single sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Sitemap batek izan ditzakeen esteken kopuru maximoa. Hemen ezarritako "
"baino esteka gehiago sortzen badira, sitemap indize bat sortuko da eta "
"estekak hainbat azpisitemapetan banatuko dira.<br>Google-k sitemap "
"bakoitzeko gehienez 50.000 esteka irakurriko ditu, baina balio "
"txikiago bat aukeratzea komeni izan daiteke PHPren memoria erroreak "
"saihesteko gune handietan.<br>Hutsik utziz gero, esteka guztiak "
"sitemap bakar batean erakutsiko dira."

msgid "Configure, add content to and generate XML sitemaps."
msgstr "Konfiguratu, gehitu edukia eta sortu XML sitemap-ak."

msgid "Disable language hreflang"
msgstr "Hizkuntza hreflang desgaitu"

msgid "Remove hreflang markup in HTML"
msgstr "HTML-n hreflang markaketa kendu"

msgid ""
"Google recommends displaying hreflang definitions either in the HTML "
"markup or in the sitemap, but not in both places.<br>If checked, "
"hreflang definitions created by the language module will be removed "
"from the markup reducing its size."
msgstr ""
"Google-k gomendatzen du hreflang definizioak HTML markatuan edo "
"sitemap-ean erakustea, baina ez bi lekutan.<br>Markatu bada, hizkuntza "
"moduluko hreflang definizioak markatuetatik kenduko dira, tamaina "
"murriztuz."

msgid "published on @time"
msgstr "argitaratua @time-an"

msgid "published on @time, regenerating"
msgstr "argitaratua @time, berreraikitzen"

msgid ""
"The number of entities to process in each queue item.<br>Increasing "
"this number will use more memory but will result in less queries "
"improving generation speed."
msgstr ""
"Prozesatu beharreko entitate kopurua lerroko zerrenda "
"bakoitzean.<br>Kopuru hau handitzeak memoria gehiago erabiliko du, "
"baina kontsulta gutxiago eragingo ditu eta horrek sortze-abiadura "
"hobetuko du."

msgid "@indexed out of @total total queue items have been processed."
msgstr "@total guztizko ilara elementuetatik @indexed elementu prozesatu dira."

msgid ""
"All variants belonging to the built-in \"Default hreflang\" sitemap "
"type have been converted to entities. Custom sitemap types added via "
"plugins will have to be recreated manually. See "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. The sitemaps need to be "
"regenerated now."
msgstr ""
"Eraiki barruan dagoen \"Default hreflang\" sitemap motari dagozkion "
"aldaera guztiak entitate bihurtu dira. Pluginen bidez gehitutako "
"sitemap pertsonalizatuak eskuz berrsortu beharko dira. Ikusi "
"simple_sitemap.type.default_hreflang.yml. Orain sitemap-ak berriro "
"sortu behar dira."

msgid "Sitemap types"
msgstr "Gune-maparen motak"

msgid "Sitemap generator"
msgstr "Gune-plan sortzailea"

msgid "URL generators"
msgstr "URL sortzaileak"

msgid "Simple XML sitemap type"
msgstr "Simple XML sitemap mota"

msgid "Add sitemap type"
msgstr "Gehitu sitemap mota"

msgid ""
"Choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to which search "
"engines.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Hautatu zein sitemap bidali behar diren zein "
"bilatzaileei.<br>Sitemap-ak <a href=\"@url\">hemen</a> konfiguratu "
"daitezke."

msgid "No sitemaps have been defined yet. <a href=\"@url\">Add a new one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Oraindik ez da inolako sitemap definitu. <a href=\"@url\">Gehitu berri "
"bat</a>."

msgid "Sitemap type"
msgstr "Gunearen mapa mota"

msgid ""
"No sitemap types have been defined yet. <a href=\"@url\">Add a new "
"one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Oraindik ez da inolako sitemap motarik definitu. <a "
"href=\"@url\">Gehitu berri bat</a>."

msgid "sitemap"
msgstr "gune-mapak"

msgid "sitemap type"
msgstr "orrialde-mapa mota"

msgid "sitemap types"
msgstr "orrien mapa motak"

msgid ""
"At least one sitemap needs to be defined for a bundle to be "
"indexable.<br>Sitemaps can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Gutxienez mapa bat definitu behar da multzo bat indexagarria "
"izateko.<br>Mapak hemen konfiguratu daitezke <a href=\"@url\">.</a>"

msgid "Sitemap type %label has been updated."
msgstr "%label Sitemap mota eguneratu da."

msgid "Sitemap type %label has been created."
msgstr "%label izeneko sitemap mota sortu da."

msgid ""
"@indexed out of @total queue items have been processed.<br>Each "
"sitemap is published after all of its items have been processed."
msgstr ""
"@indexed @total ilarako elementuetatik prozesatu dira.<br>Mapa orokor "
"bakoitza argitaratzen da bere elementu guztiak prozesatu ondoren."

msgid "Sitemap index generator"
msgstr "Sitemap indize sortzailea"

msgid ""
"In order to use the Simple XML Sitemap Views module, the Views URL "
"generator must be <a href=\"@url\">added</a> to a sitemap type."
msgstr ""
"Simple XML Sitemap Views modelua erabiltzeko, Views URL generatora "
"sitemap motari <a href=\"@url\">gehitu</a> behar zaio."

msgid ""
"Please configure at least one <a href=\"@sitemaps_url\">sitemap</a> to "
"be of a <a href=\"@types_url\">type</a> that implements the views URL "
"generator."
msgstr ""
"Mesedez, konfiguratu gutxienez <a "
"href=\"@sitemaps_url\">orrialde-mapa</a> bat <a "
"href=\"@types_url\">mota</a> batekoa izan dadin, eta motak "
"ikuspegiaren URLa sortzeko gaitasuna izan dezan."

msgid "Included in sitemaps: "
msgstr "Gune-mapetan sartuta:"

msgid "Excluded from all sitemaps"
msgstr "Guztizko sitemap guztietatik bazterturik"

msgid "No sitemaps have been selected for submission."
msgstr "Ezin dira sarrera egiteko sitemapik hautatu."

msgid "Index this display in sitemap <em>@variant_label</em>"
msgstr "<em>@variant_label</em> bistaratze hau gune-mapetan indexatu"

msgid "Default sitemap"
msgstr "Lehenetsitako webgune-mapaketa"

msgid ""
"This sitemap will be available under <em>/sitemap.xml</em> in addition "
"to its default path <em>/variant-name/sitemap.xml</em>.<br>Sitemaps "
"can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Sitemap hau eskuragarri egongo da <em>/sitemap.xml</em> helbidean, "
"bere bide nagusi <em>/variant-name/sitemap.xml</em> "
"aldean.<br>Sitemapak hemen <a href=\"@url\">konfiguratu daitezke</a>."

msgid ""
"Prevent per-sitemap duplicate links.<br>Unchecking this may help "
"avoiding PHP memory errors on huge sites."
msgstr ""
"Webgune bakoitzeko esteka bikoiztuak saihestu.<br>Hau desmarkatzeak "
"lagundu dezake PHP memoriaren akatsak ekiditen webgune handietan."

msgid ""
"The sitemap ID will be part of the URL and can only contain lowercase "
"letters, numbers, dashes and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Guneen mapa ID-a URLaren parte izango da eta letra xehezkoak, "
"zenbakiak, marrak eta azpimarrak soilik izan ditzake."

msgid ""
"The sitemap's type defines its looks and content. Sitemaps types can "
"be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mapa orriaren mota bere itxura eta edukia definitzen du. Mapa orri "
"motak <a href=\"@url\">hemen</a> konfiguratu daitezke."

msgid "Sitemap %label has been updated."
msgstr "%label gune-mapak eguneratua izan da."

msgid "Sitemap %label has been created."
msgstr "%label sitemap-a sortu da."

msgid ""
"Sitemaps of this type will be built according to the sitemap generator "
"plugin chosen here."
msgstr ""
"Mota honetako gune-mapak hemen hautatutako gune-mapak sortzeko "
"pluginaren arabera eraikiko dira."

msgid ""
"Sitemaps of this type will be populated with URLs generated by these "
"URL generator plugins."
msgstr ""
"Motako sitemap hauek URL generatzaile plugin hauen bidez sortutako "
"URLekin beteko dira."

msgid ""
"Processing items from the queue.<br>Each sitemap gets published after "
"all of its items have been processed."
msgstr ""
"Ilara osteko elementuak prozesatzen.<br>Elementu guztiak prozesatu "
"ondoren argitaratzen da bakoitzaren sitemap-a."

msgid "Indexed bundles"
msgstr "Indizatutako bildumak"

msgid "No supported entity types available."
msgstr "Ez dago onartzen diren entitate mota erabilgarri."

msgid "%bundle_label <span class=\"description\">(sitemaps: %sitemaps)</span>"
msgstr ""
"%bundle_label <span class=\"description\">(gune-mapa: "
"%sitemaps)</span>"

msgid "Configure %label entity type"
msgstr "Konfiguratu %label entitate mota"

msgid "IndexNow notification enabled"
msgstr "IndexNow jakinarazpena gaituta"

msgid "IndexNow notification disabled"
msgstr "IndexNow jakinarazpena desgaituta dago"

msgid "IndexNow"
msgstr "IndexNow"

msgid "Simple XML Sitemap IndexNow"
msgstr "XML Sitemap Erraza IndexNow"

msgid "Verification key in Drupal State"
msgstr "Drupal Egoerako egiaztapen giltza"

msgid "Verification key not available"
msgstr "Egiaztapen giltza ez dago erabilgarri"

msgid ""
"In order to generate a verification key for the IndexNow service and "
"choose which sitemaps are to be submitted to search engines, visit <a "
"href=\"@url\">this</a> configuration page."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow zerbitzuarentzat egiaztapen-gako bat sortzeko eta zein "
"sitemap bidali nahi diren bilatzaileetara aukeratzeko, bisitatu <a "
"href=\"@url\">konfigurazio orri hau</a>."

msgid ""
"Submits sitemaps to search engines and notifies IndexNow compatible "
"engines about changes to entities."
msgstr ""
"Guneko mapa bilatzaileei bidaltzen ditu eta IndexNow baterako makinaei "
"jakinarazten dizkie entitateetako aldaketak."

msgid "Index entity on save"
msgstr "Gordeetan indizearen entitatea"

msgid ""
"Allows optionally sending a change notice to IndexNow compatible "
"search engines on entity form save."
msgstr ""
"Entitatearen formularioa gordetzean, nahi izanez gero, aldaketa-oharra "
"IndexNow-rekin bateragarria den bilatzaileetara bidaltzea ahalbidetzen "
"du."

msgid "IndexNow URL"
msgstr "IndexNow URL"

msgid "IndexNow bundle settings"
msgstr "IndexNow bilduma ezarpenak"

msgid "IndexNow submission enabled"
msgstr "IndexNow bidalketa gaituta"

msgid "Selected engine for IndexNow submissions"
msgstr "IndexNow bidalketarako hautatutako motorra"

msgid "IndexNow on entity save"
msgstr "IndexNow entitate bat gordetzean"

msgid "No search engines supporting sitemap submission have been found."
msgstr "Ez da aurkitu sitemap bidalketa onartzen duten bilatzaile motorerik."

msgid "Sitemap submission is disabled."
msgstr "Gune-maparen bidalketa desgaituta dago."

msgid ""
"The last IndexNow submission was <em>@entity</em> to @engine_label on "
"@time"
msgstr ""
"Azken IndexNow bidalketa <em>@entity</em> izan zen @engine_label-n "
"@time-ean."

msgid "IndexNow settings can be configured <a href=\"@url\">here</a>."
msgstr "IndexNow ezarpenak <a href=\"@url\">hemen</a> konfiguratu daitezke."

msgid "No search engines supporting IndexNow have been found."
msgstr "IndexNow onartzen duten bilatzaile motorrik aurkitu ez da."

msgid "IndexNow submission is disabled."
msgstr "IndexNow bidalketa desgaituta dago."

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>by default</em>"
msgstr "IndexNow bilatzaileei aldaketak <em>lehentasunez</em> jakinarazi"

msgid "Notify IndexNow search engines of changes <em>now</em>"
msgstr "Notify IndexNow bilatzaileei aldaketak <em>orain</em> jakinarazi"

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms of this type.<br/>Changes include creating, "
"deleting and updating of an entity. This setting can be overridden on "
"the entity form."
msgstr ""
"Bidali aldaketa-oharra IndexNowkin bateragarria den bilatzaileei "
"entitate mota honen formularioak bidali ondoren.<br/>Aldaketak "
"entitate baten sortzea, ezabatzea eta eguneratzea barne hartzen ditu. "
"Ezarpen hau entitatearen formularioan gainidatz daiteke."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting this form."
msgstr ""
"Aldaketa jakinarazpena bidali IndexNow-rekin bateragarri dauden "
"bilatzaileei formulario hau bidali ondoren."

msgid "Sitemap submission settings"
msgstr "Gune-maparen bidalketa ezarpenak"

msgid "Submit sitemaps to search engines"
msgstr "Bilatzaileei sitemapak bidali"

msgid "IndexNow settings"
msgstr "IndexNow ezarpenak"

msgid "Submit changes to IndexNow capable engines"
msgstr "IndexNow gaitutako bilatzaileei aldaketak bidali"

msgid "Preferred IndexNow engine"
msgstr "IndexNow motor hobetsia"

msgid ""
"All IndexNow requests will be sent to the engine selected here. Only "
"one engine needs to be notified, as it will notify other IndexNow "
"compatible engines for you.<br/>For the sake of equality of "
"opportunity, <strong>consider leaving this at "
"<em>Random</em></strong>, so a random engine can be picked on each "
"submission."
msgstr ""
"IndexNow eskaera guztiak hemen hautatutako motorrerako bidaliko dira. "
"Motor bakar bat baino ez da jakinarazi behar, motor horrek beste "
"IndexNow bateragarri diren motorrak jakinaraziko "
"dizkizulako.<br/>Aukerak berdintzeko, <strong>gogoratu hau "
"<em>Aleatorioan</em> uztea</strong>, horrela bidalketa bakoitzean "
"motor aleatorio bat hautatuko da."

msgid "Index on every entity save operation"
msgstr "Entitate bakoitzaren gordetze operazioan indizea egin"

msgid ""
"If checked, all entity save operations for <a "
"href=\"@inclusion_url\">included entities</a> will trigger "
"notification of IndexNow search engines.<br/>If unchecked, this will "
"only be possible by adding/altering/deleting an entity through a "
"form.<br/>This should be unchecked if there are mass operations "
"performed on entities that are irrelevant to indexing."
msgstr ""
"Hautatuta badago, <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">barne hartutako "
"entitateen</a> gordetze operazio guztiak IndexNow bilaketa motorrei "
"jakinarazpena bidaliko diete.<br/>Hautatu gabe badago, hori soilik "
"posible izango da entitate bat formulario baten bidez "
