msgstr "Inprimaki sortzaileen konparazioa"

msgid ""
"Webform is much heavier; it has a great deal of functionality enabled "
"right within the one module, and that's on top of supplying all the "
"normal field elements (because it doesn't just use the Field API)"
msgstr ""
"Webform askoz astunagoa da; funtzionalitate handia du modu berean "
"aktibatuta, eta hori guztia elementu arrunt guztiak eskaintzeaz gain "
"da (ez duelako Field API soilik erabiltzen)."

msgid ""
"Please post comments and feedback to this <a href=\":href\">Google "
"Sheet</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mesedez, utzi iruzkinak eta iritziak hemen: <a href=\":href\">Google "
"Sheet</a>."

msgid ""
"The <a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> library is <a "
"href=\":external_href\">externally hosted libraries</a> and loaded via "
"a Content Delivery Network (CDN)."
msgstr ""
"<a href=\":homepage_href\">@title</a> liburutegia <a "
"href=\":external_href>kanpoko ostatutako liburutegiak</a> dira eta "
"Eduki Banaketa Sare baten (CDN) bidez kargatzen dira."

msgid ""
"A jQuery plugin that makes long, unwieldy select boxes much more "
"user-friendly."
msgstr ""
"jQuery plugin bat, aukeraketa-zorro luze eta zaila askoz "
"erabiltzaile-atartekoago bihurtzen duena."

msgid "Leave blank to use %email as the '@title' email."
msgstr "Utzi hutsik %email '@title' posta elektroniko gisa erabiltzeko."

msgid "File upload limit"
msgstr "Fitxategi igoeraren muga"

