"parameters. For example, appending "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 to a webform's URL would "
"set a submission's 'Submitted to' value to 'node:1'."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratuta badago, iturburu entitateak kontsulta katea parametroak "
"erabiliz bete daitezke. Adibidez, "
"?source_entity_type=node&source_entity_id=1 webformaren URLari "
"gehituz, bidalketa baten 'Submitted to' balioa 'node:1' izango "
"litzateke."

msgid ""
"Third party settings allow contrib and custom modules to define "
"webform specific customization settings."
msgstr ""
"Hirugarren aldeen ezarpenek aukera ematen diete kontribuziozko eta "
"pertsonalizatutako moduluei webformetan zehaztutako pertsonalizazio "
