msgid ""
"Here is a detailed feature-comparison of Webform and Contact Storage "
"8.x-1.x.&nbsp;It's worth noting that Contact Storage relies on the "
"Contact module which in turn relies on the Field UI; Contact Storage "
"out of the box is a minimalistic solution with limited (but useful!) "
"functionality. This means it can be extended with core mechanisms such "
"as CRUD entity hooks and overriding services; also there's a greater "
"chance that a general purpose module will play nicely with it (eg. the "
"Conditional Fields module is for entity form displays in general, not "
"the Contact module)."
msgstr ""
"Hona hemen Webform eta Contact Storage 8.x-1.x-en ezaugarri-konparazio "
"zehatz bat.&nbsp;Garrantzitsua da gogoratzea Contact Storage Contact "
"moduluan oinarritzen dela, eta honek, berriz, Field UI-n; Contact "
"Storage-k kutxatik atera bezain laster soluzio minimalista bat "
"eskaintzen du mugatutako (baina erabilgarri den!) "
"funtzionalitatearekin. Horrek esan nahi du oinarrizko mekanismoekin "
"luzatu daitekeela, hala nola CRUD entitate-hook-ak eta zerbitzuen "
"gainidazketa; baita modu handiagoan gerta daitekeela modulu orokor "
"batek ondo funtzionatzea honekin (adibidez, Conditional Fields "
"moduluak entitate-forma bistakuntzetarako diseinatuta dago orokorrean, "
"ez Contact modulurako)."

