"with other Bootstrap Framework related Themes (like Radix)."
msgstr ""
"Oharrak: Hau Drupal Bootstrap gaiarekin bakarrik erabili behar da, EZ "
"beste Bootstrap Frameworkarekin lotutako gai batzuekin (adibidez, "
"Radix)."

msgid "Send on (date / datetime string or [token])"
msgstr "Bidali (data / data-ordu-katea edo [token])"

msgid "Please delete submissions from the %title webform."
msgstr "Mesedez, ezabatu %title webformeko aurkezpenak."

msgid "%title webform has @total submissions."
msgstr "%title webformak @total bidalketa ditu."

msgid ""
"You may not delete %title webform until you have removed all of the "
"%title submissions."
msgstr ""
"Ezingo duzu %title webform-a ezabatu %title-ren bidalketak guztiak "
"kendu arte."

msgid ""
"Please make sure to install additional <a "
"href=\":libraries_href\">third-party libraries</a>, <a "
"href=\":submodules_href\">sub-modules</a> and optional <a "
"href=\":ecosystem_href\">add-ons</a>."
msgstr ""
"Mesedez, ziurtatu <a href=\":libraries_href\">hirugarrenen liburutegi "
"osagarriak</a>, <a href=\":submodules_href\">azpimoduak</a> eta "
"aukerazko <a href=\":ecosystem_href\">gehigarriak</a> instalatzea."

msgid "File upload limit per form message"
msgstr "Inprimaki bakoitzeko fitxategi igoeraren muga mezua"

msgid ""
"Enter message to be displayed when file upload limit is reached. You "
"may use %quota as a placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Sartu mezua fitxategi igotzeko muga gainditzen denean erakutsiko dena. "
"%quota erabil dezakezu lekuko gisa."

msgid ""
"You must allow users to post submissions from a dedicated URL to use "
"open this webform is a dialog."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaileek bidalketak egitea ahalbidetu behar duzu URL "
"espezifikotik, webformulario hau dialogo batean irekitzeko."

msgid "Please delete submissions from the selected webforms."
msgstr "Mesedez, ezabatu hautatutako webformulazioetatik bidalitakoak."

msgid "The selected webforms have a total of @total submissions."
msgstr "Aukeratutako webformularioek guztira @total bidalketa dituzte."

msgid ""
"You may not delete these webforms until there is less than @batch "
"total submissions."
msgstr ""
"Ez ditzakezu webformulario hauek ezabatu @batch guztira bidalketa "
"gutxiago egon arte."

msgid "Filter by data and/or notes"
msgstr "Iragazi datu eta/edo oharrez"

msgid ""
"If checked, support option, displayed on the <a "
"href=\":help_href\">Help</a> page will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratuta badago, <a href=\":help_href\">Laguntza</a> orrian agertzen "
"den laguntza aukera desgaituta egongo da."

msgid "Minimum amount of items displayed"
msgstr "Erakutsitako elementu kopuru minimoa"

msgid "Date part title display"
msgstr "Data zatia izenburua erakutsi"

msgid "Determines the placement of the title for date parts."
msgstr "Data zatiko izenburuen kokapena zehazten du."

msgid ""
"For more advanced use-cases like rendered entities or more complex "
"entity filtering or sorting, you may want to use the \"Views: Filter "
"by an entity reference view\" reference method."
msgstr ""
"Kasualitate aurreratuagoetarako, hala nola entitate erreprodukzituak "
"edo entitate iragazketa edo sailkapen konplexuagoak, \"Views: Filter "
"by an entity reference view\" erreferentzia-metodoa erabiltzea nahi "
"dezakezu."

msgid "Justify content"
msgstr "Edukiaren justifikazioa"

msgid "Space between (space-between)"
msgstr "Tartea artean (space-between)"

msgid "Space around (space-around)"
msgstr "Inguru espazioa (space-around)"

msgid "Terms display"
msgstr "Baldintzak erakutsi"

msgid "Terms link"
msgstr "Baldintzen esteka"

msgid "Enter the URL or path of the terms of service."
msgstr "Sartu zerbitzu-baldintzen URL-a edo bidea."

msgid "Terms link target"
msgstr "Helbidearen helburua - Baldintzak"

msgid "Language to render this email"
msgstr "Posta elektroniko hau bistaratuko duen hizkuntza"

msgid "Select the language that will be used to render this email."
msgstr ""
"Hautatu posta elektroniko hau bistaratzerakoan erabiliko den "
"hizkuntza."

msgid "Enter custom data that will be included in all remote CRUD requests."
msgstr ""
"Sartu datu pertsonalizatuak, urruneko CRUD eskaera guztietan sartuko "
"direnak."

msgid ""
"If checked, elements with 'Display element' unchecked (i.e., "
"<code>'#access': false</code> will not be included in the request "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Aukeratuta badago, 'Erakutsi elementua' markarik ez duen elementurik "
"(hau da, <code>'#access': false</code>) ez da eskariaren datuetan "
"sartuko."

msgid "Remote CRUD request return @status_code status code."
msgstr "Urruneko CRUD eskaerak @status_code egoera-kodea itzultzen du."

msgid "Remote HTTP operation successful!"
msgstr "HTTP urruneko eragiketa arrakastatsua!"

msgid "Debug: Remote HTTP operation: @title [@state]"
msgstr "Debug: HTTP urruneko eragiketa: @title [@state]"

msgid "Remote HTTP Operations"
msgstr "Urruneko HTTP Eragiketak"

msgid ""
"Execute HTTP operation <small>(GET, POST, PUT, or PATCH request "
"methods)</small> to a URL, (optionally) including the webform "
"submissions."
msgstr ""
"HTTP eragiketa gauzatu <small>(GET, POST, PUT edo PATCH eskaera "
"metodoak)</small> URL batera, (aukeraz) webformako bidalketak barne."

