msgid ""
"Exclude individual content that has the Robots meta tag with "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Banatu edukia, meta Robots etiketa duen horrek <em>Bilatzaileek orri "
"hau ez indeksatzeko saihesten du</em>."

msgid ""
"The minimum amount of time that will elapse before the sitemaps are "
"regenerated. The sitemaps will also only be regenerated on cron if any "
"links have been added, updated, or deleted.<br />Recommended value: "
"<em>1 day</em>."
msgstr ""
"Sitemapak berriro sortu arte igaroko den gutxieneko denbora. Sitemapak "
"cron-ean soilik berriro sortuko dira estekak gehitu, eguneratu edo "
"ezabatu badira.<br />Gomendatutako balioa: <em>1 egun</em>."

msgid ""
"Exclude individual items that has the Robots meta tag set to "
"<em>Prevents search engines from indexing this page</em>."
msgstr ""
"Baztertu Robots meta etiketarekin <em>Orrialde hau bilatzaileek ez "
"indeksatzera saihesten du</em> ezarrita duten elementu indibidualak."

msgid ""
"Note this will ignore default metatags, only when items have "
"overridden the Robots meta tag."
msgstr ""
"Kontuan izan honek lehenetsitako metatag-ak alde batera utziko "
"dituela, meta Robots tag-a gainditu duten elementuetan bakarrik."

msgid ""
"This can be disabled if other methods are being used to generate the "
"sitemap files, i.e. the <code>drush xmlsitemap:regenerate</code> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Hau desgaitu daiteke weborrien maparen fitxategiak sortzeko beste "
"metodo batzuk erabiltzen ari diren kasuetan, hau da, <code>drush "
"xmlsitemap:regenerate</code> komandoa."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap automatically creates a sitemap that conforms to the "
"sitemaps.org specification. This helps search engines keep their "
"search results up to date."
msgstr ""
"XML Sitemap automatikoki sortzen du sitemaps.org zehaztapenean "
"oinarritutako sitemap bat. Honek bilatzaileei laguntzen die haien "
"bilaketaren emaitzak eguneratuta mantentzen."

msgid ""
"You can adjust the settings for your site's sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Your can view your site's sitemap at "
"http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml."
msgstr ""
"Zure guneko sitemaparen ezarpenak doitu ditzakezu helbidean "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap. Zure gunearen sitemap-a ikusi dezakezu "
"http://yoursite.com/sitemap.xml helbidean."

msgid ""
"When is necessary you can rebuild your sitemap at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Beharrezkoa denean, zure sitemap berreraiki dezakezu helbidean: "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/rebuild."

msgid ""
"You can configure all Custom Entities Settings at "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings"
msgstr ""
"Custom Entities Settings guztiak konfiguratu ditzakezu hemen: "
"admin/config/search/xmlsitemap/entities/settings"

msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that you have clean URLs enabled for this "
"project."
msgstr "Proiektu honetarako URL garbiak gaituta izatea oso gomendagarria da."

msgid ""
"This action rebuilds your site's XML Sitemap and regenerates the "
"cached files, and may be a lengthy process. If you just installed XML "
"Sitemap, this can be helpful to import all your site's content into "
"the sitemap. Otherwise, this should only be used in emergencies."
msgstr ""
"Ekintza honek zure gunean XML Sitemap berreraikiko du eta cacheatutako "
"fitxategiak berriz sortuko ditu, eta prozesu luzea izan daiteke. XML "
"Sitemap berriki instalatu baduzu, hau lagungarria izan daiteke zure "
"guneko eduki guztiak sitemap-era inportatzeko. Bestela, larrialdietan "
"bakarrik erabili behar da."

msgid ""
"XML Sitemap settings have been modified and the files should be "
"regenerated. You can <a href=\"@run-cron\">run cron manually</a> to "
"regenerate the cached files."
msgstr ""
"XML Sitemap-en ezarpenak aldatu dira eta fitxategiak berriro sortu "
"beharko lirateke. <a href=\"@run-cron\">Kronoa eskuz abiarazi</a> "
"dezakezu fitxategi cacheatuak berriro sortzeko."

msgid ""
"One or more problems were detected with your XML Sitemap "
"configuration: @messages"
msgstr ""
"Zure XML Sitemap konfigurazioarekin arazo bat edo gehiago detektatu "
"dira: @messages"

msgid ""
"Creates an XML Sitemap conforming to the <a "
"href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">sitemaps.org protocol</a>."
msgstr ""
"<|TRANSLATE|> <a href=\"http://sitemaps.org/\">sitemaps.org "
"protokoloa</a> betetzen duen XML Sitemap bat sortzen du."

msgid ""
"Configure XML Sitemap settings, select which links are included in "
"sitemap."
msgstr ""
"XML Sitemap ezarpenak konfiguratu, zein estekak sitemap-ean sartu "
"behar diren hautatu."

msgid "XML Sitemap entity bundle settings"
msgstr "XML Sitemap erakunde-paketeen ezarpenak"

msgid "Starting XML Sitemap generation. Memory usage: @memory-peak."
msgstr "XML Sitemap sortzen hastear. Memoriaren erabilera: @memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Finished XML Sitemap generation in @elapsed. Memory usage: "
"@memory-peak."
msgstr ""
"@elapsed-an XML Sitemap generationa amaitu da. Memoriaren erabilera: "
"@memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Generated by the <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML Sitemap "
"module</a>."
msgstr "<a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML Sitemap module</a>-ak sortua."

msgid "Label for the XML Sitemap."
msgstr "XML Sitemap-en etiketa."

msgid "There are currently no XML Sitemap contexts available."
msgstr "Uneko momentuan ez dago eskuragarri XML Sitemap testuingururik."

msgid "@bundle XML Sitemap settings"
msgstr "@bundle XML Sitemap ezarpenak"

msgid "XML Sitemap settings for the %bundle have been saved."
msgstr "%bundle-ren XML Sitemap ezarpenak gordeta geratu dira."

msgid ""
"A rebuild is not necessary. If you are just wanting to regenerate the "
"XML Sitemap files, you can <a href=\"@link-cron\">run cron "
"manually</a>."
msgstr ""
"Berreraikitzea ez da beharrezkoa. XML Sitemap fitxategiak berriz sortu "
"nahi badituzu, <a href=\"@link-cron\">cron eskuz exekutatu</a> "
"dezakezu."

msgid ""
"When enabled, this will add formatting and tables with sorting to make "
"it easier to view the XML Sitemap data instead of viewing raw XML "
"output. Search engines will ignore this."
msgstr ""
"Gaituta dagoenean, honek formateaketa eta sailkapenarekin taulak "
"gehituko ditu, XML Sitemap datuak modu errazagoan ikusteko, XML "
"gordinaren emaitza ikusi beharrean. Bilatzaileek hau ez dute kontuan "
"hartuko."

msgid ""
"Subdirectory where the sitemap data will be stored. This folder "
"<strong>must not be shared</strong> with any other Drupal site or "
"install using XML Sitemap."
msgstr ""
"Sitemap datuak gordeko diren azpidirektorioa. Karpeta honek <strong>ez "
"du beste inolako Drupal gune edo instalazio batekin XML Sitemap "
"erabiliz partekatu behar</strong>."

msgid "Override XML sitemap link settings"
msgstr "XML sitemapeko esteka ezarpenak gainidatzi"

msgid "Override XML sitemap settings for individual links/entities."
msgstr "Lotura/elementu bakoitzerako XML sitemap ezarpenak gainidatzi."

